</ol><pre><div class="not-prose my-0 flex w-full flex-col overflow-clip border border-border text-text-primary rounded-lg not-prose relative" data-code-block="true"><div class="border-border flex items-center justify-between border-b px-4 py-2"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg width="14" stroke-width="1.5" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-text-secondary"><path d="M9.00001 21L8.00001 21C6.89544 21 6.00001 20.1057 6.00001 19.0011C6.00001 17.4501 6.00001 15.3443 6 14C6 13 4.5 12 4.5 12C4.5 12 6.00001 11 6.00001 10C6.00001 8.827 6.00001 6.62207 6.00001 4.99914C6.00001 3.89457 6.89544 3 8.00001 3L9.00001 3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M15 21L16 21C17.1046 21 18 20.1057 18 19.0011C18 17.4501 18 15.3443 18 14C18 13 19.5 12 19.5 12C19.5 12 18 11 18 10C18 8.827 18 6.62207 18 4.99914C18 3.89457 17.1046 3 16 3L15 3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span class="text-text-secondary text-sm font-medium">text</span></div><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-surface-primary disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 text-sm text-interactive-active hover:text-interactive-normal active:text-text-tertiary font-normal relative rounded-lg p-[6px]" type="button" data-state="closed" data-slot="tooltip-trigger"><svg width="16" height="16" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-interactive-positive absolute inset-0 m-auto rotate-90 opacity-0 transition-all duration-300"><path d="M5 13L9 17L19 7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><svg width="16" height="16" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="absolute inset-0 m-auto opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300"><path d="M19.4 20H9.6C9.26863 20 9 19.7314 9 19.4V9.6C9 9.26863 9.26863 9 9.6 9H19.4C19.7314 9 20 9.26863 20 9.6V19.4C20 19.7314 19.7314 20 19.4 20Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M15 9V4.6C15 4.26863 14.7314 4 14.4 4H4.6C4.26863 4 4 4.26863 4 4.6V14.4C4 14.7314 4.26863 15 4.6 15H9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button></div><div class="code-block_container__lbMX4"><pre class="shiki github-dark shiki-code-block" style="background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8" tabindex="0"><code class="whitespace-pre-wrap break-words"><span class="line"><span>"""</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>AI Studio — Streamlit</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>Tab 1: Image generation (Cloudflare Workers AI / FLUX)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>Tab 2: Long-context chat (Groq / Moonshot Kimi K2)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>Public-ready: credentials only from Streamlit Secrets.</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>UI: bilingual ID + EN</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>"""</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>from __future__ import annotations</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>import base64</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>import html</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>import io</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>import time</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>from datetime import datetime</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>import requests</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>import streamlit as st</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>from openai import OpenAI</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>from PIL import Image</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>from styles import inject_glass_theme</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span># ---------------------------------------------------------------------------</span></span>
<span class="line"><span># Page</span></span>
<span class="line"><span># ---------------------------------------------------------------------------</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>st.set_page_config(</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    page_title="AI Studio",</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    page_icon="✨",</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    layout="centered",</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    initial_sidebar_state="collapsed",</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span># Apply glass modern theme ASAP (after page config)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>inject_glass_theme()</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span># Cloudflare image</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>CF_API_BASE = "https://api.cloudflare.com/client/v4/accounts"</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>CF_IMAGE_MODEL = "@cf/black-forest-labs/flux-1-schnell"</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>CF_DEFAULT_STEPS = 4</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>IMAGE_MIN_LOADING_SECONDS = 10</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span># Chat thinking sequence (~15s total): (label, hold_seconds)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span># Each line fades in (~1.1s CSS), then holds for the step duration.</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>CHAT_THINK_STEPS: list[tuple[str, float]] = [</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    ("Mencerna pertanyaan.....", 3.0),</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    ("Observaching.......", 3.0),</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    ("Ask yuki.ai.....", 2.0),</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    ("Ask aira.ai......", 2.0),</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    ("Memutar otak.....", 3.0),</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    ("Menyusun jawaban.....", 2.0),</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>]  # sum = 15s</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>THINK_FADE_SECONDS = 1.1</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>THINK_TOTAL_SECONDS = sum(d for _, d in CHAT_THINK_STEPS)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span># Groq chat — long context</span></span>
<span class="line"><span># NOTE (2026): moonshotai/kimi-k2-instruct and kimi-k2-instruct-0905 were</span></span>
<span class="line"><span># deprecated/shutdown on Groq. Production long-context default:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>GROQ_BASE_URL = "https://api.groq.com/openai/v1"</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>GROQ_MODEL = "openai/gpt-oss-120b"  # ~131K context, production</span></span>
<span class="line"><span># Tried in order if the preferred model is gone / not found</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>GROQ_MODEL_FALLBACKS = (</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    "openai/gpt-oss-120b",</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    "qwen/qwen3.6-27b",</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    "openai/gpt-oss-20b",</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span># Keep last N messages sent to API (user+assistant turns)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>MAX_HISTORY_MESSAGES = 40</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>SYSTEM_PROMPT = (</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    "You are a helpful assistant. Reply clearly and concisely unless the user "</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    "asks for detail. The user may write in Indonesian or English — mirror their language. "</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    "You handle long context well; stay coherent across the conversation."</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>def t(id_text: str, en_text: str) -&gt; str:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    return f"{id_text} / {en_text}"</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>def init_state() -&gt; None:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    defaults = {</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        # image</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        "img_bytes": None,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        "img_prompt": "",</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        "img_error": None,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        # chat</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        "chat_messages": [],  # list[{role, content}]</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        "chat_error": None,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    }</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    for k, v in defaults.items():</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        if k not in st.session_state:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            st.session_state[k] = v</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>init_state()</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span># ---------------------------------------------------------------------------</span></span>
<span class="line"><span># Secrets</span></span>
<span class="line"><span># ---------------------------------------------------------------------------</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>def _secret_flat(*keys: str) -&gt; str:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    try:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        for key in keys:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            if key in st.secrets:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                val = st.secrets.get(key)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                if val is not None and str(val).strip():</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                    return str(val).strip()</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    except Exception:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        pass</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    return ""</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>def _secret_nested(sections: tuple[str, ...], nested_keys: tuple[str, ...]) -&gt; str:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    try:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        for section in sections:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            if section not in st.secrets:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                continue</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            block = st.secrets[section]</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            for nk in nested_keys:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                try:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                    val = block[nk]</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                except Exception:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                    continue</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                if val is not None and str(val).strip():</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                    return str(val).strip()</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    except Exception:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        pass</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    return ""</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>def load_cf_credentials() -&gt; tuple[str, str]:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    account = _secret_flat("CF_ACCOUNT_ID", "CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID", "ACCOUNT_ID")</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    if not account:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        account = _secret_nested(</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            ("cloudflare", "cf", "CLOUDFLARE"),</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            ("account_id", "ACCOUNT_ID", "CF_ACCOUNT_ID", "CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID"),</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        )</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    token = _secret_flat("CF_API_TOKEN", "CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN")</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    if not token:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        token = _secret_nested(</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            ("cloudflare", "cf", "CLOUDFLARE"),</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            ("api_token", "API_TOKEN", "CF_API_TOKEN", "CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN", "token"),</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        )</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    return account, token</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>def load_groq_key() -&gt; str:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    key = _secret_flat("GROQ_API_KEY", "GROQ_KEY")</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    if not key:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        key = _secret_nested(</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            ("groq", "GROQ"),</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            ("api_key", "API_KEY", "GROQ_API_KEY", "key"),</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        )</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    return key</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>def load_groq_model() -&gt; str:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    model = _secret_flat("GROQ_MODEL")</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    if not model:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        model = _secret_nested(("groq", "GROQ"), ("model", "MODEL", "GROQ_MODEL"))</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    return model or GROQ_MODEL</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span># ---------------------------------------------------------------------------</span></span>
<span class="line"><span># Public-friendly errors</span></span>
<span class="line"><span># ---------------------------------------------------------------------------</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>def public_error_image(status: int | None, body: str, exc: Exception | None = None) -&gt; str:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    text = (body or str(exc or "")).lower()</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    if status in (401, 403) or "authentication" in text or "forbidden" in text or "permission" in text:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        return t(</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            "⚠️ Layanan gambar sedang tidak tersedia. Coba lagi nanti.",</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            "⚠️ Image service is unavailable. Please try again later.",</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        )</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    if status == 429 or "rate" in text or "neuron" in text or "quota" in text:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        return t(</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            "⏳ Kuota gambar harian sedang penuh. Coba lagi nanti.",</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            "⏳ Daily image quota is full. Please try again later.",</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        )</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    if "timeout" in text:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        return t(</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            "⌛ Server terlalu lama merespons. Coba lagi.",</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            "⌛ Server timed out. Please try again.",</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        )</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    return t(</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        "❌ Gagal membuat gambar. Coba prompt lain atau ulangi sebentar lagi.",</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        "❌ Failed to generate image. Try another prompt or retry shortly.",</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    )</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>def public_error_chat(exc: Exception) -&gt; str:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    text = str(exc).lower()</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    status = getattr(exc, "status_code", None)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    code = ""</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    try:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        body = getattr(exc, "body", None) or {}</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        if isinstance(body, dict):</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            err = body.get("error") or body</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            if isinstance(err, dict):</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                code = str(err.get("code") or err.get("type") or "").lower()</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    except Exception:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        pass</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    if (</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        status == 401</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        or "401" in text</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        or "invalid_api_key" in text</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        or "invalid api key" in text</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        or "authentication" in text</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        or "unauthorized" in text</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    ):</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        return t(</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            "⚠️ Layanan chat sedang tidak tersedia (konfigurasi). Coba lagi nanti.",</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            "⚠️ Chat service unavailable (configuration). Please try again later.",</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        )</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    if (</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        status == 404</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        or "model_not_found" in text</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        or "does not exist" in text</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        or "model_decommissioned" in text</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        or "decommissioned" in text</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        or code == "model_not_found"</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    ):</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        return t(</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            "⚠️ Model chat tidak tersedia lagi di provider. Pemilik app perlu update model.",</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            "⚠️ Chat model is no longer available. The app owner needs to update the model.",</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        )</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    if status == 429 or "429" in text or "rate_limit" in text or "rate limit" in text or "quota" in text:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        return t(</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            "⏳ Kuota chat sedang penuh. Coba lagi nanti.",</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            "⏳ Chat quota is full right now. Please try again later.",</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        )</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    if "timeout" in text:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        return t(</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            "⌛ Respons terlalu lama. Coba lagi.",</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            "⌛ Response timed out. Please try again.",</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        )</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    return t(</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        "❌ Gagal membalas. Coba kirim ulang atau clear chat.",</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        "❌ Failed to reply. Resend or clear the chat.",</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    )</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>def _is_model_unavailable_error(exc: Exception) -&gt; bool:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    text = str(exc).lower()</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    status = getattr(exc, "status_code", None)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    return (</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        status == 404</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        or "model_not_found" in text</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        or "does not exist" in text</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        or "model_decommissioned" in text</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        or "decommissioned" in text</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        or "not_found" in text and "model" in text</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    )</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span># ---------------------------------------------------------------------------</span></span>
<span class="line"><span># Image generation (Cloudflare)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span># ---------------------------------------------------------------------------</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>def extract_image_bytes(payload: dict) -&gt; bytes:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    if not isinstance(payload, dict):</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        raise RuntimeError("invalid response")</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    if payload.get("success") is False:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        raise RuntimeError(str(payload.get("errors") or payload))</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    result = payload.get("result", payload)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    if isinstance(result, str):</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        b64 = result</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    elif isinstance(result, dict):</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        b64 = result.get("image") or result.get("b64_json") or result.get("base64")</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        if b64 is None and isinstance(result.get("data"), list) and result["data"]:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            first = result["data"][0]</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            if isinstance(first, dict):</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                b64 = first.get("b64_json") or first.get("image")</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            elif isinstance(first, str):</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                b64 = first</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        if b64 is None:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            nested = result.get("result")</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            if isinstance(nested, dict):</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                b64 = nested.get("image")</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            elif isinstance(nested, str):</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                b64 = nested</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    else:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        b64 = None</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    if not b64 or not isinstance(b64, str):</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        raise RuntimeError("no image")</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    if "," in b64 and b64.strip().lower().startswith("data:"):</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        b64 = b64.split(",", 1)[1]</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    raw = base64.b64decode(b64, validate=False)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    if not raw:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        raise RuntimeError("empty image")</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    try:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        im = Image.open(io.BytesIO(raw))</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        if im.mode not in ("RGB", "RGBA"):</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            im = im.convert("RGBA" if "A" in im.getbands() else "RGB")</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        buf = io.BytesIO()</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        im.save(buf, format="PNG")</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        return buf.getvalue()</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    except Exception:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        return raw</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>def generate_image(account_id: str, api_token: str, prompt: str) -&gt; bytes:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    url = f"{CF_API_BASE}/{account_id.strip()}/ai/run/{CF_IMAGE_MODEL}"</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    headers = {</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        "Authorization": f"Bearer {api_token.strip()}",</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        "Content-Type": "application/json",</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    }</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    body = {"prompt": prompt, "steps": CF_DEFAULT_STEPS}</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    try:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        resp = requests.post(url, headers=headers, json=body, timeout=180)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    except requests.Timeout as e:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        raise RuntimeError("timeout") from e</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    except requests.RequestException as e:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        raise RuntimeError(str(e)) from e</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    content_type = (resp.headers.get("Content-Type") or "").lower()</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    if "image/" in content_type:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        if resp.status_code &gt;= 400:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            raise RuntimeError(public_error_image(resp.status_code, resp.text[:400]))</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        raw = resp.content</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        try:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            im = Image.open(io.BytesIO(raw))</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            buf = io.BytesIO()</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            im.save(buf, format="PNG")</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            return buf.getvalue()</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        except Exception:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            return raw</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    try:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        payload = resp.json()</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    except Exception:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        if resp.status_code &gt;= 400:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            raise RuntimeError(public_error_image(resp.status_code, resp.text[:400]))</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        raise RuntimeError("invalid response")</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    if resp.status_code &gt;= 400:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        err = payload.get("errors") if isinstance(payload, dict) else payload</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        raise RuntimeError(public_error_image(resp.status_code, str(err)[:400]))</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    return extract_image_bytes(payload)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span># ---------------------------------------------------------------------------</span></span>
<span class="line"><span># Chat (Groq / Moonshot Kimi K2)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span># ---------------------------------------------------------------------------</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>def build_chat_client(api_key: str) -&gt; OpenAI:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    return OpenAI(api_key=api_key, base_url=GROQ_BASE_URL)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>def messages_for_api(history: list[dict]) -&gt; list[dict]:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    """System + trimmed history for long-context but free-tier friendly sends."""</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    trimmed = history[-MAX_HISTORY_MESSAGES:]</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    return [{"role": "system", "content": SYSTEM_PROMPT}, *trimmed]</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>def resolve_model_chain(preferred: str) -&gt; list[str]:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    """Preferred model first, then unique fallbacks."""</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    chain: list[str] = []</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    for m in (preferred, *GROQ_MODEL_FALLBACKS):</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        if m and m not in chain:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            chain.append(m)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    return chain</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>def stream_chat_reply(client: OpenAI, model: str, history: list[dict]):</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    """Yield text chunks from Groq streaming chat completion."""</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    stream = client.chat.completions.create(</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        model=model,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        messages=messages_for_api(history),</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        temperature=0.7,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        stream=True,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    )</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    for chunk in stream:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        try:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            delta = chunk.choices[0].delta</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            piece = getattr(delta, "content", None)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            if piece:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                yield piece</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        except Exception:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            continue</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>def stream_chat_with_fallback(client: OpenAI, preferred_model: str, history: list[dict]):</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    """</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    Try preferred model, then fallbacks if model is deprecated/missing.</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    Yields text chunks from the first model that accepts the request.</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    """</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    last_exc: Exception | None = None</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    for model in resolve_model_chain(preferred_model):</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        try:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            # Prime the stream — failure often happens on first iteration / create()</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            stream_iter = stream_chat_reply(client, model, history)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            first = next(stream_iter, None)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            if first:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                yield first</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            for piece in stream_iter:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                yield piece</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            return</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        except Exception as e:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            last_exc = e</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            if _is_model_unavailable_error(e):</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                continue  # try next model</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            raise</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    if last_exc:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        raise last_exc</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    raise RuntimeError("no chat model available")</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span># ---------------------------------------------------------------------------</span></span>
<span class="line"><span># Cinematic loaders (image shimmer + chat thinking)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span># ---------------------------------------------------------------------------</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>def image_loader_html(label: str | None = None) -&gt; str:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    label = label or t("Membuat gambar Anda", "Creating your image")</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    return f"""</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>&lt;div class="img-loader"&gt;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>  &lt;div class="img-loader-label"&gt;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    &lt;span class="img-loader-dots" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    &lt;span&gt;{html.escape(label)}&lt;/span&gt;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>  &lt;/div&gt;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>  &lt;div class="img-shimmer-box" role="status" aria-label="loading"&gt;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    &lt;div class="img-shimmer-glare"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    &lt;div class="img-shimmer-glare-2"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>  &lt;/div&gt;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>&lt;/div&gt;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>"""</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>def thinking_html(steps_shown: list[str], active_index: int, progress_pct: float) -&gt; str:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    """Build thinking panel; active line gets fade-in + shimmer text + progress."""</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    rows: list[str] = []</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    for i, text in enumerate(steps_shown):</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        if i &lt; active_index:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            state = "done show"</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        elif i == active_index:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            state = "active show"</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        else:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            state = ""</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        rows.append(</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            f'&lt;div class="think-line {state}"&gt;'</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            f'&lt;span class="dot"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;'</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            f'&lt;span class="label"&gt;{html.escape(text)}&lt;/span&gt;'</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            f"&lt;/div&gt;"</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        )</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    title = html.escape(t("Proses berpikir", "Thinking process"))</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    pct = max(0.0, min(100.0, float(progress_pct)))</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    return f"""</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>&lt;div class="think-panel"&gt;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>  &lt;div class="think-inner"&gt;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    &lt;div class="think-header"&gt;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>      &lt;div class="think-orb" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>      &lt;div class="think-title-wrap"&gt;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        &lt;div class="think-title"&gt;{title} · {pct:.0f}%&lt;/div&gt;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        &lt;div class="think-progress"&gt;&lt;i style="--p:{pct:.1f}%;width:{pct:.1f}%;"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>      &lt;/div&gt;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    &lt;/div&gt;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    {"".join(rows)}</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>  &lt;/div&gt;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>&lt;/div&gt;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>"""</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>def run_chat_thinking_animation(placeholder) -&gt; None:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    """</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    Show each thinking step with fade-in + progress bar.</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    Total ≈ 15 seconds (sum of CHAT_THINK_STEPS).</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    """</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    shown: list[str] = []</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    elapsed = 0.0</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    total = float(THINK_TOTAL_SECONDS) or 15.0</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    for idx, (label, hold) in enumerate(CHAT_THINK_STEPS):</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        shown.append(label)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        # progress at start of this step</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        pct = (elapsed / total) * 100.0</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        placeholder.markdown(</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            thinking_html(shown, active_index=idx, progress_pct=pct),</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            unsafe_allow_html=True,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        )</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        step = max(float(hold), THINK_FADE_SECONDS)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        # Mid-step progress bump for smoother bar</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        mid = step * 0.55</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        time.sleep(mid)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        elapsed_mid = elapsed + mid</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        placeholder.markdown(</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            thinking_html(</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                shown,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                active_index=idx,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                progress_pct=(elapsed_mid / total) * 100.0,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            ),</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            unsafe_allow_html=True,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        )</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        time.sleep(step - mid)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        elapsed += step</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    placeholder.markdown(</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        thinking_html(shown, active_index=len(shown), progress_pct=100.0),</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        unsafe_allow_html=True,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    )</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    time.sleep(0.25)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>def format_bubble_text(text: str) -&gt; str:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    """Escape HTML and keep simple line breaks for custom bubbles."""</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    safe = html.escape(text or "")</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    return safe.replace("\n", "</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>")</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>def chat_bubble_html(role: str, content: str) -&gt; str:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    """</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    WhatsApp layout with INLINE styles only (no CSS class dependency):</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    - AI   → LEFT  : [avatar][bubble]</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    - User → RIGHT : [bubble][avatar]  (avatar di paling kanan)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    Uses a full-width div + text-align (works inside Streamlit markdown on mobile).</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    Avoids &lt;table&gt; (often stripped by Streamlit HTML sanitizer).</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    """</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    body = format_bubble_text(content)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    is_user = role == "user"</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    av_base = (</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        "display:inline-block;width:34px;height:34px;line-height:34px;"</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        "text-align:center;border-radius:50%;vertical-align:bottom;"</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        "border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.18);font-size:16px;"</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        "box-sizing:border-box;"</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    )</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    if is_user:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        bubble_style = (</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            "display:inline-block;max-width:72%;vertical-align:bottom;"</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            "padding:10px 14px;border-radius:18px 18px 4px 18px;"</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            "border:1px solid rgba(37,211,102,0.45);"</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            "background:linear-gradient(145deg,rgba(37,211,102,0.40),rgba(18,140,126,0.24));"</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            "color:#eef2ff;font-size:15px;line-height:1.45;text-align:left;"</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            "white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;overflow-wrap:anywhere;"</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            "box-shadow:0 8px 22px rgba(0,0,0,0.22);box-sizing:border-box;"</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        )</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        avatar = (</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            f'&lt;span style="{av_base}margin-left:8px;'</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            f'background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(37,211,102,0.7),rgba(18,140,126,0.5));"&gt;'</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            f"🙂&lt;/span&gt;"</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        )</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        # bubble dulu, avatar di paling kanan</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        inner = f'&lt;span style="{bubble_style}"&gt;{body}&lt;/span&gt;{avatar}'</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        align = "right"</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    else:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        bubble_style = (</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            "display:inline-block;max-width:72%;vertical-align:bottom;"</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            "padding:10px 14px;border-radius:18px 18px 18px 4px;"</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            "border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.22);"</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            "background:linear-gradient(125deg,rgba(139,124,255,0.52),rgba(244,114,182,0.34),"</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            "rgba(34,211,238,0.36),rgba(167,139,250,0.42));"</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            "color:#eef2ff;font-size:15px;line-height:1.45;text-align:left;"</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            "white-space:normal;word-break:break-word;overflow-wrap:anywhere;"</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            "box-shadow:0 10px 28px rgba(139,124,255,0.25);box-sizing:border-box;"</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        )</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        avatar = (</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            f'&lt;span style="{av_base}margin-right:8px;'</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            f'background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(139,124,255,0.8),rgba(34,211,238,0.5));"&gt;'</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            f"✨&lt;/span&gt;"</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        )</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        # avatar kiri, bubble kanan avatar</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        inner = f'{avatar}&lt;span style="{bubble_style}"&gt;{body}&lt;/span&gt;'</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        align = "left"</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    return (</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        f'&lt;div style="display:block;width:100%;text-align:{align};'</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        f'margin:0 0 12px 0;box-sizing:border-box;"&gt;'</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        f"{inner}"</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        f"&lt;/div&gt;"</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    )</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>def render_chat_history(messages: list[dict]) -&gt; None:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    if not messages:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        return</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    html_block = "".join(</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        chat_bubble_html(m.get("role", "assistant"), m.get("content", ""))</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        for m in messages</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    )</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    st.markdown(</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        f'&lt;div style="display:block;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;"&gt;{html_block}&lt;/div&gt;',</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        unsafe_allow_html=True,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    )</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>def generate_image_with_min_delay(</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    account_id: str,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    api_token: str,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    prompt: str,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    loader_slot,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    min_seconds: float = IMAGE_MIN_LOADING_SECONDS,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>) -&gt; bytes:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    """Show shimmer loader, generate image, enforce minimum loading time."""</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    loader_slot.markdown(image_loader_html(), unsafe_allow_html=True)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    t0 = time.time()</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    try:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        data = generate_image(account_id, api_token, prompt)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    except Exception:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        # Still respect a short beat so the UI doesn't flash</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        elapsed = time.time() - t0</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        if elapsed &lt; 1.2:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            time.sleep(1.2 - elapsed)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        loader_slot.empty()</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        raise</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    elapsed = time.time() - t0</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    remaining = float(min_seconds) - elapsed</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    if remaining &gt; 0:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        time.sleep(remaining)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    loader_slot.empty()</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    return data</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span># ---------------------------------------------------------------------------</span></span>
<span class="line"><span># Credentials</span></span>
<span class="line"><span># ---------------------------------------------------------------------------</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>cf_account, cf_token = load_cf_credentials()</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>groq_key = load_groq_key()</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>groq_model = load_groq_model()</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>image_ready = bool(cf_account and cf_token)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>chat_ready = bool(groq_key)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span># ---------------------------------------------------------------------------</span></span>
<span class="line"><span># UI</span></span>
<span class="line"><span># ---------------------------------------------------------------------------</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>st.markdown(</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    f"""</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>&lt;div class="glass-hero"&gt;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>  &lt;div class="eyebrow"&gt;✨ AI Studio&lt;/div&gt;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>  &lt;div class="title"&gt;Create · Chat · Imagine&lt;/div&gt;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>  &lt;p class="subtitle"&gt;{t(</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        "Gambar + chat AI dalam satu tempat — tampilan glass modern",</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        "Image generation + AI chat in one place — glass modern UI",</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    )}&lt;/p&gt;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>&lt;/div&gt;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>""",</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    unsafe_allow_html=True,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>tab_image, tab_chat = st.tabs(</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    [</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        "🖼️ " + t("Gambar", "Image"),</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        "💬 " + t("Chat", "Chat"),</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    ]</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span># ========================= IMAGE TAB =========================</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>with tab_image:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    if not image_ready:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        st.error(</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            t(</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                "Fitur gambar belum dikonfigurasi oleh pemilik.",</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                "Image feature is not configured by the owner yet.",</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            )</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        )</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    else:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        img_prompt = st.text_area(</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            t("Deskripsikan gambar yang ingin dibuat", "Describe the image you want"),</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            placeholder=(</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                "Contoh / Example:\n"</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                "• Cute anime girl in a pink hoodie, chibi style\n"</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                "• Kopi latte art berbentuk hati di meja kayu, cahaya pagi\n"</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                "• Cyberpunk city street at night, neon rain"</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            ),</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            height=130,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            key="image_prompt_input",</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        )</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        c1, c2 = st.columns([3, 1])</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        with c1:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            gen = st.button(</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                "✨ " + t("Generate Gambar", "Generate Image"),</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                type="primary",</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                use_container_width=True,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                key="btn_gen_image",</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            )</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        with c2:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            if st.button(t("Reset", "Clear"), use_container_width=True, key="btn_clear_image"):</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                st.session_state.img_bytes = None</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                st.session_state.img_prompt = ""</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                st.session_state.img_error = None</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                st.rerun()</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        # Persistent slots so loader/result don't jump awkwardly</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        img_loader_slot = st.empty()</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        img_status_slot = st.empty()</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        if gen:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            st.session_state.img_error = None</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            if not img_prompt or not img_prompt.strip():</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                st.session_state.img_error = t(</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                    "⚠️ Prompt masih kosong.",</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                    "⚠️ Please enter a prompt first.",</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                )</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            else:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                try:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                    t0 = time.time()</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                    data = generate_image_with_min_delay(</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                        cf_account,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                        cf_token,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                        img_prompt.strip(),</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                        loader_slot=img_loader_slot,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                        min_seconds=IMAGE_MIN_LOADING_SECONDS,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                    )</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                    st.session_state.img_bytes = data</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                    st.session_state.img_prompt = img_prompt.strip()</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                    st.session_state.img_error = None</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                    img_status_slot.success(</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                        t(</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                            f"Berhasil ({time.time() - t0:.1f}s)",</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                            f"Done ({time.time() - t0:.1f}s)",</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                        )</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                    )</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                except Exception as e:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                    st.session_state.img_bytes = None</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                    msg = str(e)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                    if msg.startswith("⚠️") or msg.startswith("⏳") or msg.startswith("⌛") or msg.startswith("❌"):</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                        st.session_state.img_error = msg</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                    else:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                        st.session_state.img_error = public_error_image(None, msg, e)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        if st.session_state.img_error:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            st.error(st.session_state.img_error)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        if st.session_state.img_bytes:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            st.markdown("---")</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            safe_prompt = html.escape(st.session_state.img_prompt or "")</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            st.markdown(</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                f"""</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>&lt;div class="glass-panel"&gt;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>  &lt;strong style="color:#eef2ff;"&gt;{html.escape(t("Hasil", "Result"))}&lt;/strong&gt;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>  &lt;div style="color:rgba(238,242,255,0.65);font-size:0.85rem;margin-top:0.2rem;"&gt;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    {safe_prompt}</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>  &lt;/div&gt;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>&lt;/div&gt;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>""",</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                unsafe_allow_html=True,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            )</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            st.image(</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                st.session_state.img_bytes,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                use_container_width=True,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            )</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            ts = datetime.now().strftime("%Y%m%d_%H%M%S")</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            st.download_button(</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                label="⬇️ " + t("Unduh PNG", "Download PNG"),</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                data=st.session_state.img_bytes,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                file_name=f"image_{ts}.png",</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                mime="image/png",</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                use_container_width=True,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                key="btn_dl_image",</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            )</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span># ========================= CHAT TAB =========================</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>with tab_chat:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    if not chat_ready:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        st.error(</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            t(</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                "Fitur chat belum dikonfigurasi oleh pemilik.",</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                "Chat feature is not configured by the owner yet.",</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            )</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        )</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    else:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        head_l, head_r = st.columns([3, 1])</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        with head_l:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            st.caption(</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                t(</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                    "Chat AI · konteks panjang via Groq",</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                    "AI chat · long context via Groq",</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                )</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            )</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        with head_r:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            if st.button(t("Hapus chat", "Clear chat"), use_container_width=True, key="btn_clear_chat"):</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                st.session_state.chat_messages = []</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                st.session_state.chat_error = None</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                st.rerun()</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        def _history_html(msgs: list[dict]) -&gt; str:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            if not msgs:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                return ""</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            body = "".join(</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                chat_bubble_html(m.get("role", "assistant"), m.get("content", ""))</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                for m in msgs</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            )</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            return (</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                f'&lt;div style="display:block;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;"&gt;{body}&lt;/div&gt;'</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            )</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        history_slot = st.empty()</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        history_slot.markdown(</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            _history_html(st.session_state.chat_messages),</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            unsafe_allow_html=True,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        )</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        if st.session_state.chat_error:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            st.error(st.session_state.chat_error)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        user_text = st.chat_input(</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            "ask anythink",</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            key="chat_input_main",</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        )</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>        if user_text and user_text.strip():</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            st.session_state.chat_error = None</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            st.session_state.chat_messages.append(</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                {"role": "user", "content": user_text.strip()}</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            )</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            # Refresh history: user RIGHT, avatar di paling kanan bubble</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            history_slot.markdown(</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                _history_html(st.session_state.chat_messages),</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                unsafe_allow_html=True,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            )</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            think_slot = st.empty()</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            answer_slot = st.empty()</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            try:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                run_chat_thinking_animation(think_slot)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                client = build_chat_client(groq_key)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                think_slot.empty()</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                full = ""</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                for piece in stream_chat_with_fallback(</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                    client,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                    groq_model,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                    st.session_state.chat_messages,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                ):</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                    full += piece or ""</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                    answer_slot.markdown(</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                        chat_bubble_html("assistant", full),</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                        unsafe_allow_html=True,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                    )</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                if not full:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                    full = "…"</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                    answer_slot.markdown(</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                        chat_bubble_html("assistant", full),</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                        unsafe_allow_html=True,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                    )</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                st.session_state.chat_messages.append(</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                    {"role": "assistant", "content": str(full)}</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                )</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                st.rerun()</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>            except Exception as e:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                think_slot.empty()</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                err = public_error_chat(e)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                st.session_state.chat_error = err</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>                st.error(err)</span></span></code></pre></div></div></pre></div></div></div></div><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-surface-primary disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 text-sm hover:bg-surface-tertiary focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:border-none font-normal relative text-text-secondary hover:text-text-primary size-3.5 flex-shrink-0 rounded-md p-1.5 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100" type="button"><svg width="14" height="14" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-interactive-positive absolute inset-0 m-auto rotate-90 opacity-0 transition-all duration-300"><path d="M5 13L9 17L19 7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><svg width="14" height="14" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="absolute inset-0 m-auto opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300"><path d="M19.4 20H9.6C9.26863 20 9 19.7314 9 19.4V9.6C9 9.26863 9.26863 9 9.6 9H19.4C19.7314 9 20 9.26863 20 9.6V19.4C20 19.7314 19.7314 20 19.4 20Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M15 9V4.6C15 4.26863 14.7314 4 14.4 4H4.6C4.26863 4 4 4.26863 4 4.6V14.4C4 14.7314 4.26863 15 4.6 15H9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button></div></div><div><div class="relative overflow-hidden bg-surface-primary rounded-xl border w-full border-transparent"><div class="px-3 pb-3"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><div class="prose prose-pre:bg-transparent prose-pre:p-0 text-wrap break-words prose-base body-base"><p>✅ <strong>Kode pertama diterima!</strong> (Belum saya buat kode apapun, sesuai instruksi.)</p><p><strong>Catatan saya untuk App 1 — "AI Studio":</strong></p><div class="overflow-x-auto"><table node="[object Object]" class="min-w-full"><thead><tr><th node="[object Object]" class="whitespace-nowrap px-3 py-2">Aspek</th><th node="[object Object]" class="whitespace-nowrap px-3 py-2">Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">Framework</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">Streamlit (Python)</td></tr><tr><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2"><strong>Tab 1: Generate Gambar</strong></td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">Cloudflare Workers AI — model <code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">FLUX-1-schnell</code></td></tr><tr><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2"><strong>Tab 2: AI Chat</strong></td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">Groq API — model <code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">gpt-oss-120b</code> + fallback, streaming, konteks panjang</td></tr><tr><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">UI</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">Tema glass modern (<code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">styles.py</code> → <code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">inject_glass_theme()</code>), bilingual ID/EN, bubble chat gaya WhatsApp, animasi "thinking" ~15 detik</td></tr><tr><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">Kredensial</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">Via Streamlit Secrets (Cloudflare + Groq)</td></tr><tr><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">Input foto?</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">❌ Tidak ada — aman, tidak perlu dihilangkan</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>📌 <strong>Perlu dicatat:</strong> file ini meng-import <code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">from styles import inject_glass_theme</code> — jadi nanti kalau ada, kirim juga file <code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">styles.py</code>-nya (atau nanti saya sesuaikan saat penggabungan).</p><p>Sekarang silakan kirim <strong>kode App 2</strong> (Multi AI?) dan <strong>App 3</strong> (AI chat biasa?). Saya tunggu — belum akan menggabungkan sampai Anda beri perintah. 📥</p></div></div><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2"><div class="flex items-center gap-1"><div class="hover:bg-accent group flex items-center justify-center rounded-md p-1.5 transition-all" data-state="closed" data-slot="tooltip-trigger"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-interactive-positive transition-colors"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M12 1.25C6.06294 1.25 1.25 6.06294 1.25 12C1.25 17.9371 6.06294 22.75 12 22.75C17.9371 22.75 22.75 17.9371 22.75 12C22.75 6.06294 17.9371 1.25 12 1.25ZM7.53044 11.9697C7.23755 11.6768 6.76268 11.6768 6.46978 11.9697C6.17689 12.2626 6.17689 12.7374 6.46978 13.0303L9.46978 16.0303C9.76268 16.3232 10.2376 16.3232 10.5304 16.0303L17.5304 9.03033C17.8233 8.73744 17.8233 8.26256 17.5304 7.96967C17.2375 7.67678 16.7627 7.67678 16.4698 7.96967L10.0001 14.4393L7.53044 11.9697Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div><button type="button" aria-label="Copy" class="hover:bg-accent flex items-center justify-center rounded-md p-1.5 transition-all" data-state="closed" data-slot="tooltip-trigger"><svg width="14" height="14" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor"><path d="M19.4 20H9.6C9.26863 20 9 19.7314 9 19.4V9.6C9 9.26863 9.26863 9 9.6 9H19.4C19.7314 9 20 9.26863 20 9.6V19.4C20 19.7314 19.7314 20 19.4 20Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M15 9V4.6C15 4.26863 14.7314 4 14.4 4H4.6C4.26863 4 4 4.26863 4 4.6V14.4C4 14.7314 4.26863 15 4.6 15H9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></div></div><div><div class="group flex min-w-0 flex-col items-end gap-1"><div class="relative overflow-hidden bg-surface-raised rounded-lg w-fit max-w-[min(70%,768px)] border-transparent ml-0"><div class="px-3 text-text-primary body-base py-2"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><div class="prose prose-pre:bg-transparent prose-pre:p-0 text-wrap break-words prose-base body-base"><p>nah untuk file style css nya kita nggak usah pakai file bawaan nanti kita edit sendiri</p></div></div></div></div><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-surface-primary disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 text-sm hover:bg-surface-tertiary focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:border-none font-normal relative text-text-secondary hover:text-text-primary size-3.5 flex-shrink-0 rounded-md p-1.5 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100" type="button"><svg width="14" height="14" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-interactive-positive absolute inset-0 m-auto rotate-90 opacity-0 transition-all duration-300"><path d="M5 13L9 17L19 7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><svg width="14" height="14" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="absolute inset-0 m-auto o