nd"></path></svg></button></div><div><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Expand" class="flex w-full select-none items-center gap-1.5 cursor-pointer"><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-text-tertiary size-4 shrink-0"><path d="M13 16H18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M6 8L10 12L6 16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M2 18V6C2 4.89543 2.89543 4 4 4H20C21.1046 4 22 4.89543 22 6V18C22 19.1046 21.1046 20 20 20H4C2.89543 20 2 19.1046 2 18Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span class="flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1"><span class="text-text-tertiary body-sm leading-4">used</span><span class="text-text-secondary body-sm leading-4">Bash</span><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-interactive-positive size-4 shrink-0"><path d="M5 13L9 17L19 7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span class="text-text-tertiary shrink-0 font-mono text-[10px] leading-[1.2]">3.1s</span></span><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-text-tertiary size-3 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="M6 9L12 15L18 9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button></div><div class="prose prose-pre:bg-transparent prose-pre:p-0 text-wrap break-words prose-base body-base"><p>✅ <strong>Selesai! Ampera Trinity AI sudah jadi dan berjalan!</strong> 🔱</p><p>Aplikasinya sudah live — silakan cek <strong>preview</strong> yang muncul di browser Anda. Server merespons normal (HTTP 200).</p></div><div class="prose prose-pre:bg-transparent prose-pre:p-0 text-wrap break-words prose-base body-base"><h2>🔱 Ampera Trinity AI — Hasil Penggabungan</h2><p><strong>📁 File yang dibuat:</strong></p><div class="overflow-x-auto"><table node="[object Object]" class="min-w-full"><thead><tr><th node="[object Object]" class="whitespace-nowrap px-3 py-2">File</th><th node="[object Object]" class="whitespace-nowrap px-3 py-2">Fungsi</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2"><button type="button" class="not-prose border-border-medium bg-surface-secondary hover:bg-surface-tertiary hover:border-border-strong group my-0.5 inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded border px-1 py-0 text-left align-middle transition-colors"><svg width="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" height="1.5em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-text-tertiary size-3 shrink-0"><path d="M9.00001 21L8.00001 21C6.89544 21 6.00001 20.1057 6.00001 19.0011C6.00001 17.4501 6.00001 15.3443 6 14C6 13 4.5 12 4.5 12C4.5 12 6.00001 11 6.00001 10C6.00001 8.827 6.00001 6.62207 6.00001 4.99914C6.00001 3.89457 6.89544 3 8.00001 3L9.00001 3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M15 21L16 21C17.1046 21 18 20.1057 18 19.0011C18 17.4501 18 15.3443 18 14C18 13 19.5 12 19.5 12C19.5 12 18 11 18 10C18 8.827 18 6.62207 18 4.99914C18 3.89457 17.1046 3 16 3L15 3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span class="text-text-secondary group-hover:text-text-primary truncate font-mono text-[12px] transition-colors">app.py</span></button></td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">Aplikasi utama (satu file, ~700 baris)</td></tr><tr><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2"><button type="button" class="not-prose border-border-medium bg-surface-secondary hover:bg-surface-tertiary hover:border-border-strong group my-0.5 inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded border px-1 py-0 text-left align-middle transition-colors"><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-text-tertiary size-3 shrink-0"><path d="M4 21.4V2.6C4 2.26863 4.26863 2 4.6 2H16.2515C16.4106 2 16.5632 2.06321 16.6757 2.17574L19.8243 5.32426C19.9368 5.43679 20 5.5894 20 5.74853V21.4C20 21.7314 19.7314 22 19.4 22H4.6C4.26863 22 4 21.7314 4 21.4Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M8 10L16 10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M8 18L16 18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M8 14L12 14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M16 2V5.4C16 5.73137 16.2686 6 16.6 6H20" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span class="text-text-secondary group-hover:text-text-primary truncate font-mono text-[12px] transition-colors">requirements.txt</span></button></td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">Dependensi</td></tr><tr><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2"><button type="button" class="not-prose border-border-medium bg-surface-secondary hover:bg-surface-tertiary hover:border-border-strong group my-0.5 inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded border px-1 py-0 text-left align-middle transition-colors"><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-text-tertiary size-3 shrink-0"><path d="M4 21.4V2.6C4 2.26863 4.26863 2 4.6 2H16.2515C16.4106 2 16.5632 2.06321 16.6757 2.17574L19.8243 5.32426C19.9368 5.43679 20 5.5894 20 5.74853V21.4C20 21.7314 19.7314 22 19.4 22H4.6C4.26863 22 4 21.7314 4 21.4Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M8 10L16 10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M8 18L16 18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M8 14L12 14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M16 2V5.4C16 5.73137 16.2686 6 16.6 6H20" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span class="text-text-secondary group-hover:text-text-primary truncate font-mono text-[12px] transition-colors">secrets.toml.example</span></button></td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">Template kredensial</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p><strong>✨ Fitur sesuai kesepakatan:</strong></p><ol>
<li><strong>🤖 Multi AI di area chat input</strong> — tombol popover <code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">🤖 GPT-OSS 20B</code> di atas kolom ketik, berisi 5 model (GPT-OSS 20B/120B, Compound, Compound Mini, Qwen3.6 27B) dengan tanda ✅ untuk model aktif + fallback otomatis kalau model dihapus provider</li>
<li><strong>🎨 Generate gambar di chat input</strong> — toggle "Mode Gambar" di samping tombol model; nyalakan → tulis deskripsi → hasil FLUX muncul sebagai bubble di percakapan + tombol unduh PNG</li>
<li><strong>💬 Chat persona Yuki</strong> — streaming realtime, konteks panjang (40 pesan), timestamp di tiap bubble</li>
<li><strong>Bonus dari App 2:</strong> tombol Obrolan Baru + Unduh Riwayat Chat (.md) di sidebar</li>
</ol><p><strong>⚙️ Sesuai catatan kita:</strong></p><ul>
<li>CSS <strong>buatan sendiri</strong> (dark glass sederhana — siap kita edit bareng nanti)</li>
<li>Loading pakai <code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">st.spinner</code> bawaan dulu</li>
<li>Splash screen &amp; sidebar lengkap (search percakapan) → belum, dibuat ulang nanti</li>
<li>Tidak ada fitur input foto</li>
</ul><p><strong>🔑 Penting:</strong> untuk mengaktifkan fiturnya, isi kredensial di <code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">.streamlit/secrets.toml</code> (contoh formatnya ada di file <code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">.example</code>): <code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">GROQ_API_KEY</code> untuk chat, <code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">CF_ACCOUNT_ID</code> + <code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">CF_API_TOKEN</code> untuk gambar. Tanpa kredensial, app tetap jalan tapi statusnya 🔴 di sidebar.</p><p>Silakan dicoba preview-nya! Kalau ada yang mau diubah (warna, layout, posisi tombol, dll.), tinggal bilang. 🚀</p></div></div><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2"><div class="flex items-center gap-1"><div class="hover:bg-accent group flex items-center justify-center rounded-md p-1.5 transition-all" data-state="closed" data-slot="tooltip-trigger"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-interactive-positive transition-colors"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M12 1.25C6.06294 1.25 1.25 6.06294 1.25 12C1.25 17.9371 6.06294 22.75 12 22.75C17.9371 22.75 22.75 17.9371 22.75 12C22.75 6.06294 17.9371 1.25 12 1.25ZM7.53044 11.9697C7.23755 11.6768 6.76268 11.6768 6.46978 11.9697C6.17689 12.2626 6.17689 12.7374 6.46978 13.0303L9.46978 16.0303C9.76268 16.3232 10.2376 16.3232 10.5304 16.0303L17.5304 9.03033C17.8233 8.73744 17.8233 8.26256 17.5304 7.96967C17.2375 7.67678 16.7627 7.67678 16.4698 7.96967L