 + teks yang muncul perlahan dengan efek <strong>shimmer</strong> (kilau lembut menyapu teks), dan frasa yang berganti pelan-pelan — persis nuansa "Thinking..." di Claude.</p><p>Pertama, tambahkan CSS animasinya:</p></div><div><div class="body-sm flex items-center gap-1.5"><button type="button" class="text-text-tertiary hover:text-text-secondary shrink-0 p-0.5" aria-label="Expand" aria-expanded="false"><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="size-3 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="M9 6L15 12L9 18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button><span class="shrink-0 text-text-secondary">Edit</span><button type="button" class="bg-surface-tertiary text-text-tertiary hover:text-text-secondary truncate rounded-sm px-1 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] leading-tight">ampera-trinity-ai/app.py</button></div></div><div class="prose prose-pre:bg-transparent prose-pre:p-0 text-wrap break-words prose-base body-base"><p>Sekarang buat fungsi HTML thinking dan ganti <code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">st.spinner</code> di kedua handler:</p></div><div><div class="body-sm flex items-center gap-1.5"><button type="button" class="text-text-tertiary hover:text-text-secondary shrink-0 p-0.5" aria-label="Expand" aria-expanded="false"><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="size-3 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="M9 6L15 12L9 18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button><span class="shrink-0 text-text-secondary">Edit</span><button type="button" class="bg-surface-tertiary text-text-tertiary hover:text-text-secondary truncate rounded-sm px-1 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] leading-tight">ampera-trinity-ai/app.py</button><span class="text-text-muted text-[10px]">×4</span></div></div><div class="prose prose-pre:bg-transparent prose-pre:p-0 text-wrap break-words prose-base body-base"><p>Sekarang tambahkan sedikit penahan waktu minimum supaya animasinya sempat terlihat perlahan (tidak berkedip hilang kalau API merespons sangat cepat):</p></div><div><div class="body-sm flex items-center gap-1.5"><button type="button" class="text-text-tertiary hover:text-text-secondary shrink-0 p-0.5" aria-label="Expand" aria-expanded="false"><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="size-3 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="M9 6L15 12L9 18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button><span class="shrink-0 text-text-secondary">Edit</span><button type="button" class="bg-surface-tertiary text-text-tertiary hover:text-text-secondary truncate rounded-sm px-1 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] leading-tight">ampera-trinity-ai/app.py</button></div></div><div><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Expand" class="flex w-full select-none items-center gap-1.5 cursor-pointer"><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-text-tertiary size-4 shrink-0"><path d="M13 16H18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M6 8L10 12L6 16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M2 18V6C2 4.89543 2.89543 4 4 4H20C21.1046 4 22 4.89543 22 6V18C22 19.1046 21.1046 20 20 20H4C2.89543 20 2 19.1046 2 18Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span class="flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1"><span class="text-text-tertiary body-sm leading-4">used</span><span class="text-text-secondary body-sm leading-4">Bash</span><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-interactive-positive size-4 shrink-0"><path d="M5 13L9 17L19 7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span class="text-text-tertiary shrink-0 font-mono text-[10px] leading-[1.2]">238ms</span></span><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-text-tertiary size-3 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="M6 9L12 15L18 9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button></div><div class="prose prose-pre:bg-transparent prose-pre:p-0 text-wrap break-words prose-base body-base"><p>Hanya tersisa di komentar dokumentasi — saya perbarui juga biar akurat:</p></div><div><div class="body-sm flex items-center gap-1.5"><button type="button" class="text-text-tertiary hover:text-text-secondary shrink-0 p-0.5" aria-label="Expand" aria-expanded="false"><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="size-3 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="M9 6L15 12L9 18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button><span class="shrink-0 text-text-secondary">Edit</span><button type="button" class="bg-surface-tertiary text-text-tertiary hover:text-text-secondary truncate rounded-sm px-1 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] leading-tight">ampera-trinity-ai/app.py</button></div></div><div role="button" tabindex="0" aria-pressed="false" class="group/artifact relative block w-full overflow-hidden rounded-lg border text-left transition duration-150 bg-surface-secondary border-border-faint shadow-[0px_0px_8px_0_rgba(0,0,0,0.04)] hover:border-border-medium hover:bg-surface-tertiary hover:shadow-none focus-visible:ring-interactive-active focus-visible:ring-offset-surface-primary cursor-pointer focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-2"><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-2"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="shrink-0 text-text-secondary" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 21.4V2.6C4 2.26863 4.26863 2 4.6 2H16.2515C16.4106 2 16.5632 2.06321 16.6757 2.17574L19.8243 5.32426C19.9368 5.43679 20 5.5894 20 5.74853V21.4C20 21.7314 19.7314 22 19.4 22H4.6C4.26863 22 4 21.7314 4 21.4Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M8 10L16 10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M8 18L16 18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M8 14L12 14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M16 2V5.4C16 5.73137 16.2686 6 16.6 6H20" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span class="min-w-0 flex-1 truncate text-sm font-normal text-text-primary">app.py</span><span class="bg-surface-secondary text-text-tertiary shrink-0 rounded-[4px] border px-1.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium uppercase leading-none border-border-medium">PYTHON</span></div></div><div><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Expand" class="flex w-full select-none items-center gap-1.5 cursor-pointer"><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-text-tertiary size-4 shrink-0"><path d="M13 16H18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M6 8L10 12L6 16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M2 18V6C2 4.89543 2.89543 4 4 4H20C21.1046 4 22 4.89543 22 6V18C22 19.1046 21.1046 20 20 20H4C2.89543 20 2 19.1046 2 18Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span class="flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1"><span class="text-text-tertiary body-sm leading-4">used</span><span class="text-text-secondary body-sm leading-4">Bash</span><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-interactive-positive size-4 shrink-0"><path d="M5 13L9 17L19 7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span class="text-text-tertiary shrink-0 font-mono text-[10px] leading-[1.2]">599ms</span></span><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-text-tertiary size-3 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="M6 9L12 15L18 9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button></div><div class="prose prose-pre:bg-transparent prose-pre:p-0 text-wrap break-words prose-base body-base"><p>✅ <strong>Selesai! Loading thinking ala Claude sudah live</strong> — refresh preview-nya (klik <strong>Rerun</strong> jika muncul notifikasi file berubah), lalu coba kirim pesan.</p><h2>✳ Yang baru — Thinking Indicator ala Claude:</h2><div class="overflow-x-auto"><table node="[object Object]" class="min-w-full"><thead><tr><th node="[object Object]" class="whitespace-nowrap px-3 py-2">Elemen</th><th node="[object Object]" class="whitespace-nowrap px-3 py-2">Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2"><strong>Bintang ✳</strong></td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">Warna terracotta, <strong>berdenyut &amp; berputar pelan</strong> (2.2 detik per siklus) — ikon khas Claude saat berpikir</td></tr><tr><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2"><strong>Teks muncul perlahan</strong></td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">Fade-in lambat 1.6 detik + efek blur yang menghilang pelan — teks benar-benar "muncul perlahan dengan lambat" sesuai permintaan</td></tr><tr><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2"><strong>Efek shimmer</strong></td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">Kilau lembut menyapu teks dari kiri ke kanan terus-menerus (2.6 detik) — persis efek "Thinking..." Claude</td></tr><tr><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2"><strong>Frasa berganti pelan</strong></td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">Setiap ~4 detik berganti otomatis: <em>"Berpikir…" → "Merangkai jawaban…" → "Menimbang kata…"</em> (untuk chat) dan <em>"Membayangkan gambarnya…" → "Menyiapkan kanvas…" → "Melukis perlahan…"</em> (untuk mode gambar)</td></tr><tr><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2"><strong>Anti-kedip</strong></td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">Ada penahan minimum ~1.6 detik, jadi animasi tetap terlihat walau API membalas super cepat</td></tr><tr><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2"><strong>Teknis</strong></td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">Animasi murni CSS → tetap berjalan mulus di browser meskipun server sedang sibuk menunggu API (tidak beku seperti animasi berbasis <code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">time.sleep</code>)</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p><code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">st.spinner</code> bawaan sudah <strong>dihapus total</strong> dari alur chat &amp; gambar.</p><p>Silakan coba kirim pesan dan lihat animasinya! Kalau mau disesuaikan — misalnya frasa lain, kecepatan shimmer diperlambat, atau bintangnya diganti — tinggal bilang. 🖌️</p></div></div><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2"><div class="flex items-center gap-1"><div class="hover:bg-accent group flex items-center justify-center rounded-md p-1.5 transition-all" data-state="closed" data-slot="tooltip-trigger"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-interactive-positive transition-colors"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M12 1.25C6.06294 1.25 1.25 6.06294 1.25 12C1.25 17.9371 6.06294 22.75 12 22.75C17.9371 22.75 22.75 17.9371 22.75 12C22.75 6.06294 17.9371 1.25 12 1.25ZM7.53044 11.9697C7.23755 11.6768 6.76268 11.6768 6.46978 11.9697C6.17689 12.2626 6.17689 12.7374 6.46978 13.0303L9.46978 16.0303C9.76268 16.3232 10.2376 16.3232 10.5304 16.0303L17.5304 9.03033C17.8233 8.73744 17.8233 8.26256 17.5304 7.96967C17.2375 7.67678 16.7627 7.67678 16.4698 7.96967L10.0001 14.4393L7.53044 11.9697Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div><button type="button" aria-label="Copy" class="hover:bg-accent flex items-center justify-center rounded-md p-1.5 transition-all" data-state="closed" data-slot="tooltip-trigger"><svg width="14" height="14" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor"><path d="M19.4 20H9.6C9.26863 20 9 19.7314 9 19.4V9.6C9 9.26863 9.26863 9 9.6 9H19.4C19.7314 9 20 9.26863 20 9.6V19.4C20 19.7314 19.7314 20 19.4 20Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M15 9V4.6C15 4.26863 14.7314 4 14.4 4H4.6C4.26863 4 4 4.26863 4 4.6V14.4C4 14.7314 4.26863 15 4.6 15H9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></div></div><div><div class="group flex min-w-0 flex-col items-end gap-1"><div class="relative overflow-hidden bg-surface-raised rounded-lg w-fit max-w-[min(70%,768px)] border-transparent ml-0"><div class="px-3 text-text-primary body-base py-2"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><div class="prose prose-pre:bg-transparent prose-pre:p-0 text-wrap break-words prose-base body-base"><p>teks nya kurang lama 