none focus-visible:ring-interactive-active focus-visible:ring-offset-surface-primary cursor-pointer focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-2"><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-2"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="shrink-0 text-text-secondary" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 21.4V2.6C4 2.26863 4.26863 2 4.6 2H16.2515C16.4106 2 16.5632 2.06321 16.6757 2.17574L19.8243 5.32426C19.9368 5.43679 20 5.5894 20 5.74853V21.4C20 21.7314 19.7314 22 19.4 22H4.6C4.26863 22 4 21.7314 4 21.4Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M8 10L16 10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M8 18L16 18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M8 14L12 14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M16 2V5.4C16 5.73137 16.2686 6 16.6 6H20" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span class="min-w-0 flex-1 truncate text-sm font-normal text-text-primary">app.py</span><span class="bg-surface-secondary text-text-tertiary shrink-0 rounded-[4px] border px-1.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium uppercase leading-none border-border-medium">PYTHON</span></div></div><div><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Expand" class="flex w-full select-none items-center gap-1.5 cursor-pointer"><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-text-tertiary size-4 shrink-0"><path d="M13 16H18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M6 8L10 12L6 16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M2 18V6C2 4.89543 2.89543 4 4 4H20C21.1046 4 22 4.89543 22 6V18C22 19.1046 21.1046 20 20 20H4C2.89543 20 2 19.1046 2 18Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span class="flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1"><span class="text-text-tertiary body-sm leading-4">used</span><span class="text-text-secondary body-sm leading-4">Bash</span><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-interactive-positive size-4 shrink-0"><path d="M5 13L9 17L19 7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span class="text-text-tertiary shrink-0 font-mono text-[10px] leading-[1.2]">199ms</span></span><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-text-tertiary size-3 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="M6 9L12 15L18 9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button></div><div class="prose prose-pre:bg-transparent prose-pre:p-0 text-wrap break-words prose-base body-base"><p>✅ <strong>Selesai — delainya sudah diperpanjang!</strong> Refresh preview lalu coba kirim pesan.</p><h2>⏱️ Perubahan timing:</h2><div class="overflow-x-auto"><table node="[object Object]" class="min-w-full"><thead><tr><th node="[object Object]" class="whitespace-nowrap px-3 py-2">Elemen</th><th node="[object Object]" class="whitespace-nowrap px-3 py-2">Sebelum</th><th node="[object Object]" class="whitespace-nowrap px-3 py-2">Sekarang</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2"><strong>Fade-in teks</strong> (muncul perlahan)</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">1.6 detik</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2"><strong>3 detik</strong> — lebih lambat &amp; halus</td></tr><tr><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2"><strong>Durasi tiap frasa tampil</strong></td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">~4 detik</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2"><strong>~10 detik</strong> per frasa</td></tr><tr><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2"><strong>Satu siklus penuh</strong> (3 frasa)</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">12 detik</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2"><strong>30 detik</strong></td></tr><tr><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2"><strong>Shimmer menyapu teks</strong></td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">2.6 detik</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2"><strong>4 detik</strong> — kilaunya lebih santai</td></tr><tr><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2"><strong>Penahan minimum</strong> sebelum jawaban muncul</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">1.6 detik</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2"><strong>4.5 detik</strong> — animasi selalu sempat terlihat</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Jadi sekarang alurnya: <em>"Berpikir…"</em> muncul pelan-pelan dengan blur yang memudar (~3 detik), bertahan sekitar 10 detik dengan kilau lembut, baru berganti perlahan ke <em>"Merangkai jawaban…"</em>, dan seterusnya.</p><p>Coba dan rasakan temponya — kalau masih kurang lambat (misalnya mau 15–20 detik per frasa, atau penahan minimumnya lebih lama lagi), tinggal sebut angkanya. 🖌️</p></div></div><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2"><div class="flex items-center gap-1"><div class="hover:bg-accent group flex items-center justify-center rounded-md p-1.5 transition-all" data-state="closed" data-slot="tooltip-trigger"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-interactive-positive transition-colors"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M12 1.25C6.06294 1.25 1.25 6.06294 1.25 12C1.25 17.9371 6.06294 22.75 12 22.75C17.9371 22.75 22.75 17.9371 22.75 12C22.75 6.06294 17.9371 1.25 12 1.25ZM7.53044 11.9697C7.23755 11.6768 6.76268 11.6768 6.46978 11.9697C6.17689 12.2626 6.17689 12.7374 6.46978 13.0303L9.46978 16.0303C9.76268 16.3232 10.2376 16.3232 10.5304 16.0303L17.5304 9.03033C17.8233 8.73744 17.8233 8.26256 17.5304 7.96967C17.2375 7.67678 16.7627 7.67678 16.4698 7.96967L10.0001 14.4393L7.53044 11.9697Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div><button type="button" aria-label="Copy" class="hover:bg-accent flex items-center justify-center rounded-md p-1.5 transition-all" data-state="closed" data-slot="tooltip-trigger"><svg width="14" height="14" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor"><path d="M19.4 20H9.6C9.26863 20 9 19.7314 9 19.4V9.6C9 9.26863 9.26863 9 9.6 9H19.4C19.7314 9 20 9.26863 20 9.6V19.4C20 19.7314 19.7314 20 19.4 20Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M15 9V4.6C15 4.26863 14.7314 4 14.4 4H4.6C4.26863 4 4 4.26863 4 4.6V14.4C4 14.7314 4.26863 15 4.6 15H9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></div></div><div><div class="group flex min-w-0 flex-col items-end gap-1"><div class="relative overflow-hidden bg-surface-raised rounded-lg w-fit max-w-[min(70%,768px)] border-transparent ml-0"><div class="px-3 text-text-primary body-base py-2"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><div class="prose prose-pre:bg-transparent prose-pre:p-0 text-wrap break-words prose-base body-base"><p>sekarang tambah waktu proses berpikirnya lebih lama kira kira 12 detik dan munculkan teks juga saat berpikir yang sama seperti claude, lalu untuk teks yang mucul saat menjawab dibuat muncul kata per kata dengan delay yang agak lambat</p></div></div></div></div><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-surface-primary disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 text-sm hover:bg-surface-tertiary focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:border-none font-normal relative text-text-secondary hover:text-text-primary size-3.5 flex-shrink-0 rounded-md p-1.5 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100" type="button"><svg width="14" height="14" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-interactive-positive absolute inset-0 m-auto rotate-90 opacity-0 transition-all duration-300"><path d="M5 13L9 17L19 7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><svg width="14" height="14" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="absolute inset-0 m-auto opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300"><path d="M19.4 20H9.6C9.26863 20 9 19.7314 9 19.4V9.6C9 9.26863 9.26863 9 9.6 9H19.4C19.7314 9 20 9.26863 20 9.6V19.4C20 19.7314 19.7314 20 19.4 20Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M15 9V4.6C15 4.26863 14.7314 4 14.4 4H4.6C4.26863 4 4 4.26863 4 4.6V14.4C4 14.7314 4.26863 15 4.6 15H9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button></div></div><div><div class="relative overflow-hidden bg-surface-primary rounded-xl border w-full border-transparent"><div class="px-3 pb-3"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><div class="prose prose-pre:bg-transparent prose-pre:p-0 text-wrap break-words prose-base body-base"><p>Siap! 3 perubahan: ⏱️ berpikir minimum ~12 detik, ✳ frasa berpikir lebih banyak ala Claude yang berganti-ganti selama 12 detik itu, dan ⌨️ jawaban muncul <strong>kata per kata</strong> dengan delay agak lambat.</p></div><div><div class="body-sm flex items-center gap-1.5"><button type="button" class="text-text-tertiary hover:text-text-secondary shrink-0 p-0.5" aria-label="Expand" aria-expanded="false"><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="size-3 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="M9 6L15 12L9 18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button><span class="shrink-0 text-text-secondary">Edit</span><button type="button" class="bg-surface-tertiary text-text-tertiary hover:text-text-secondary truncate rounded-sm px-1 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] leading-tight">ampera-trinity-ai/app.py</button></div></div><div class="prose prose-pre:bg-transparent prose-pre:p-0 text-wrap break-words prose-base body-base"><p>Sekarang perbarui daftar frasa jadi lebih banyak &amp; lebih "Claude", tambah penahan 12 detik, dan buat efek ketik kata per kata:</p></div><div><div class="body-sm flex items-center gap-1.5"><button type="button" class="text-text-tertiary hover:text-text-secondary shrink-0 p-0.5" aria-label="Expand" aria-expanded="false"><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="size-3 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="M9 6L15 12L9 18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button><span class="shrink-0 text-text-secondary">Edit</span><button type="button" class="bg-surface-tertiary text-text-tertiary hover:text-text-secondary truncate rounded-sm px-1 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] leading-tight">ampera-trinity-ai/app.py</button></div></div><div class="prose prose-pre:bg-transparent prose-pre:p-0 text-wrap break-words prose-base body-base"><p>Sekarang ubah alur chat: kumpulkan jawaban selama animasi berpikir berjalan (min 12 detik), lalu tampilkan kata per kata:</p></div><div><div class="body-sm flex items-center gap-1.5"><button type="button" class="text-text-tertiary hover:text-text-secondary shrink-0 p-0.5" aria-label="Expand" aria-expanded="false"><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="size-3 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="M9 6L15 12L9 18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button><span class="shrink-0 text-text-secondary">Edit</span><button type="button" class="bg-surface-tertiary text-text-tertiary hover:text-text-secondary truncate rounded-sm px-1 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] leading-tight">ampera-trinity-ai/app.py</button></div></div><div role="button" tabindex="0" aria-pressed="false" class="group/artifact relative block w-full overflow-hidden rounded-lg border text-left transition duration-150 bg-surface-secondary border-border-faint shadow-[0px_0px_8px_0_rgba(0,0,0,0.04)] hover:border-border-medium hover:bg-surface-tertiary hover:shadow-none focus-visible:ring-interactive-active focus-visible:ring-offset-surface-primary cursor-pointer focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-2"><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-2"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="shrink-0 text-text-secondary" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 21.4V2.6C4 2.26863 4.26863 2 4.6 2H16.2515C16.4106 2 16.5632 2.06321 16.6757 2.17574L19.8243 5.32426C19.9368 5.43679 20 5.5894 20 5.74853V21.4C20 21.7314 19.7314 22 19.4 22H4.6C4.26863 22 4 21.7314 4 21.4Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M8 10L16 10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M8 18L16 18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M8 14L12 14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M16 2V5.4C16 5.73137 16.2686 6 16.6 6H20" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span class="min-w-0 flex-1 truncate text-sm font-normal text-text-primary">app.py</span><span class="bg-surface-secondary text-text-tertiary shrink-0 rounded-[4px] border px-1.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium uppercase leading-none border-border-medium">PYTHON</span></div></div><div><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Expand" class="flex w-full select-none items-center gap-1.5 cursor-pointer"><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-text-tertiary size-4 shrink-0"><path d="M13 16H18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M6 8L10 12L6 16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M2 18V6C2 4.89543 2.89543 4 4 4H20C21.1046 4 22 4.89543 22 6V18C22 19.1046 21.1046 20 20 20H4C2.89543 20 2 19.1046 2 18Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span class="flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1"><span class="text-text-tertiary body-sm leading-4">used</span><span class="text-text-secondary body-sm leading-4">Bash</span><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-interactive-positive size-4 shrink-0"><path d="M5 13L9 17L19 7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span class="text-text-tertiary shrink-0 font-mono text-[10px] leading-[1.2]">201ms</span></span><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-text-tertiary size-3 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="M6 9L12 15L18 9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button></div><div class="prose prose-pre:bg-transparent prose-pre:p-0 text-wrap break-words prose-base body-base"><p>✅ <strong>Selesai! Semua tiga perubahan sudah live</strong> — refresh preview dan coba kirim pesan.</p><h2>✳ Yang berubah:</h2><p><strong>1. Proses berpikir minimum ±12 detik</strong> ⏱️<br>
Animasi thinking sekarang selalu tampil setidaknya <strong>12 detik penuh</strong> sebelum jawaban muncul (jawaban dari API dikumpulkan diam-diam di belakang layar selama animasi berjalan).</p><p><strong>2. Teks berpikir berganti-ganti ala Claude</strong> 💭<br>
Selama 12 detik itu, frasa berganti tiap <strong>±4 detik</strong> dengan fade + blur lembut:</p><div class="overflow-x-auto"><table node="[object Object]" class="min-w-full"><thead><tr><th node="[object Object]" class="whitespace-nowrap px-3 py-2">Detik</th><th node="[object Object]" class="whitespace-nowrap px-3 py-2">Chat</th><th node="[object Object]" class="whitespace-nowrap px-3 py-2">Mode Gambar</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">0–4</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">✳ Berpikir…</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">✳ Berpikir…</td></tr><tr><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">4–8</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">✳ Mencerna pertanyaan…</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">✳ Membayangkan gambarnya…</td></tr><tr><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">8–12</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">✳ Menelusuri kemungkinan…</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">✳ Menyiapkan kanvas…</td></tr><tr><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">12+</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">✳ Merangkai jawaban…</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">✳ Melukis perlahan…</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Semua tetap dengan shimmer menyapu + bintang terracotta berdenyut.</p><p><strong>3. Jawaban muncul kata per kata</strong> ⌨️<br>
Setelah berpikir selesai, jawaban Yuki diketik <strong>kata demi kata</strong> dengan delay <strong>0.14 detik/kata</strong> (agak lambat, terasa seperti sedang menulis) + <strong>caret oranye berkedip</strong> di ujung teks selama mengetik — persis sensasi jawaban Claude yang mengalir.</p><p><strong>⚙️ Mudah disetel nanti</strong> — semua angka ada di satu tempat di kode:</p><ul>
<li><code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">THINKING_MIN_SECONDS = 12.0</code> → durasi berpikir</li>
<li><code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">WORD_STREAM_DELAY = 0.14</code> → kecepatan kata per kata</li>
</ul><p>Coba dulu temponya — kalau ketikan katanya masih terlalu cepat/lambat, atau mau frasa berpikirnya diganti kalimat lain, tinggal bilang! 🖌️</p></div></div><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2"><div class="flex items-center gap-1"><div class="hover:bg-accent group flex items-center justify-center rounded-md p-1.5 transition-all" data-state="closed" data-slot="tooltip-trigger"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-interactive-positive transition-colors"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M12 1.25C6.06294 1.25 1.25 6.06294 1.25 12C1.25 17.9371 6.06294 22.75 12 22.75C17.9371 22.75 22.75 17.9371 22.75 12C22.75 6.06294 17.9371 1.25 12 1.25ZM7.53044 11.9697C7.23755 11.6768 6.76268 11.6768 6.46978 11.9697C6.17689 12.2626 6.17689 12.7374 6.46978 13.0303L9.46978 16.0303C9.76268 16.3232 10.2376 16.3232 10.5304 16.0303L17.5304 9.03033C17.8233 8.73744 17.8233 8.26256 17.5304 7.96967C17.2375 7.67678 16.7627 7.67678 16.4698 7.96967L10.0001 14.4393L7.53044 11.9697Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div><button type="button" aria-label="Copy" class="hover:bg-accent flex items-center justify-center rounded-md p-1.5 transition-all" data-state="closed" data-slot="tooltip-trigger"><svg width="14" height="14" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor"><path d="M19.4 20H9.6C9.26863 20 9 19.7314 9 19.4V9.6C9 9.26863 9.26863 9 9.6 9H19.4C19.7314 9 20 9.26863 20 9.6V19.4C20 19.7314 19.7314 20 19.4 20Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M15 9V4.6C15 4.26863 14.7314 4 14.4 4H4.6C4.26863 4 4 4.26863 4 4.6V14.4C4 14.7314 4.26863 15 4.6 15H9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></div></div><div><div class="group flex min-w-0 flex-col items-end gap-1"><div class="relative overflow-hidden bg-surface-raised rounded-lg w-fit max-w-[min(70%,768px)] border-transparent ml-0"><div class="px-3 text-text-primary body-base py-2"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><div class="prose prose-pre:bg-transparent prose-pre:p-0 text-wrap break-words prose-base body-base"><p>nah sekarang proses loading buat gambarnya jadi Progress bar % + shimmer</p></div></div></div></div><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-surface-primary disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 text-sm hover:bg-surface-tertiary focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:border-none font-normal relative text-text-secondary hover:text-text-primary size-3.5 flex-shrink-0 rounded-md p-1.5 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100" type="button"><svg width="14" height="14" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-interactive-positive absolute inset-0 m-auto rotate-90 opacity-0 transition-all duration-300"><path d="M5 13L9 17L19 7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><svg width="14" height="14" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="absolute inset-0 m-auto opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300"><path d="M19.4 20H9.6C9.26863 20 9 19.7314 9 19.4V9.6C9 9.26863 9.26863 9 9.6 9H19.4C19.7314 9 20 9.26863 20 9.6V19.4C20 19.7314 19.7314 20 19.4 20Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M15 9V4.6C15 4.26863 14.7314 4 14.4 4H4.6C4.26863 4 4 4.26863 4 4.6V14.4C4 14.7314 4.26863 15 4.6 15H9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button></div></div><div><div class="relative overflow-hidden bg-surface-primary rounded-xl border w-full border-transparent"><div class="px-3 pb-3"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><div><div class="body-sm flex items-center gap-1.5"><button type="button" class="text-text-tertiary hover:text-text-secondary shrink-0 p-0.5" aria-label="Expand" aria-expanded="false"><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="size-3 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="M9 6L15 12L9 18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button><span class="shrink-0 text-text-secondary">Edit</span><button type="button" class="bg-surface-tertiary text-text-tertiary hover:text-text-secondary truncate rounded-sm px-1 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] leading-tight">ampera-trinity-ai/app.py</button></div></div><div class="prose prose-pre:bg-transparent prose-pre:p-0 text-wrap break-words prose-base body-base"><p>Sekarang buat fungsi HTML progress bar dan ubah handler gambar — generate berjalan di thread background sementara progress % naik perlahan:</p></div><div><div class="body-sm flex items-center gap-1.5"><button type="button" class="text-text-tertiary hover:text-text-secondary shrink-0 p-0.5" aria-label="Expand" aria-expanded="false"><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="size-3 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="M9 6L15 12L9 18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button><span class="shrink-0 text-text-secondary">Edit</span><button type="button" class="bg-surface-tertiary text-text-tertiary hover:text-text-secondary truncate rounded-sm px-1 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] leading-tight">ampera-trinity-ai/app.py</button></div></div><div class="prose prose-pre:bg-transparent prose-pre:p-0 text-wrap break-words prose-base body-base"><p>Sekarang ganti handler gambar dengan versi progress bar. Generate dijalankan di thread agar % bisa terus di-update selama menunggu API:</p></div><div><div class="body-sm flex items-center gap-1.5"><button type="button" class="text-text-tertiary hover:text-text-secondary shrink-0 p-0.5" aria-label="Expand" aria-expanded="false"><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="size-3 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="M9 6L15 12L9 18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button><span class="shrink-0 text-text-secondary">Edit</span><button type="button" class="bg-surface-tertiary text-text-tertiary hover:text-text-secondary truncate rounded-sm px-1 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] leading-tight">ampera-trinity-ai/app.py</button></div></div><div class="prose prose-pre:bg-transparent prose-pre:p-0 text-wrap break-words prose-base body-base"><p>Tambahkan import <code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">threading</code> dan konstanta <code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">IMAGE_MIN_SECONDS</code>:</p></div><div><div class="body-sm flex items-center gap-1.5"><button type="button" class="text-text-tertiary hover:text-text-secondary shrink-0 p-0.5" aria-label="Expand" aria-expanded="false"><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="size-3 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="M9 6L15 12L9 18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button><span class="shrink-0 text-text-secondary">Edit</span><button type="button" class="bg-surface-tertiary text-text-tertiary hover:text-text-secondary truncate rounded-sm px-1 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] leading-tight">ampera-trinity-ai/app.py</button><span class="text-text-muted text-[10px]">×2</span></div></div><div role="button" tabindex="0" aria-pressed="false" class="group/artifact relative block w-full overflow-hidden rounded-lg border text-left transition duration-150 bg-surface-secondary border-border-faint shadow-[0px_0px_8px_0_rgba(0,0,0,0.04)] hover:border-border-medium hover:bg-surface-tertiary hover:shadow-none focus-visible:ring-interactive-active focus-visible:ring-offset-surface-primary cursor-pointer focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-2"><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-2"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="shrink-0 text-text-secondary" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 21.4V2.6C4 2.26863 4.26863 2 4.6 2H16.2515C16.4106 2 16.5632 2.06321 16.6757 2.17574L19.8243 5.32426C19.9368 5.43679 20 5.5894 20 5.74853V21.4C20 21.7314 19.7314 22 19.4 22H4.6C4.26863 22 4 21.7314 4 21.4Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M8 10L16 10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M8 18L16 18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M8 14L12 14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M16 2V5.4C16 5.73137 16.2686 6 16.6 6H20" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span class="min-w-0 flex-1 truncate text-sm font-normal text-text-primary">app.py</span><span class="bg-surface-secondary text-text-tertiary shrink-0 rounded-[4px] border px-1.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium uppercase leading-none border-border-medium">PYTHON</span></div></div><div><button type="button" aria-label="Expand" class="flex w-full select-none items-center gap-1.5 cursor-pointer" aria-expanded="false"><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-text-tertiary size-4 shrink-0"><path d="M13 16H18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M6 8L10 12L6 16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M2 18V6C2 4.89543 2.89543 4 4 4H20C21.1046 4 22 4.89543 22 6V18C22 19.1046 21.1046 20 20 20H4C2.89543 20 2 19.1046 2 18Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span class="flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1"><span class="text-text-tertiary body-sm leading-4">used</span><span class="text-text-secondary body-sm leading-4">Bash</span><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-interactive-positive size-4 shrink-0"><path d="M5 13L9 17L19 7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span class="text-text-tertiary shrink-0 font-mono text-[10px] leading-[1.2]">244ms</span></span><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-text-tertiary size-3 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="M6 9L12 15L18 9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button></div><div class="prose prose-pre:bg-transparent prose-pre:p-0 text-wrap break-words prose-base body-base"><p>✅ <strong>Selesai! Progress bar % + shimmer untuk generate gambar sudah live</strong> — refresh preview, nyalakan 🎨 Mode Gambar, lalu coba buat gambar.</p><h2>🎨 Yang baru — Loading Gambar:</h2><p><strong>Kartu progress ala Claude</strong> (putih gading, border lembut) berisi:</p><div class="overflow-x-auto"><table node="[object Object]" class="min-w-full"><thead><tr><th node="[object Object]" class="whitespace-nowrap px-3 py-2">Elemen</th><th node="[object Object]" class="whitespace-nowrap px-3 py-2">Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2"><strong>✳ Label shimmer</strong></td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">Bintang terracotta berdenyut + teks dengan kilau menyapu (sama seperti thinking chat)</td></tr><tr><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2"><strong>Persentase %</strong></td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">Angka oranye di kanan, naik real-time: cepat di awal → melambat → "mentok" di ~92% sampai gambar benar-benar jadi → lompat mulus ke <strong>100%</strong></td></tr><tr><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2"><strong>Progress bar</strong></td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">Track krem + isi gradasi terracotta dengan <strong>2 lapis shimmer</strong> (gradasi bergerak + kilau putih menyapu di atasnya), transisi lebar halus 0.5s</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p><strong>Label berganti mengikuti progress:</strong></p><div class="overflow-x-auto"><table node="[object Object]" class="min-w-full"><thead><tr><th node="[object Object]" class="whitespace-nowrap px-3 py-2">Progress</th><th node="[object Object]" class="whitespace-nowrap px-3 py-2">Teks</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">0–30%</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">✳ Membayangkan gambarnya…</td></tr><tr><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">30–55%</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">✳ Menyiapkan kanvas…</td></tr><tr><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">55–80%</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">✳ Melukis perlahan…</td></tr><tr><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">80–99%</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">✳ Menajamkan detail…</td></tr><tr><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">100%</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">✳ Selesai</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p><strong>⚙️ Teknis:</strong> pembuatan gambar berjalan di <strong>thread background</strong>, jadi persentase terus bergerak mulus selama menunggu Cloudflare FLUX — tidak beku. Durasi minimum animasi <strong>10 detik</strong> (<code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">IMAGE_MIN_SECONDS = 10.0</code>, gampang diubah), jadi walau API cepat, animasinya tetap terasa.</p><p>Coba generate gambar dan lihat barnya berjalan! Kalau mau % naiknya lebih lambat/cepat, warna bar beda, atau teks tahapannya diganti, tinggal bilang. 🖌️</p></div></div><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2"><div class="flex items-center gap-1"><div class="hover:bg-accent group flex items-center justify-center rounded-md p-1.5 transition-all" data-state="closed" data-slot="tooltip-trigger"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-interactive-positive transition-colors"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M12 1.25C6.06294 1.25 1.25 6.06294 1.25 12C1.25 17.9371 6.06294 22.75 12 22.75C17.9371 22.75 22.75 17.9371 22.75 12C22.75 6.06294 17.9371 1.25 12 1.25ZM7.53044 11.9697C7.23755 11.6768 6.76268 11.6768 6.46978 11.9697C6.17689 12.2626 6.17689 12.7374 6.46978 13.0303L9.46978 16.0303C9.76268 16.3232 10.2376 16.3232 10.5304 16.0303L17.5304 9.03033C17.8233 8.73744 17.8233 8.26256 17.5304 7.96967C17.2375 7.67678 16.7627 7.67678 16.4698 7.96967L10.0001 14.4393L7.53044 11.9697Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div><button type="button" aria-label="Copy" class="hover:bg-accent flex items-center justify-center rounded-md p-1.5 transition-all" data-state="closed" data-slot="tooltip-trigger"><svg width="14" height="14" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor"><path d="M19.4 20H9.6C9.26863 20 9 19.7314 9 19.4V9.6C9 9.26863 9.26863 9 9.6 9H19.4C19.7314 9 20 9.26863 20 9.6V19.4C20 19.7314 19.7314 20 19.4 20Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M15 9V4.6C15 4.26863 14.7314 4 14.4 4H4.6C4.26863 4 4 4.26863 4 4.6V14.4C4 14.7314 4.26863 15 4.6 15H9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></div></div><div><div class="group flex min-w-0 flex-col items-end gap-1"><div class="relative overflow-hidden bg-surface-raised rounded-lg w-fit max-w-[min(70%,768px)] border-transparent ml-0"><div class="px-3 text-text-primary body-base py-2"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><div class="prose prose-pre:bg-transparent prose-pre:p-0 text-wrap break-words prose-base body-base"><p>lalu untuk pilihan models multi ai dan mode gambarnya dimasukkan ke kotak chat input bisa nggak</p></div></div></div></div><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-surface-primary disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 text-sm hover:bg-surface-tertiary focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:border-none font-normal relative text-text-secondary hover:text-text-primary size-3.5 flex-shrink-0 rounded-md p-1.5 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100" type="button"><svg width="14" height="14" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-interactive-positive absolute inset-0 m-auto rotate-90 opacity-0 transition-all duration-300"><path d="M5 13L9 17L19 7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><svg width="14" height="14" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="absolute inset-0 m-auto opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300"><path d="M19.4 20H9.6C9.26863 20 9 19.7314 9 19.4V9.6C9 9.26863 9.26863 9 9.6 9H19.4C19.7314 9 20 9.26863 20 9.6V19.4C20 19.7314 19.7314 20 19.4 20Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M15 9V4.6C15 4.26863 14.7314 4 14.4 4H4.6C4.26863 4 4 4.26863 4 4.6V14.4C4 14.7314 4.26863 15 4.6 15H9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button></div></div><div><div class="relative overflow-hidden bg-surface-primary rounded-xl border w-full border-transparent"><div class="px-3 pb-3"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><div class="prose prose-pre:bg-transparent prose-pre:p-0 text-wrap break-words prose-base body-base"><p>Bisa! 💡 Triknya: <code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">st.chat_input</code> bawaan Streamlit memang tidak bisa diisi widget lain, tapi kita bisa <strong>menyatukannya secara visual</strong> — kotak input dibuat lebih tinggi, lalu baris kontrol (model + mode gambar) di-<em>pin</em> ke posisi tetap di dalam area bawah kotak itu. Hasilnya persis seperti Claude: teks di atas, tombol model di bawah dalam satu kartu.</p></div><div><div class="body-sm flex items-center gap-1.5"><button type="button" class="text-text-tertiary hover:text-text-secondary shrink-0 p-0.5" aria-label="Expand" aria-expanded="false"><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="size-3 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="M9 6L15 12L9 18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button><span class="shrink-0 text-text-secondary">Edit</span><button type="button" class="bg-surface-tertiary text-text-tertiary hover:text-text-secondary truncate rounded-sm px-1 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] leading-tight">ampera-trinity-ai/app.py</button></div></div><div class="prose prose-pre:bg-transparent prose-pre:p-0 text-wrap break-words prose-base body-base"><p>Sekarang tambahkan CSS untuk mem-<em>pin</em> baris kontrol ke dalam kotak input:</p></div><div><div class="body-sm flex items-center gap-1.5"><button type="button" class="text-text-tertiary hover:text-text-secondary shrink-0 p-0.5" aria-label="Expand" aria-expanded="false"><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="size-3 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="M9 6L15 12L9 18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button><span class="shrink-0 text-text-secondary">Edit</span><button type="button" class="bg-surface-tertiary text-text-tertiary hover:text-text-secondary truncate rounded-sm px-1 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] leading-tight">ampera-trinity-ai/app.py</button></div></div><div class="prose prose-pre:bg-transparent prose-pre:p-0 text-wrap break-words prose-base body-base"><p>Sekarang ubah <code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">main()</code> — bungkus kontrol dalam container ber-key <code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">chat_controls</code> sehingga CSS bisa memindahkannya ke dalam kotak input:</p></div><div><div class="body-sm flex items-center gap-1.5"><button type="button" class="text-text-tertiary hover:text-text-secondary shrink-0 p-0.5" aria-label="Expand" aria-expanded="false"><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="size-3 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="M9 6L15 12L9 18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button><span class="shrink-0 text-text-secondary">Edit</span><button type="button" class="bg-surface-tertiary text-text-tertiary hover:text-