h="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-text-tertiary size-4 shrink-0"><path d="M13 16H18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M6 8L10 12L6 16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M2 18V6C2 4.89543 2.89543 4 4 4H20C21.1046 4 22 4.89543 22 6V18C22 19.1046 21.1046 20 20 20H4C2.89543 20 2 19.1046 2 18Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span class="flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1"><span class="text-text-tertiary body-sm leading-4">used</span><span class="text-text-secondary body-sm leading-4">Bash</span><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-interactive-positive size-4 shrink-0"><path d="M5 13L9 17L19 7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span class="text-text-tertiary shrink-0 font-mono text-[10px] leading-[1.2]">778ms</span></span><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-text-tertiary size-3 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="M6 9L12 15L18 9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button></div><div class="prose prose-pre:bg-transparent prose-pre:p-0 text-wrap break-words prose-base body-base"><p>✅ <strong>Bisa dan sudah jadi!</strong> Refresh preview untuk melihatnya.</p><h2>📥 Kontrol sekarang DI DALAM kotak chat input</h2><p>Persis konsep Claude — satu kartu input berisi:</p><pre><div class="not-prose my-0 flex w-full flex-col overflow-clip border border-border text-text-primary rounded-lg not-prose relative" data-code-block="true"><div class="border-border flex items-center justify-between border-b px-4 py-2"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg width="14" stroke-width="1.5" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-text-secondary"><path d="M9.00001 21L8.00001 21C6.89544 21 6.00001 20.1057 6.00001 19.0011C6.00001 17.4501 6.00001 15.3443 6 14C6 13 4.5 12 4.5 12C4.5 12 6.00001 11 6.00001 10C6.00001 8.827 6.00001 6.62207 6.00001 4.99914C6.00001 3.89457 6.89544 3 8.00001 3L9.00001 3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M15 21L16 21C17.1046 21 18 20.1057 18 19.0011C18 17.4501 18 15.3443 18 14C18 13 19.5 12 19.5 12C19.5 12 18 11 18 10C18 8.827 18 6.62207 18 4.99914C18 3.89457 17.1046 3 16 3L15 3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span class="text-text-secondary text-sm font-medium">text</span></div><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-surface-primary disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 text-sm text-interactive-active hover:text-interactive-normal active:text-text-tertiary font-normal relative rounded-lg p-[6px]" type="button" data-state="closed" data-slot="tooltip-trigger"><svg width="16" height="16" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-interactive-positive absolute inset-0 m-auto rotate-90 opacity-0 transition-all duration-300"><path d="M5 13L9 17L19 7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><svg width="16" height="16" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="absolute inset-0 m-auto opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300"><path d="M19.4 20H9.6C9.26863 20 9 19.7314 9 19.4V9.6C9 9.26863 9.26863 9 9.6 9H19.4C19.7314 9 20 9.26863 20 9.6V19.4C20 19.7314 19.7314 20 19.4 20Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M15 9V4.6C15 4.26863 14.7314 4 14.4 4H4.6C4.26863 4 4 4.26863 4 4.6V14.4C4 14.7314 4.26863 15 4.6 15H9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button></div><div class="code-block_container__lbMX4"><pre class="shiki github-dark shiki-code-block" style="background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8" tabindex="0"><code class="whitespace-pre-wrap break-words"><span class="line"><span>┌──────────────────────────────────────────────┐</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>│  Tanya apa saja ke Yuki...              [➤] │   ← baris ketik</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>│                                              │</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>│  ( ⚡ GPT-OSS 20B ▾ )   ( 🎨 Gambar ⚪ )      │   ← baris kontrol di dalam kotak</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>└──────────────────────────────────────────────┘</span></span></code></pre></div></div></pre><p><strong>Cara kerjanya (teknis):</strong></p><ul>
<li>Kotak <code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">st.chat_input</code> diberi <strong>padding bawah ekstra (52px)</strong> — menciptakan ruang kosong di dalam kartu inputnya</li>
<li>Baris kontrol (popover model + toggle gambar) dibungkus <code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">st.container(key="chat_controls")</code>, lalu CSS memindahkannya dengan <code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">position: fixed</code> <strong>tepat ke ruang kosong itu</strong> — jadi secara visual menyatu dalam satu kartu putih</li>
<li>Tombol model diubah jadi <strong>chip pill kecil</strong> transparan (abu lembut, hover jadi oranye) — mirip pemilih model di Claude yang ada di pojok bawah input</li>
<li>Toggle 🎨 Gambar ikut mengecil dan sejajar di sampingnya</li>
</ul><p><strong>Yang berubah:</strong></p><div class="overflow-x-auto"><table node="[object Object]" class="min-w-full"><thead><tr><th node="[object Object]" class="whitespace-nowrap px-3 py-2">Sebelum</th><th node="[object Object]" class="whitespace-nowrap px-3 py-2">Sekarang</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">Tombol model &amp; toggle di <strong>atas</strong> kolom input (terpisah)</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2"><strong>Di dalam</strong> kartu input, baris bawah</td></tr><tr><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">Tombol besar kotak</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">Chip pill kecil ala Claude: <code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">⚡ GPT-OSS 20B ▾</code></td></tr><tr><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">Badge "Mode Gambar aktif" terpisah</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">Cukup toggle 🎨 Gambar yang menyala terracotta</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Silakan cek preview! Catatan: karena ini trik CSS <code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">position: fixed</code>, kalau nanti di layar HP posisinya sedikit meleset, kabari saja — tinggal saya tambahkan penyesuaian <code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">@media</code> untuk mobile. 📱</p></div></div><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2"><div class="flex items-center gap-1"><div class="hover:bg-accent group flex items-center justify-center rounded-md p-1.5 transition-all" data-state="closed" data-slot="tooltip-trigger"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-interactive-positive transition-colors"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M12 1.25C6.06294 1.25 1.25 6.06294 1.25 12C1.25 17.9371 6.06294 22.75 12 22.75C17.9371 22.75 22.75 17.9371 22.75 12C22.75 6.06294 17.9371 1.25 12 1.25ZM7.53044 11.9697C7.23755 11.6768 6.76268 11.6768 6.46978 11.9697C6.17689 12.2626 6.17689 12.7374 6.46978 13.0303L9.46978 16.0303C9.76268 16.3232 10.2376 16.3232 10.5304 16.0303L17.5304 9.03033C17.8233 8.73744 17.8233 8.26256 17.5304 7.96967C17.2375 7.67678 16.7627 7.67678 16.4698 7.96967L10.0001 14.4393L7.53044 11.9697Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div><button type="button" aria-label="Copy" class="hover:bg-accent flex items-center justify-center rounded-md p-1.5 transition-all" data-state="closed" data-slot="tooltip-trigger"><svg width="14" height="14" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor"><path d="M19.4 20H9.6C9.26863 20 9 19.7314 9 19.4V9.6C9 9.26863 9.26863 9 9.6 9H19.4C19.7314 9 20 9.26863 20 9.6V19.4C20 19.7314 19.7314 20 19.4 20Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M15 9V4.6C15 4.26863 14.7314 4 14.4 4H4.6C4.26863 4 4 4.26863 4 4.6V14.4C4 14.7314 4.26863 15 4.6 15H9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></div></div><div><div class="group flex min-w-0 flex-col items-end gap-1"><div class="relative overflow-hidden bg-surface-raised rounded-lg w-fit max-w-[min(70%,768px)] border-transparent ml-0"><div class="px-3 text-text-primary body-base py-2"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><div class="prose prose-pre:bg-transparent prose-pre:p-0 text-wrap break-words prose-base body-base"><p>lalu untuk pilihan modelsnya dibuat tulisan biasa aja tanpa ada kolomnya, baru nanti untuk pop up pilihannya kasih kolom tanpa setiap nama models nya diberi kolom sendiri sendiri, apakah perlu saya beri contohnya yang mirip claude</p></div></div></div></div><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-surface-primary disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 text-sm hover:bg-surface-tertiary focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:border-none font-normal relative text-text-secondary hover:text-text-primary size-3.5 flex-shrink-0 rounded-md p-1.5 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100" type="button"><svg width="14" height="14" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-interactive-positive absolute inset-0 m-auto rotate-90 opacity-0 transition-all duration-300"><path d="M5 13L9 17L19 7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><svg width="14" height="14" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="absolute inset-0 m-auto opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300"><path d="M19.4 20H9.6C9.26863 20 9 19.7314 9 19.4V9.6C9 9.26863 9.26863 9 9.6 9H19.4C19.7314 9 20 9.26863 20 9.6V19.4C20 19.7314 19.7314 20 19.4 20Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M15 9V4.6C15 4.26863 14.7314 4 14.4 4H4.6C4.26863 4 4 4.26863 4 4.6V14.4C4 14.7314 4.26863 15 4.6 15H9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button></div></div><div><div class="relative overflow-hidden bg-surface-primary rounded-xl border w-full border-transparent"><div class="px-3 pb-3"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><div class="prose prose-pre:bg-transparent prose-pre:p-0 text-wrap break-words prose-base body-base"><p>Tidak perlu contoh, saya paham maksudnya! 👍 Persis seperti Claude:</p><ol>
<li><strong>Pemicu</strong> → tulisan biasa saja <code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">⚡ GPT-OSS 20B ▾</code> tanpa kotak/border, hover baru muncul highlight lembut</li>
<li><strong>Pop-up</strong> → satu panel/kartu membulat, dan di dalamnya nama-nama model jadi <strong>baris teks polos</strong> (tanpa kotak masing-masing), hover baru menyala lembut</li>
