em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-text-tertiary size-4 shrink-0"><path d="M13 17H20" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M5 7L10 12L5 17" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span class="text-text-secondary shrink-0">Ran commands</span><span class="text-text-tertiary">2</span></button></div><div class="text-text-primary rounded-md border border-border-faint bg-surface-secondary/50 shadow-none my-0"><button type="button" class="flex w-full items-center gap-2 bg-transparent px-2.5 py-2 text-left" aria-expanded="false"><span class="text-text-tertiary flex shrink-0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-play size-3.5"><polygon points="6 3 20 12 6 21 6 3"></polygon></svg></span><span class="body-sm text-text-secondary min-w-0 flex-1 truncate"><span class="flex min-w-0 items-center gap-2"><span class="truncate">Start Ampera Trinity AI</span><span class="text-text-muted shrink-0 font-mono text-xs tabular-nums">:8501</span></span></span><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-text-tertiary size-3 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="M9 6L15 12L9 18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-interactive-positive size-3"><path d="M5 13L9 17L19 7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button></div><div><button type="button" aria-label="Expand" class="flex w-full select-none items-center gap-1.5 cursor-pointer" aria-expanded="false"><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-text-tertiary size-4 shrink-0"><path d="M13 16H18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M6 8L10 12L6 16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M2 18V6C2 4.89543 2.89543 4 4 4H20C21.1046 4 22 4.89543 22 6V18C22 19.1046 21.1046 20 20 20H4C2.89543 20 2 19.1046 2 18Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span class="flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1"><span class="text-text-tertiary body-sm leading-4">used</span><span class="text-text-secondary body-sm leading-4">Bash</span><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-interactive-positive size-4 shrink-0"><path d="M5 13L9 17L19 7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span class="text-text-tertiary shrink-0 font-mono text-[10px] leading-[1.2]">3.1s</span></span><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-text-tertiary size-3 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="M6 9L12 15L18 9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button></div><div class="prose prose-pre:bg-transparent prose-pre:p-0 text-wrap break-words prose-base body-base"><p>✅ <strong>Selesai! Jaraknya sudah dirapatkan</strong> — refresh preview untuk melihatnya.</p><h2>📐 Yang diubah:</h2><div class="overflow-x-auto"><table node="[object Object]" class="min-w-full"><thead><tr><th node="[object Object]" class="whitespace-nowrap px-3 py-2">Sebelum</th><th node="[object Object]" class="whitespace-nowrap px-3 py-2">Sekarang</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2"><code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">Compound Mini ⌄</code> ........................ <code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">🎨 Gambar</code> (toggle terlempar jauh ke kanan)</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2"><code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">Compound Mini ⌄  🎨 Gambar</code> (berdampingan rapat di kiri)</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p><strong>Teknisnya:</strong></p><ul>
<li>Kolom model &amp; toggle sekarang <strong>menyusut mengikuti isi teksnya</strong> (<code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">flex: 0 0 auto</code>) — tidak lagi dipaksa melebar</li>
<li>Gap antar kolom dirapatkan dari 8px → <strong>2px</strong></li>
<li>Kolom spacer di kanan yang menyerap semua sisa ruang — jadi kedua kontrol menempel rapi di kiri, mirip deretan <code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">+ | Chat | Cowork</code> di Claude</li>
</ul><p>Cek hasilnya — kalau masih kurang rapat/terlalu rapat, atau mau keduanya di posisi lain (misal model di kiri, toggle di kanan ujung seperti <code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">Sonnet 5</code> di Claude), tinggal bilang! 🖌️</p></div></div><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2"><div class="flex items-center gap-1"><div class="hover:bg-accent group flex items-center justify-center rounded-md p-1.5 transition-all" data-state="closed" data-slot="tooltip-trigger"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-interactive-positive transition-colors"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M12 1.25C6.06294 1.25 1.25 6.06294 1.25 12C1.25 17.9371 6.06294 22.75 12 22.75C17.9371 22.75 22.75 17.9371 22.75 12C22.75 6.06294 17.9371 1.25 12 1.25ZM7.53044 11.9697C7.23755 11.6768 6.76268 11.6768 6.46978 11.9697C6.17689 12.2626 6.17689 12.7374 6.46978 13.0303L9.46978 16.0303C9.76268 16.3232 10.2376 16.3232 10.5304 16.0303L17.5304 9.03033C17.8233 8.73744 17.8233 8.26256 17.5304 7.96967C17.2375 7.67678 16.7627 7.67678 16.4698 7.96967L10.0001 14.4393L7.53044 11.9697Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div><button type="button" aria-label="Copy" class="hover:bg-accent flex items-center justify-center rounded-md p-1.5 transition-all" data-state="closed" data-slot="tooltip-trigger"><svg width="14" height="14" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor"><path d="M19.4 20H9.6C9.26863 20 9 19.7314 9 19.4V9.6C9 9.26863 9.26863 9 9.6 9H19.4C19.7314 9 20 9.26863 20 9.6V19.4C20 19.7314 19.7314 20 19.4 20Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M15 9V4.6C15 4.26863 14.7314 4 14.4 4H4.6C4.26863 4 4 4.26863 4 4.6V14.4C4 14.7314 4.26863 15 4.6 15H9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="r