laude sudah live</strong> — refresh preview untuk melihatnya.</p><h2>📚 Sidebar baru, mengikuti contoh screenshot Anda:</h2><pre><div class="not-prose my-0 flex w-full flex-col overflow-clip border border-border text-text-primary rounded-lg not-prose relative" data-code-block="true"><div class="border-border flex items-center justify-between border-b px-4 py-2"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg width="14" stroke-width="1.5" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-text-secondary"><path d="M9.00001 21L8.00001 21C6.89544 21 6.00001 20.1057 6.00001 19.0011C6.00001 17.4501 6.00001 15.3443 6 14C6 13 4.5 12 4.5 12C4.5 12 6.00001 11 6.00001 10C6.00001 8.827 6.00001 6.62207 6.00001 4.99914C6.00001 3.89457 6.89544 3 8.00001 3L9.00001 3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M15 21L16 21C17.1046 21 18 20.1057 18 19.0011C18 17.4501 18 15.3443 18 14C18 13 19.5 12 19.5 12C19.5 12 18 11 18 10C18 8.827 18 6.62207 18 4.99914C18 3.89457 17.1046 3 16 3L15 3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span class="text-text-secondary text-sm font-medium">text</span></div><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-surface-primary disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 text-sm text-interactive-active hover:text-interactive-normal active:text-text-tertiary font-normal relative rounded-lg p-[6px]" type="button" data-state="closed" data-slot="tooltip-trigger"><svg width="16" height="16" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-interactive-positive absolute inset-0 m-auto rotate-90 opacity-0 transition-all duration-300"><path d="M5 13L9 17L19 7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><svg width="16" height="16" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="absolute inset-0 m-auto opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300"><path d="M19.4 20H9.6C9.26863 20 9 19.7314 9 19.4V9.6C9 9.26863 9.26863 9 9.6 9H19.4C19.7314 9 20 9.26863 20 9.6V19.4C20 19.7314 19.7314 20 19.4 20Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M15 9V4.6C15 4.26863 14.7314 4 14.4 4H4.6C4.26863 4 4 4.26863 4 4.6V14.4C4 14.7314 4.26863 15 4.6 15H9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button></div><div class="code-block_container__lbMX4"><pre class="shiki github-dark shiki-code-block" style="background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8" tabindex="0"><code class="whitespace-pre-wrap break-words"><span class="line"><span>┌──────────────────────┐</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>│ Trinity              │  ← brand serif (seperti "Claude")</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>│                      │</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>│ ＋ Baru              │  ← latar krem menonjol, mulai obrolan baru</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>│ 💬 Chat              │  ← langsung set mode chat</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>│ 🎨 Gambar            │  ← langsung set mode gambar</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>│ ──────────────       │</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>│ Hari ini             │  ← label grup abu kecil</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>│  Perbaiki code app…  │  ← riwayat, teks polos + elipsis</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>│  Cara melihat pass…  │</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>│ ──────────────       │</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>│ 📥 Unduh Chat        │</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>│ (A) Ampera · Free    │  ← baris akun ala Claude</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>└──────────────────────┘</span></span></code></pre></div></div></pre><p><strong>Detail gaya (meniru Claude):</strong></p><ul>
<li>Latar sidebar putih-krem <code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">#F5F4EF</code> + border kanan tipis</li>
<li>Semua menu = <strong>teks polos rata kiri</strong>, hover krem lembut — tanpa kotak</li>
<li>Tombol <strong>＋ Baru</strong> sedikit menonjol dengan latar krem (seperti di screenshot)</li>
<li>Riwayat: judul otomatis dari <strong>pesan pertama user</strong>, dipotong elipsis 1 baris</li>
<li>Baris akun bawah: avatar bulat gelap "A" + <strong>Ampera · Free</strong></li>
</ul><p><strong>Bonus fungsional</strong> (bukan cuma tampilan):</p><ul>
<li><strong>Riwayat beneran jalan</strong> — obrolan lama tersimpan saat klik ＋ Baru, dan <strong>bisa dibuka lagi</strong> dengan mengkliknya di sidebar</li>
<li>Menu 💬 Chat / 🎨 Gambar juga berfungsi sebagai shortcut ganti mode</li>
</ul><p>⚠️ <em>Catatan:</em> riwayat tersimpan di session — kalau halaman di-refresh penuh, riwayat ikut hilang (perilaku bawaan Streamlit). Kalau nanti mau permanen (tersimpan ke file), bisa kita tambahkan.</p><p>Cek tampilannya — kalau ada yang mau dipoles (ikon lain, urutan menu, nama brand di sidebar mau "Trinity" atau yang lain), bilang saja! 🖌️</p></div></div><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2"><div class="flex items-center gap-1"><div class="hover:bg-accent group flex items-center justify-center rounded-md p-1.5 transition-all" data-state="closed" data-slot="tooltip-trigger"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-interactive-positive transition-colors"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M12 1.25C6.06294 1.25 1.25 6.06294 1.25 12C1.25 17.9371 6.06294 22.75 12 22.75C17.9371 22.75 22.75 17.9371 22.75 12C22.75 6.06294 17.9371 1.25 12 1.25ZM7.53044 11.9697C7.23755 11.6768 6.76268 11.6768 6.46978 11.9697C6.17689 12.2626 6.17689 12.7374 6.46978 13.0303L9.46978 16.0303C9.76268 16.3232 10.2376 16.3232 10.5304 16.0303L17.5304 9.03033C17.8233 8.73744 17.8233 8.26256 17.5304 7.96967C17.2375 7.67678 16.7627 7.67678 16.4698 7.96967L10.0001 14.4393L7.53044 11.9697Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div><button type="button" aria-label="Copy" class="hover:bg-accent flex items-center justify-center rounded-md p-1.5 transition-all" data-state="closed" data-slot="tooltip-trigger"><svg width="14" height="14" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor"><path d="M19.4 20H9.6C9.26863 20 9 19.7314 9 19.4V9.6C9 9.26863 9.26863 9 9.6 9H19.4C19.7314 9 20 9.26863 20 9.6V19.4C20 19.7314 19.7314 20 19.4 20Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M15 9V4.6C15 4.26863 14.7314 4 14.4 4H4.6C4.26863 4 4 4.26863 4 4.6V14.4C4 14.7314 4.26863 15 4.6 15H9" stroke="curre