><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-text-tertiary size-3 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="M9 6L15 12L9 18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-text-tertiary size-4 shrink-0"><path d="M13 17H20" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M5 7L10 12L5 17" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span class="text-text-secondary shrink-0">Ran commands</span><span class="text-text-tertiary">2</span></button></div><div class="text-text-primary rounded-md border border-border-faint bg-surface-secondary/50 shadow-none my-0"><button type="button" class="flex w-full items-center gap-2 bg-transparent px-2.5 py-2 text-left" aria-expanded="false"><span class="text-text-tertiary flex shrink-0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-play size-3.5"><polygon points="6 3 20 12 6 21 6 3"></polygon></svg></span><span class="body-sm text-text-secondary min-w-0 flex-1 truncate"><span class="flex min-w-0 items-center gap-2"><span class="truncate">Start Ampera Trinity AI</span><span class="text-text-muted shrink-0 font-mono text-xs tabular-nums">:8501</span></span></span><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-text-tertiary size-3 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="M9 6L15 12L9 18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-interactive-positive size-3"><path d="M5 13L9 17L19 7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button></div><div><button type="button" aria-label="Expand" class="flex w-full select-none items-center gap-1.5 cursor-pointer" aria-expanded="false"><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-text-tertiary size-4 shrink-0"><path d="M13 16H18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M6 8L10 12L6 16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M2 18V6C2 4.89543 2.89543 4 4 4H20C21.1046 4 22 4.89543 22 6V18C22 19.1046 21.1046 20 20 20H4C2.89543 20 2 19.1046 2 18Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span class="flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1"><span class="text-text-tertiary body-sm leading-4">used</span><span class="text-text-secondary body-sm leading-4">Bash</span><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-interactive-positive size-4 shrink-0"><path d="M5 13L9 17L19 7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span class="text-text-tertiary shrink-0 font-mono text-[10px] leading-[1.2]">4.1s</span></span><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-text-tertiary size-3 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="M6 9L12 15L18 9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button></div><div class="prose prose-pre:bg-transparent prose-pre:p-0 text-wrap break-words prose-base body-base"><p>✅ <strong>Diperbaiki!</strong> Refresh penuh halaman preview-nya.</p><h2>🔧 Penyebab &amp; solusi:</h2><p><strong>Masalah:</strong> Judul <em>"✳ Semangat lagi, Ampera!"</em> tertutup — karena dok bawah Streamlit (yang berisi kotak input) punya <strong>latar krem opak</strong> dari CSS lama (<code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">[data-testid="stBottom"] { background: #F0EEE6 }</code>). Saat dok diangkat ke tengah layar, area dok yang tinggi itu ikut terbawa dan <strong>menimpa tulisan judul</strong> di belakangnya (di screenshot Anda terlihat cuma ujung-ujung hurufnya yang mengintip).</p><p><strong>Solusi:</strong></p><ol>
<li><strong>Semua lapisan dok dibuat transparan</strong> saat halaman awal (<code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">stBottom</code> + semua div anak-anaknya) — jadi hanya kotak input &amp; kontrolnya yang terlihat, tidak ada "tembok krem" yang menutupi</li>
<li>Posisi judul dinaikkan sedikit (<code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">26vh → 20vh</code>) supaya jarak judul ↔ input lebih pas seperti Claude</li>
</ol><p>Sekarang harusnya tampil:</p><pre><div class="not-prose my-0 flex w-full flex-col overflow-clip border border-border text-text-primary rounded-lg not-prose relative" data-code-block="true"><div class="border-border flex items-center justify-between border-b px-4 py-2"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg width="14" stroke-width="1.5" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-text-secondary"><path d="M9.00001 21L8.00001 21C6.89544 21 6.00001 20.1057 6.00001 19.0011C6.00001 17.4501 6.00001 15.3443 6 14C6 13 4.5 12 4.5 12C4.5 12 6.00001 11 6.00001 10C6.00001 8.827 6.00001 6.62207 6.00001 4.99914C6.00001 3.89457 6.89544 3 8.00001 3L9.00001 3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M15 21L16 21C17.1046 21 18 20.1057 18 19.0011C18 17.4501 18 15.3443 18 14C18 13 19.5 12 19.5 12C19.5 12 18 11 18 10C18 8.827 18 6.62207 18 4.99914C18 3.89457 17.1046 3 16 3L15 3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span class="text-text-secondary text-sm font-medium">text</span></div><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-surface-primary disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 text-sm text-interactive-active hover:text-interactive-normal active:text-text-tertiary font-normal relative rounded-lg p-[6px]" type="button" data-state="closed" data-slot="tooltip-trigger"><svg width="16" height="16" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-interactive-positive absolute inset-0 m-auto rotate-90 opacity-0 transition-all duration-300"><path d="M5 13L9 17L19 7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><svg width="16" height="16" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="absolute inset-0 m-auto opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300"><path d="M19.4 20H9.6C9.26863 20 9 19.7314 9 19.4V9.6C9 9.26863 9.26863 9 9.6 9H19.4C19.7314 9 20 9.26863 20 9.6V19.4C20 19.7314 19.7314 20 19.4 20Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M15 9V4.6C15 4.26863 14.7314 4 14.4 4H4.6C4.26863 4 4 4.26863 4 4.6V14.4C4 14.7314 4.26863 15 4.6 15H9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button></div><div class="code-block_container__lbMX4"><pre class="shiki github-dark shiki-code-block" style="background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8" tabindex="0"><code class="whitespace-pre-wrap break-words"><span class="line"><span>      ✳ Semangat lagi, Ampera!      ← terlihat penuh</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>  ┌─────────────────────────────┐</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>  │ Apa yang bisa Yuki bantu…   │</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>  └─────────────────────────────┘</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    ⚪ Gambar          Model ⌄</span></span></code></pre></div></div></pre><p>Cek lagi — kalau jarak judul dengan kotak input masih terlalu jauh/dekat di layar Anda, kirim screenshot dan tinggal saya setel angkanya. 🖌️</p></div></div><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2"><div class="flex items-center gap-1"><div class="hover:bg-accent group flex items-center justify-center rounded-md p-1.5 transition-all" data-state="closed" data-slot="tooltip-trigger"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-interactive-positive transition-colors"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M12 1.25C6.06294 1.25 1.25 6.06294 1.25 12C1.25 17.9371 6.06294 22.75 12 22.75C17.9371 22.75 22.75 17.9371 22.75 12C22.75 6.06294 17.9371 1.25 12 1.25ZM7.53044 11.9697C7.23755 11.6768 6.76268 11.6768 6.46978 11.9697C6.17689 12.2626 6.17689 12.7374 6.46978 13.0303L9.46978 16.0303C9.76268 16.3232 10.2376 16.3232 10.5304 16.0303L17.5304 9.03033C17.8233 8.73744 17.8233 8.26256 17.5304 7.96967C17.2375 7.67678 16.7627 7.67678 16.4698 7.96967L10.0001 14.4393L7.53044 11.9697Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div><button type="button" aria-label="Copy" class="hover:bg-accent flex items-center justify-center rounded-md p-1.5 transition-all" data-state="closed" data-slot="tooltip-trigger"><svg width="14" height="14" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor"><path d="M19.4 20H9.6C9.26863 20 9 19.7314 9 19.4V9.6C9 9.26863 9.26863 9 9.6 9H19.4C19.7314 9 20 9.26863 20 9.6V19.4C20 19.7314 19.7314 20 19.4 20Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M15 9V4.6C15 4.26863 14.7314 4 14.4 4H4.6C4.26863 4 4 4.26863 4 4.6V14.4C4 14.7314 4.26863 15 4.6 15H9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></div></div><div><div class="mb-2 ml-auto flex max-w-[min(70%,768px)] flex-wrap items-start justify-end gap-1.5"><span class="border-border-medium bg-surface-primary group inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded border px-1.5 py-1 transition-colors"><img alt="image.png" class="h-4 w-4 shrink-0 rounded-[1px] object-cover" src="./logo_thinking_small_files/lrcP7islJpJy2C3w6PbC-_eOnPQRQC4OiiWfLbzntfg"><span class="text-text-tertiary group-hover:text-text-primary max-w-[140px] truncate text-sm">image.png</span></span></div><div class="group flex min-w-0 flex-col items-end gap-1"><div class="relative overflow-hidden bg-surface-raised rounded-lg w-fit max-w-[min(70%,768px)] border-transparent ml-0"><div class="px-3 text-text-primary body-base py-2"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><div class="prose prose-pre:bg-transparent prose-pre:p-0 text-wrap break-words prose-base body-base"><p>lalu judulnya ketutupan kotak input, jadi kotak inputnya agak diturunkan lagi, kemudian untuk tampilan awalan nya dibuat supaya nggak bisa di scroll kebawah dan keatas, baru nanti kalo udah mulai chat bisa discroll, dan untuk kotak chat inputnya langsung diturunkan saat user tekan kirim</p></div></div></div></div><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-surface-primary disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 text-sm hover:bg-surface-tertiary focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:border-none font-normal relative text-text-secondary hover:text-text-primary size-3.5 flex-shrink-0 rounded-md p-1.5 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100" type="button"><svg width="14" height="14" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-interactive-positive absolute inset-0 m-auto rotate-90 opacity-0 transition-all duration-300">