></div><div role="button" tabindex="0" aria-pressed="false" class="group/artifact relative block w-full overflow-hidden rounded-lg border text-left transition duration-150 bg-surface-secondary border-border-faint shadow-[0px_0px_8px_0_rgba(0,0,0,0.04)] hover:border-border-medium hover:bg-surface-tertiary hover:shadow-none focus-visible:ring-interactive-active focus-visible:ring-offset-surface-primary cursor-pointer focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-2"><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-2"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="shrink-0 text-text-secondary" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 21.4V2.6C4 2.26863 4.26863 2 4.6 2H16.2515C16.4106 2 16.5632 2.06321 16.6757 2.17574L19.8243 5.32426C19.9368 5.43679 20 5.5894 20 5.74853V21.4C20 21.7314 19.7314 22 19.4 22H4.6C4.26863 22 4 21.7314 4 21.4Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M8 10L16 10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M8 18L16 18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M8 14L12 14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M16 2V5.4C16 5.73137 16.2686 6 16.6 6H20" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span class="min-w-0 flex-1 truncate text-sm font-normal text-text-primary">app.py</span><span class="bg-surface-secondary text-text-tertiary shrink-0 rounded-[4px] border px-1.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium uppercase leading-none border-border-medium">PYTHON</span></div></div><div><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" class="body-sm group flex w-full cursor-pointer items-center gap-1.5 leading-[1]"><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentCol