-positive size-3"><path d="M5 13L9 17L19 7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button></div><div><button type="button" aria-label="Expand" class="flex w-full select-none items-center gap-1.5 cursor-pointer" aria-expanded="false"><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-text-tertiary size-4 shrink-0"><path d="M13 16H18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M6 8L10 12L6 16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M2 18V6C2 4.89543 2.89543 4 4 4H20C21.1046 4 22 4.89543 22 6V18C22 19.1046 21.1046 20 20 20H4C2.89543 20 2 19.1046 2 18Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span class="flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1"><span class="text-text-tertiary body-sm leading-4">used</span><span class="text-text-secondary body-sm leading-4">Bash</span><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-interactive-positive size-4 shrink-0"><path d="M5 13L9 17L19 7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span class="text-text-tertiary shrink-0 font-mono text-[10px] leading-[1.2]">4.1s</span></span><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-text-tertiary size-3 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="M6 9L12 15L18 9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button></div><div class="prose prose-pre:bg-transparent prose-pre:p-0 text-wrap break-words prose-base body-base"><p>✅ <strong>Selesai! Ketiga permintaan sudah diterapkan</strong> — refresh penuh halaman preview untuk melihatnya.</p><h2>🔧 Yang diperbaiki:</h2><p><strong>1. Judul tidak ketutupan lagi</strong> 📏</p><ul>
<li>Kotak input diturunkan: <code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">-38vh</code> → <strong><code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">-26vh</code></strong> (turun cukup jauh dari judul)</li>
<li>Judul juga dinaikkan sedikit (<code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">20vh</code> → <code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">18vh</code>)</li>
<li>Sekarang ada ruang lega antara <em>"✳ Semangat lagi, Ampera!"</em> dan kotak input, seperti di Claude</li>
</ul><p><strong>2. Halaman awal terkunci — tidak bisa di-scroll</strong> 🔒</p><ul>
<li>Saat belum ada chat: <code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">overflow: hidden</code> di semua lapisan halaman (atas/bawah tidak bergerak sama sekali)</li>
<li>Setelah chat dimulai: scroll otomatis normal kembali (CSS kunci hanya dirender saat halaman awal)</li>
</ul><p><strong>3. Input langsung turun saat tekan kirim</strong> ⬇️</p><ul>
<li>Begitu tombol kirim ditekan, CSS penimpa langsung disuntikkan: <code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">transform: translateY(0)</code> + scroll diaktifkan lagi — jadi kotak input <strong>meluncur ke bawah seketika</strong> (dengan transisi halus 0.35 detik), tanpa menunggu jawaban selesai</li>
<li>Ditambah <code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">transition</code> di dok input, gerakan turunnya jadi animasi mulus, bukan lompatan kasar</li>
</ul><p><strong>Alur lengkapnya sekarang:</strong></p><ol>
<li>Buka app → judul + input di tengah, layar terkunci (tidak bisa scroll)</li>
<li>Ketik pesan → tekan kirim → input <strong>meluncur turun</strong> ke posisi bawah</li>
<li>Muncul ✳ thinking ~12 detik → jawaban diketik kata per kata</li>
<li>Scroll aktif normal untuk membaca percakapan</li>
</ol><p>Silakan coba alurnya dari awal (klik ＋ Baru di sidebar untuk balik ke halaman awal). Kalau jarak judul-input masih kurang pas atau animasi turunnya kurang halus, kabari! 🖌️</p></div></div><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2"><div class="flex items-center gap-1"><div class="hover:bg-accent group flex items-center justify-center rounded-md p-1.5 transition-all" data-state="closed" data-slot="tooltip-trigger"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-interactive-positive transition-colors"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M12 1.25C6.06294 1.25 1.25 6.06294 1.25 12C1.25 17.9371 6.06294 22.75 12 22.75C17.9371 22.75 22.75 17.9371 22.75 12C22.75 6.06294 17.9371 1.25 12 1.25ZM7.53044 11.9697C7.23755 11.6768 6.76268 11.6768 6.46978 11.9697C6.17689 12.2626 6.17689 12.7374 6.46978 13.0303L9.46978 16.0303C9.76268 16.3232 10.2376 16.3232 10.5304 16.0303L17.5304 9.03033C17.8233 8.73744 17.8233 8.26256 17.5304 7.96967C17.2375 7.67678 16.7627 7.67678 16.4698 7.96967L10.0001 14.4393L7.53044 11.9697Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div><button type="button" aria-label="Copy" class="hover:bg-accent flex items-center justify-center rounded-md p-1.5 transition-all" data-state="closed" data-slot="tooltip-trigger"><svg width="14" height="14" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor"><path d="M19.4 20H9.6C9.26863 20 9 19.7314 9 19.4V9.6C9 9.26863 9.26863 9 9.6 9H19.4C19.7314 9 20 9.26863 20 9.6V19.4C20 19.7314 19.7314 20 19.4 20Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M15 9V4.6C15 4.26863 14.7314 4 14.4 4H4.6C4.26863 4 4 4.26863 4 4.6V14.4C4 14.7314 4.26863 15 4.6 15H9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></div></div><div><div class="mb-2 ml-auto flex max-w-[min(70%,768px)] flex-wrap items-start justify-end gap-1.5"><span class="border-border-medium bg-surface-primary group inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded border px-1.5 py-1 transition-colors"><img alt="image.png" class="h-4 w-4 shrink-0 rounded-[1px] object-cover" src="./logo_thinking_small_files/paIclyM3cdoJz8SwuuT4SJ5ituu5yFPLm7oEHTqTLPQ"><span class="text-text-tertiary group-hover:text-text-primary max-w-[140px] truncate text-sm">image.png</span></span></div><div class="group flex min-w-0 flex-col items-end gap-1"><div class="relative overflow-hidden bg-surface-raised rounded-lg w-fit max-w-[min(70%,768px)] border-transparent ml-0"><div class="px-3 text-text-primary body-base py-2"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><div class="prose prose-pre:bg-transparent prose-pre:p-0 text-wrap break-words prose-base body-base"><p>nah sekarang rapihkan lagi sidebarnya, persis seperti apa yang saya kirim, lalu untuk nama yanga ada itu (Ampera) diganti user aja karena nanti akan saya publikasikan</p></div></div></div></div><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-surface-primary disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 text-sm hover:bg-surface-tertiary focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:border-none font-normal relative text-text-secondary hover:text-text-primary size-3.5 flex-shrink-0 rounded-md p-1.5 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100" type="button"><svg width="14" height="14" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-interactive-positive absolute inset-0 m-auto rotate-90 opacity-0 transition-all duration-300"><path d="M5 13L9 17L19 7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><svg width="14" height="14" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="absolute inset-0 m-auto opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300"><path d="M19.4 20H9.6C9.26863 20 9 19.7314 9 19.4V9.6C9 9.26863 9.26863 9 9.6 9H19.4C19.7314 9 20 9.26863 20 9.6V19.4C20 19.7314 19.7314 20 19.4 20Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M15 9V4.6C15 4.26863 14.7314 4 14.4 4H4.6C4.26863 4 4 4.26863 4 4.6V14.4C4 14.7314 4.26863 15 4.6 15H9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button></div></div><div><div class="relative overflow-hidden bg-surface-primary rounded-xl border w-full border-transparent"><div class="px-3 pb-3"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><div class="prose prose-pre:bg-transparent prose-pre:p-0 text-wrap break-words prose-base body-base"><p>Siap! Saya rapikan sidebar persis mengikuti screenshot Claude Anda + ganti "Ampera" jadi "User":</p></div><div><div class="body-sm flex items-center gap-1.5"><button type="button" class="text-text-tertiary hover:text-text-secondary shrink-0 p-0.5" aria-label="Expand" aria-expanded="false"><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="size-3 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="M9 6L15 12L9 18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button><span class="shrink-0 text-text-secondary">Edit</span><button type="button" class="bg-surface-tertiary text-text-tertiary hover:text-text-secondary truncate rounded-sm px-1 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] leading-tight">ampera-trinity-ai/app.py</button><span class="text-text-muted text-[10px]">×3</span></div></div><div class="prose prose-pre:bg-transparent prose-pre:p-0 text-wrap break-words prose-base body-base"><p>Sekarang rapikan baris akun bawah — di Claude ada avatar + nama + panah dan ikon-ikon kecil di kanan, dipisah garis atas:</p></div><div><div class="body-sm flex items-center gap-1.5"><button type="button" class="text-text-tertiary hover:text-text-secondary shrink-0 p-0.5" aria-label="Expand" aria-expanded="false"><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="size-3 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="M9 6L15 12L9 18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button><span class="shrink-0 text-text-secondary">Edit</span><button type="button" class="bg-surface-tertiary text-text-tertiary hover:text-text-secondary truncate rounded-sm px-1 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] leading-tight">ampera-trinity-ai/app.py</button><span class="text-text-muted text-[10px]">×2</span></div></div><div class="prose prose-pre:bg-transparent prose-pre:p-0 text-wrap break-words prose-base body-base"><p>Karena akan dipublikasikan, sapaan di halaman awal yang menyebut "Ampera" juga saya netralkan:</p></div><div><div class="body-sm flex items-center gap-1.5"><button type="button" class="text-text-tertiary hover:text-text-secondary shrink-0 p-0.5" aria-label="Expand" aria-expanded="false"><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="size-3 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="M9 6L15 12L9 18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button><span class="shrink-0 text-text-secondary">Edit</span><button type="button" class="bg-surface-tertiary text-text-tertiary hover:text-text-secondary truncate rounded-sm px-1 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] leading-tight">ampera-trinity-ai/app.py</button></div></div><div class="prose prose-pre:bg-transparent prose-pre:p-0 text-wrap break-words prose-base body-base"><p>Tambahkan CSS agar baris akun menempel di <strong>dasar</strong> sidebar seperti Claude:</p></div><div><div class="body-sm flex items-center g