5"><span class="border-border-medium bg-surface-primary group inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded border px-1.5 py-1 transition-colors"><img alt="image.png" class="h-4 w-4 shrink-0 rounded-[1px] object-cover" src="./logo_thinking_small_files/ekMSA1nGKtK55UnFleqZFe3WrfIMHqFzaBgp9vOuAPk"><span class="text-text-tertiary group-hover:text-text-primary max-w-[140px] truncate text-sm">image.png</span></span></div></div><div><div class="relative overflow-hidden bg-surface-primary rounded-xl border w-full border-transparent"><div class="px-3 pb-3"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><div class="prose prose-pre:bg-transparent prose-pre:p-0 text-wrap break-words prose-base body-base"><p>Error itu menarik — perhatikan path-nya: <code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">/mount/src/ampera-trinity-ai/app.py</code> artinya ini terjadi di <strong>Streamlit Cloud</strong> (deploy Anda), bukan di preview sini. Dan errornya di <strong>baris 1627</strong> ada <code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">from __future__ import annotations</code> — padahal file kita tidak sepanjang itu dengan import di posisi tersebut. Saya cek file lokal dulu:</p></div><div><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Expand" class="flex w-full select-none items-center gap-1.5 cursor-pointer"><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-text-tertiary size-4 shrink-0"><path d="M13 16H18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M6 8L10 12L6 16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M2 18V6C2 4.89543 2.89543 4 4 4H20C21.1046 4 22 4.89543 22 6V18C22 19.1046 21.1046 20 20 20H4C2.89543 20 2 19.1046 2 18Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span class="flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1"><span class="text-text-tertiary body-sm leading-4">used</span><span class="text-text-secondary body-sm leading-4">Bash</span><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-interactive-positive size-4 shrink-0"><path d="M5 13L9 17L19 7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span class="text-text-tertiary shrink-0 font-mono text-[10px] leading-[1.2]">109ms</span></span><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-text-tertiary size-3 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="M6 9L12 15L18 9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button></div><div class="prose prose-pre:bg-transparent prose-pre:p-0 text-wrap break-words prose-base body-base"><p>Ketemu penyebabnya! ✅</p><h2>🔍 Diagnosis:</h2><div class="overflow-x-auto"><table node="[object Object]" class="min-w-full"><thead><tr><th node="[object Object]" class="whitespace-nowrap px-3 py-2"></th><th node="[object Object]" class="whitespace-nowrap px-3 py-2">File saya (di sini)</th><th node="[object Object]" class="whitespace-nowrap px-3 py-2">File di Streamlit Cloud Anda</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">Panjang</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2"><strong>1.603 baris</strong></td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2"><strong>Lebih dari 1.627 baris</strong></td></tr><tr><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2"><code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">from __future__ import annotations</code></td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">Di <strong>baris 24</strong> (posisi benar, dekat atas) ✅</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">Di <strong>baris 1627</strong> ❌</td></tr><tr><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">Kompilasi</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2"><strong>Valid, tidak ada error</strong> ✅</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">SyntaxError ❌</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p><strong>Kesimpulan:</strong> File <code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">app.py</code> di repo/deploy Anda <strong>tercampur dua versi</strong> — kemungkinan besar saat menyalin kode baru, kode itu <strong>tertempel di bawah kode lama</strong> (append), bukan <strong>menggantikan seluruh isi file</strong>. Makanya ada <code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">from __future__ import annotations</code> kedua di baris 1627 — Python mengharuskan import itu di awal file, sehingga langsung SyntaxError.</p><h2>🛠️ Cara memperbaikinya:</h2><ol>
<li>Buka <code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">app.py</code> <strong>yang saya tampilkan di viewer sekarang</strong> (file lengkap &amp; valid, 1.603 baris)</li>
<li>Salin <strong>seluruh isinya</strong> (Ctrl+A → Ctrl+C dari viewer, atau download file-nya)</li>
<li>Di repo GitHub Anda: buka <button type="button" class="not-prose border-border-medium bg-surface-secondary hover:bg-surface-tertiary hover:border-border-strong group my-0.5 inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded border px-1 py-0 text-left align-middle transition-colors"><svg width="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" height="1.5em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-text-tertiary size-3 shrink-0"><path d="M9.00001 21L8.00001 21C6.89544 21 6.00001 20.1057 6.00001 19.0011C6.00001 17.4501 6.00001 15.3443 6 14C6 13 4.5 12 4.5 12C4.5 12 6.00001 11 6.00001 10C6.00001 8.827 6.00001 6.62207 6.00001 4.99914C6.00001 3.89457 6.89544 3 8.00001 3L9.00001 3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M15 21L16 21C17.1046 21 18 20.1057 18 19.0011C18 17.4501 18 15.3443 18 14C18 13 19.5 12 19.5 12C19.5 12 18 11 18 10C18 8.827 18 6.62207 18 4.99914C18 3.89457 17.1046 3 16 3L15 3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span class="text-text-secondary group-hover:text-text-primary truncate font-mono text-[12px] transition-colors">app.py</span></button> → <strong>hapus SEMUA isi lama</strong> → paste yang baru → commit</li>
<li>Streamlit Cloud akan otomatis redeploy</li>
</ol><p><strong>Tips agar tidak terulang:</strong> saat update file, pastikan <strong>Select All dulu sebelum paste</strong>, atau langsung replace file-nya (upload ulang), jangan paste di bawah kode lama.</p><p><strong>Pengecekan cepat:</strong> setelah commit, pastikan baris pertama file adalah <code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">#!/usr/bin/env python3</code> dan <strong>baris terakhirnya</strong> adalah <code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">main()</code> (di dalam blok <code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">if __name__ == "__main__":</code>). Kalau setelah <code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">main()</code> masih ada kode lagi — berarti masih ada sisa duplikat.</p><p>Jangan lupa juga di Streamlit Cloud: <strong>Settings → Secrets</strong> isi <code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">GROQ_API_KEY</code>, <code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">CF_ACCOUNT_ID</code>, <code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">CF_API_TOKEN</code> supaya chat &amp; gambar aktif di versi publik. 🚀</p></div></div><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2"><div class="flex items-center gap-1"><div class="hover:bg-accent group flex items-center justify-center rounded-md p-1.5 transition-all" data-state="closed" data-slot="tooltip-trigger"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="cur