<span class="line"><span>│──────────────────│</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>│ (U) User · Free ▾│ ← pentok dasar</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>└──────────────────┘</span></span></code></pre></div></div></pre><p>⚠️ Satu catatan: karena baris akun dipaku ke sisi kiri layar, saat <strong>sidebar ditutup</strong> baris akun otomatis ikut tersembunyi? Tidak — dia bisa tetap terlihat. Kalau nanti Anda menutup sidebar dan baris "User · Free" masih nempel di pojok kiri bawah, kabari saya — tinggal ditambah aturan agar ikut hilang saat sidebar tertutup. 🖌️</p></div></div><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2"><div class="flex items-center gap-1"><div class="hover:bg-accent group flex items-center justify-center rounded-md p-1.5 transition-all" data-state="closed" data-slot="tooltip-trigger"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-interactive-positive transition-colors"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M12 1.25C6.06294 1.25 1.25 6.06294 1.25 12C1.25 17.9371 6.06294 22.75 12 22.75C17.9371 22.75 22.75 17.9371 22.75 12C22.75 6.06294 17.9371 1.25 12 1.25ZM7.53044 11.9697C7.23755 11.6768 6.76268 11.6768 6.46978 11.9697C6.17689 12.2626 6.17689 12.7374 6.46978 13.0303L9.46978 16.0303C9.76268 16.3232 10.2376 16.3232 10.5304 16.0303L17.5304 9.03033C17.8233 8.73744 17.8233 8.26256 17.5304 7.96967C17.2375 7.67678 16.7627 7.67678 16.4698 7.96967L10.0001 14.4393L7.53044 11.9697Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div><button type="button" aria-label="Copy" class="hover:bg-accent flex items-center justify-center rounded-md p-1.5 transition-all" data-state="closed" data-slot="tooltip-trigger"><svg width="14" height="14" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor"><path d="M19.4 20H9.6C9.26863 20 9 19.7314 9 19.4V9.6C9 9.26863 9.26863 9 9.6 9H19.4C19.7314 9 20 9.26863 20 9.6V19.4C20 19.7314 19.7314 20 19.4 20Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M15 9V4.6C15 4.26863 14.7314 4 14.