se body-base"><p>✅ <strong>Selesai!</strong> Refresh penuh halaman preview.</p><h2>📐 Yang diubah:</h2><p><strong>1. Konten benar-benar mentok ke atas</strong> ⬆️</p><ul>
<li>Ruang kosong besar di atas itu ternyata milik <strong>baris header sidebar</strong> (tempat tombol <code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">«</code>) — tingginya saya buat <strong>0</strong> dan tombol <code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">«</code> dijadikan <strong>melayang di pojok kanan atas</strong> (tidak lagi memakan satu baris penuh)</li>
<li>"Trinity" sekarang mulai langsung dari atas sidebar, seperti "Claude" di contoh</li>
</ul><p><strong>2. Teks diperbesar</strong> 🔍</p><div class="overflow-x-auto"><table node="[object Object]" class="min-w-full"><thead><tr><th node="[object Object]" class="whitespace-nowrap px-3 py-2">Elemen</th><th node="[object Object]" class="whitespace-nowrap px-3 py-2">Sebelum</th><th node="[object Object]" class="whitespace-nowrap px-3 py-2">Sekarang</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">Judul "Trinity"</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">1.55rem</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2"><strong>1.9rem</strong></td></tr><tr><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">Menu (Baru, Chat, Gambar, Unduh Chat)</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">0.92–0.95rem</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2"><strong>1.05rem</strong> (tinggi baris 44px)</td></tr><tr><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">Riwayat percakapan</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">0.92rem</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2"><strong>0.98rem</strong></td></tr><tr><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">Label "Hari ini"</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">0.8rem</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2"><strong>0.85rem</strong></td></tr><tr><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">Nama "User · Free"</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">0.92rem</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2"><strong>1rem</strong></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Sekarang proporsinya lebih dekat ke Claude: judul besar tegas di atas, menu jelas terbaca, riwayat sedikit lebih kecil, akun di dasar.</p><p>Cek hasilnya — kalau "Trinity" masih kurang mentok atau ukurannya masih kurang pas, kirim screenshot lagi! 🖌️</p></div></div><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2"><div class="flex items-center gap-1"><div class="hover:bg-accent group flex items-center justify-center rounded-md p-1.5 transition-all" data-state="closed" data-slot="tooltip-trigger"><svg width="14