-text-tertiary body-sm leading-4">used</span><span class="text-text-secondary body-sm leading-4">Bash</span><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-interactive-positive size-4 shrink-0"><path d="M5 13L9 17L19 7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span class="text-text-tertiary shrink-0 font-mono text-[10px] leading-[1.2]">4.1s</span></span><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-text-tertiary size-3 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="M6 9L12 15L18 9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button></div><div class="prose prose-pre:bg-transparent prose-pre:p-0 text-wrap break-words prose-base body-base"><p>✅ <strong>Selesai!</strong> Refresh preview untuk melihatnya.</p><h2>🔤 Yang diubah:</h2><div class="overflow-x-auto"><table node="[object Object]" class="min-w-full"><thead><tr><th node="[object Object]" class="whitespace-nowrap px-3 py-2">Elemen</th><th node="[object Object]" class="whitespace-nowrap px-3 py-2">Sebelum</th><th node="[object Object]" class="whitespace-nowrap px-3 py-2">Sekarang</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2"><strong>"✳ Semangat lagi!"</strong></td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">1.9rem</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2"><strong>2.7rem</strong> — besar tegas seperti sapaan Claude</td></tr><tr><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2"><strong>"Ampera Trinity AI · by Ampera Official · 2026"</strong></td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">0.74rem</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2"><strong>0.68rem</strong> — lebih kecil dan halus</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Sekarang hierarkinya lebih mirip Claude: sapaan serif besar mendominasi, teks branding di bawahnya jadi keterangan kecil yang tidak mencolok.</p><p>Cek hasilnya — kalau sapaan mau lebih besar lagi (Claude aslinya sekitar 3rem) atau posisi teks branding mau dipindah (misal ke bawah layar saja), tinggal bilang! 🖌️</p></div></div><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2"><div class="flex items-center gap-1"><div class="hover:bg-accent group flex items-center justify-center rounded-md p-1.5 transition-all" data-state="closed" data-slot="tooltip-trigger"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-interactive-positive transition-colors"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M12 1.25C6.06294 1.25 1.25 6.06294 1.25 12C1.25 17.9371 6.06294 22.75 12 22.75C17.9371 22.75 22.75 17.9371 22.75 12C22.75 6.06294 17.9371 1.25 12 1.25ZM7.53044 11.9697C7.23755 11.6768 6.76268 11.6768 6.46978 11.9697C6.17689 12.2626 6.17689 12.7374 6.46978 13.0303L9.46978 16.0303C9.76268 16.3232 10.2376 16.3232 10.5304 16.0303L17.5304 9.03033C17.8233 8.73744 17.8233 8.26256 17.5304 7.96967C17.2375 7.67678 16.7627 7.67678 16.4698 7.96967L10.0001 14.4393L7.53044 11.9697Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div><button type="button" aria-label="Copy" class="hover:bg-accent flex items-center justify-center rounded-md p-1.5 transition-all" data-state="closed" data-slot="tooltip-trigger"><svg width="14" height="14" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor"><path d="M19.4 20H9.6C9.26863 20 9 19.7314 9 19.4V9.6C9 9.26863 9.26863 9 9.6 9H19.4C19.7314 9 20 9.26863 20 9.6V19.4C20 19.7314 19.7314 20 19.4 20Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M15 9V4.6C15 4.26863 14.7314 4 14.4 4H4.6C4.26863 4 4 4.26863 4 4.6V14.4C4 14.7314 4.26863 15 4.6 15H9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></div></div><div><div class="group flex min-w-0 flex-col items-end gap-1"><div class="relative overflow-hidden bg-surface-raised rounded-lg w-fit max-w-[min(70%,768px)] border-transparent ml-0"><div class="px-3 text-text-primary body-base py-2"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><div class="prose prose-pre:bg-transparent prose-pre:p-0 text-wrap break-words prose-base body-base"><p>lalu bisa nggak logo bintangnya kita buat cutom, jangan buat kode dulu</p></div></div></div></div><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-surface-primary disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 text-sm hover:bg-surface-tertiary focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:border-none font-normal relative text-text-secondary hover:text-text-primary size-3.5 flex-shrink-0 rounded-md p-1.5 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100" type="button"><svg width="14" height="14" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-interactive-positive absolute inset-0 m-auto rotate-90 opacity-0 transition-all duration-300"><path d="M5 13L9 17L19 7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><svg width="14" height="14" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="absolute inset-0 m-auto opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300"><path d="M19.4 20H9.6C9.26863 20 9 19.7314 9 19.4V9.6C9 9.26863 9.26863 9 9.6 9H19.4C19.7314 9 20 9.26863 20 9.6V19.4C20 19.7314 19.7314 20 19.4 20Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M15 9V4.6C15 4.26863 14.7314 4 14.4 4H4.6C4.26863 4 4 4.26863 4 4.6V14.4C4 14.7314 4.26863 15 4.6 15H9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button></div></div><div><div class="relative overflow-hidden bg-surface-primary rounded-xl border w-full border-transparent"><div class="px-3 pb-3"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><div class="prose prose-pre:bg-transparent prose-pre:p-0 text-wrap break-words prose-base body-base"><p>Bisa banget! 👍 <strong>Tidak saya buatkan kode dulu</strong>, sesuai instruksi.</p><p>Ada beberapa cara membuat logo bintang ✳-nya jadi custom — tinggal pilih:</p><p><strong>Opsi 1 — SVG custom buatan sendiri</strong> 🎨<br>
Saya gambarkan bintang/bentuk unik dengan kode SVG (misalnya bintang 8-kelopak seperti Claude, tapi bentuknya kita modifikasi sendiri — lebih runcing, lebih bulat, jumlah kelopak beda, dll). Kelebihannya: ringan, tajam di semua ukuran, warnanya gampang diubah, bisa dianimasikan (berputar/berdenyut saat thinking).</p><p><strong>Opsi 2 — Upload gambar logo sendiri</strong> 📎<br>
Anda punya logo Ampera/Trinity sendiri? Upload file-nya (PNG transparan paling bagus), nanti dipakai menggantikan semua bintang ✳ (di sapaan, thinking, dan progress gambar).</p><p><strong>Opsi 3 — Saya buatkan logo dengan AI</strong> 🤖<br>
Saya generate beberapa pilihan logo (misalnya bintang trisula 🔱 bergaya minimalis terracotta yang cocok dengan tema "Trinity"), Anda pilih yang paling disukai, baru dipasang.</p><p><strong>Opsi 4 — Ganti karakter/emoji lain</strong> ✴️<br>
Paling simpel: ganti ✳ dengan karakter lain (✦ ❋ ✺ ❊ 🔱 dsb.) — 1 menit jadi, tapi kurang unik.</p><p>Pertanyaan saya sebelum eksekusi:</p><ol>
<li><strong>Mau pakai opsi yang mana?</strong></li>
<li><strong>Logo ini dipakai di mana saja?</strong> — hanya di sapaan awal, atau juga menggantikan bintang di animasi thinking + progress gambar + label "Yuki"?</li>
<li>Kalau pilih Opsi 1/3: <strong>ada gambaran bentuknya?</strong> (misal: tetap bintang kelopak tapi 3 kelopak melambangkan "Trinity", atau bentuk trisula, dll.)</li>
</ol><p>Silakan jawab dulu, baru saya kerjakan. 📥</p></div></div><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2"><div class="flex items-center gap-1"><div class="hover:bg-accent group flex items-center justify-center rounded-md p-1.5 transition-all" data-state="closed" data-slot="tooltip-trigger"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-interactive-positive transition-colors"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M12 1.25C6.06294 1.25 1.25 6.06294 1.25 12C1.25 17.9371 6.06294 22.75 12 22.75C17.9371 22.75 22.75 17.9371 22.75 12C22.75 6.06294 17.9371 1.25 12 1.25ZM7.53044 11.9697C7.23755 11.6768 6.76268 11.6768 6.46978 11.9697C6.17689 12.2626 6.17689 12.7374 6.46978 13.0303L9.46978 16.0303C9.76268 16.3232 10.2376 16.3232 10.5304 16.0303L17.5304 9.03033C17.8233 8.73744 17.8233 8.26256 17.5304 7.96967C17.2375 7.67678 16.7627 7.67678 16.4698 7.96967L10.0001 14.4393L7.53044 11.9697Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div><button type="button" aria-label="Copy" class="hover:bg-accent flex items-center justify-center rounded-md p-1.5 transition-all" data-state="closed" data-slot="tooltip-trigger"><svg width="14" height="14" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor"><path d="M19.4 20H9.6C9.26863 20 9 19.7314 9 19.4V9.6C9 9.26863 9.26863 9 9.6 9H19.4C19.7314 9 20 9.26863 20 9.6V19.4C20 19.7314 19.7314 20 19.4 20Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M15 9V4.6C15 4.26863 14.7314 4 14.4 4H4.6C4.26863 4 4 4.26863 4 4.6V14.4C4 14.7314 4.26863 15 4.6 15H9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></div></div><div><div class="group flex min-w-0 flex-col items-end gap-1"><div class="relative overflow-hidden bg-surface-raised rounded-lg w-fit max-w-[min(70%,768px)] border-transparent ml-0"><div class="px-3 text-text-primary body-base py-2"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><div class="prose prose-pre:bg-transparent prose-pre:p-0 text-wrap break-words prose-base body-base"><p>opsi 3, hanya untuk proses thinking</p></div></div></div></div><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-surface-primary disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 text-sm hover:bg-surface-tertiary focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:border-none font-normal relative text-text-secondary hover:text-text-primary size-3.5 flex-shrink-0 rounded-md p-1.5 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100" type="button"><svg width="14" height="14" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-interactive-positive absolute inset-0 m-auto rotate-90 opacity-0 transition-all duration-300"><path d="M5 13L9 17L19 7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><svg width="14" height="14" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="absolute inset-0 m-auto opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300"><path d="M19.4 20H9.6C9.26863 20 9 19.7314 9 19.4V9.6C9 9.26863 9.26863 9 9.6 9H19.4C19.7314 9 20 9.26863 20 9.6V19.4C20 19.7314 19.7314 20 19.4 20Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M15 9V4.6C15 4.26863 14.7314 4 14.4 4H4.6C4.26863 4 4 4.26863 4 4.6V14.4C4 14.7314 4.26863 15 4.6 15H9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button></div></div><div><div class="relative overflow-hidden bg-surface-primary rounded-xl border w-full border-transparent"><div class="px-3 pb-3"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><div class="prose prose-pre:bg-transparent prose-pre:p-0 text-wrap break-words prose-base body-base"><p>Siap! 🎨 Logo custom via AI, khusus untuk animasi <strong>thinking</strong>. Saya buatkan beberapa kandidat dulu supaya Anda bisa memilih:</p></div><div class="my-1"><div class="body-sm text-text-tertiary flex items-center gap-2"><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="size-4 shrink-0"><path d="M13 21H3.6C3.26863 21 3 20.7314 3 20.4V3.6C3 3.26863 3.26863 3 3.6 3H20.4C20.7314 3 21 3.26863 21 3.6V13" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M3 16L10 13L15.5 15.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M16 10C14.8954 10 14 9.10457 14 8C14 6.89543 14.8954 6 16 6C17.1046 6 18 6.89543 18 8C18 9.10457 17.1046 10 16 10Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M16 19H19M22 19H19M19 19V16M19 19V22" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span>Generated image</span></div><p class="text-text-tertiary mt-0.5 line-clamp-2 text-xs">Minimalist flat vector logo mark: an abstract starburst with exactly three elegant pointed petals arranged radially (symbolizing "trinity"), terracotta orange color #DA7756, on a plain solid cream background #F0EEE6, centered, clean simple geometric design, no text, no gradients, flat 2D icon style, generous empty margin around the mark</p><button type="button" class="group relative mt-2 inline-block cursor-pointer bg-transparent p-0 text-left" aria-label="Open in viewer"><img alt="Minimalist flat vector logo mark: an abstract starburst with exactly three elegant pointed petals arranged radially (symbolizing &quot;trinity&quot;), terracotta orange color #DA7756, on a plain solid cream background #F0EEE6, centered, clean simple geometric design, no text, no gradients, flat 2D icon style, generous empty margin around the mark" draggable="false" class="max-h-[480px] max-w-full select-none rounded-lg object-contain object-left" src="./logo_thinking_small_files/Q5IzCznU_y_XETGb1paqyWYN4PW3IFeXABu6buaF6QQ"><div class="absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-black/40 opacity-0 transition-opacity group-hover:opacity-100"><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-md bg-white/90 px-3 py-1.5 text-sm font-medium text-black"><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="size-4"><path d="M3 13C6.6 5 17.4 5 21 13" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M12 17C10.3431 17 9 15.6569 9 14C9 12.3431 10.3431 11 12 11C13.6569 11 15 12.3431 15 14C15 15.6569 13.6569 17 12 17Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>Open</div></div></button></div><div class="my-1"><div class="body-sm text-text-tertiary flex items-center gap-2"><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="size-4 shrink-0"><path d="M13 21H3.6C3.26863 21 3 20.7314 3 20.4V3.6C3 3.26863 3.26863 3 3.6 3H20.4C20.7314 3 21 3.26863 21 3.6V13" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M3 16L10 13L15.5 15.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M16 10C14.8954 10 14 9.10457 14 8C14 6.89543 14.8954 6 16 6C17.1046 6 18 6.89543 18 8C18 9.10457 17.1046 10 16 10Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M16 19H19M22 19H19M19 19V16M19 19V22" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span>Generated image</span></div><p class="text-text-tertiary mt-0.5 line-clamp-2 text-xs">Minimalist flat vector logo mark: an eight-petal asterisk starburst similar to a hand-drawn sparkle, organic slightly irregular petals, terracotta orange color #DA7756, on plain solid cream background #F0EEE6, centered, no text, flat 2D icon, clean and simple, generous empty margin around the mark</p><button type="button" class="group relative mt-2 inline-block cursor-pointer bg-transparent p-0 text-left" aria-label="Open in viewer"><img alt="Minimalist flat vector logo mark: an eight-petal asterisk starburst similar to a hand-drawn sparkle, organic slightly irregular petals, terracotta orange color #DA7756, on plain solid cream background #F0EEE6, centered, no text, flat 2D icon, clean and simple, generous empty margin around the mark" draggable="false" class="max-h-[480px] max-w-full select-none rounded-lg object-contain object-left" src="./logo_thinking_small_files/8gavsVuvNIaKcO1f108Mb3z8LwMDhCqTTBjuDi0LhlA"><div class="absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-black/40 opacity-0 transition-opacity group-hover:opacity-100"><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-md bg-white/90 px-3 py-1.5 text-sm font-medium text-black"><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="size-4"><path d="M3 13C6.6 5 17.4 5 21 13" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M12 17C10.3431 17 9 15.6569 9 14C9 12.3431 10.3431 11 12 11C13.6569 11 15 12.3431 15 14C15 15.6569 13.6569 17 12 17Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>Open</div></div></button></div><div class="my-1"><div class="body-sm text-text-tertiary flex items-center gap-2"><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="size-4 shrink-0"><path d="M13 21H3.6C3.26863 21 3 20.7314 3 20.4V3.6C3 3.26863 3.26863 3 3.6 3H20.4C20.7314 3 21 3.26863 21 3.6V13" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M3 16L10 13L15.5 15.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M16 10C14.8954 10 14 9.10457 14 8C14 6.89543 14.8954 6 16 6C17.1046 6 18 6.89543 18 8C18 9.10457 17.1046 10 16 10Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M16 19H19M22 19H19M19 19V16M19 19V22" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span>Generated image</span></div><p class="text-text-tertiary mt-0.5 line-clamp-2 text-xs">Minimalist flat vector logo mark: a stylized trident shape merged with a four-point star, elegant thin geometric lines, terracotta orange color #DA7756, on plain solid cream background #F0EEE6, centered, no text, flat 2D minimal icon design, generous empty margin around the mark</p><button type="button" class="group relative mt-2 inline-block cursor-pointer bg-transparent p-0 text-left" aria-label="Open in viewer"><img alt="Minimalist flat vector logo mark: a stylized trident shape merged with a four-point star, elegant thin geometric lines, terracotta orange color #DA7756, on plain solid cream background #F0EEE6, centered, no text, flat 2D minimal icon design, generous empty margin around the mark" draggable="false" class="max-h-[480px] max-w-full select-none rounded-lg object-contain object-left" src="./logo_thinking_small_files/vCAdTfldHYfLZmEvYBw3CYegoZH6aN_lu4rbdnskHWo"><div class="absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-black/40 opacity-0 transition-opacity group-hover:opacity-100"><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-md bg-white/90 px-3 py-1.5 text-sm font-medium text-black"><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="size-4"><path d="M3 13C6.6 5 17.4 5 21 13" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M12 17C10.3431 17 9 15.6569 9 14C9 12.3431 10.3431 11 12 11C13.6569 11 15 12.3431 15 14C15 15.6569 13.6569 17 12 17Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>Open</div></div></button></div><div><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Expand" class="body-sm group flex w-full cursor-pointer items-center gap-1.5 leading-[1]"><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-text-tertiary size-3 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="M9 6L15 12L9 18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span class="text-text-secondary shrink-0">Explored</span><span class="text-text-tertiary">3 reads</span></button><div class="relative overflow-clip pl-[18px] transition-[height] duration-300" style="height: 0px;"><div class="flex flex-col will-change-transform" style="transform: translateY(0px);"><div class="body-xs flex items-center gap-1" style="height: 22px;"><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-text-tertiary size-3 shrink-0"><path d="M3 13C6.6 5 17.4 5 21 13" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M12 17C10.3431 17 9 15.6569 9 14C9 12.3431 10.3431 11 12 11C13.6569 11 15 12.3431 15 14C15 15.6569 13.6569 17 12 17Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span class="text-text-primary shrink-0">Read</span><span class="text-text-tertiary truncate">logo_option_1.png</span></div><div class="body-xs flex items-center gap-1" style="height: 22px;"><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-text-tertiary size-3 shrink-0"><path d="M3 13C6.6 5 17.4 5 21 13" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M12 17C10.3431 17 9 15.6569 9 14C9 12.3431 10.3431 11 12 11C13.6569 11 15 12.3431 15 14C15 15.6569 13.6569 17 12 17Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span class="text-text-primary shrink-0">Read</span><span class="text-text-tertiary truncate">logo_option_2.png</span></div><div class="body-xs flex items-center gap-1" style="height: 22px;"><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-text-tertiary size-3 shrink-0"><path d="M3 13C6.6 5 17.4 5 21 13" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M12 17C10.3431 17 9 15.6569 9 14C9 12.3431 10.3431 11 12 11C13.6569 11 15 12.3431 15 14C15 15.6569 13.6569 17 12 17Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span class="text-text-primary shrink-0">Read</span><span class="text-text-tertiary truncate">logo_option_3.png</span></div></div></div></div><div class="prose prose-pre:bg-transparent prose-pre:p-0 text-wrap break-words prose-base body-base"><p>✅ <strong>3 kandidat logo sudah jadi!</strong> Semuanya warna terracotta senada tema, tersimpan di folder <code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">assets/</code>. Berikut pilihannya:</p><div class="overflow-x-auto"><table node="[object Object]" class="min-w-full"><thead><tr><th node="[object Object]" class="whitespace-nowrap px-3 py-2">Opsi</th><th node="[object Object]" class="whitespace-nowrap px-3 py-2">Bentuk</th><th node="[object Object]" class="whitespace-nowrap px-3 py-2">Karakter</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2"><strong>1</strong> — <code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">logo_option_1.png</code></td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">⭐ <strong>Tiga kelopak runcing</strong> membentuk formasi segitiga</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">Paling kuat maknanya — 3 kelopak = <strong>Trinity</strong> (3 aplikasi jadi 1), tegas &amp; modern</td></tr><tr><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2"><strong>2</strong> — <code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">logo_option_2.png</code></td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">✳ <strong>Bintang 8 kelopak organik</strong> gaya coretan tangan</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">Paling mirip bintang Claude asli, tapi versi hand-drawn yang lebih hangat</td></tr><tr><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2"><strong>3</strong> — <code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">logo_option_3.png</code></td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">🔱 <strong>Bintang kompas + trisula</strong> garis tipis</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">Paling unik &amp; detail — trisula nyambung dengan ikon 🔱 app, tapi mungkin terlalu ramai untuk ukuran kecil</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p><strong>Rekomendasi saya: Opsi 1</strong> — karena maknanya pas banget dengan nama "Trinity", bentuknya simpel sehingga tetap jelas walau ditampilkan kecil (ukuran ikon thinking cuma ~20px), dan cocok dianimasikan berputar/berdenyut.</p><p>⚠️ Catatan teknis: ketiganya masih ber-background krem. Saat dipasang nanti latar itu tidak masalah karena warnanya hampir sama dengan latar app (<code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">#F0EEE6</code>), tapi kalau mau lebih bersih saya bisa proses jadi transparan dulu.</p><p><strong>Silakan pilih:</strong> Opsi 1, 2, atau 3? Atau kalau belum ada yang sreg, saya generate ulang dengan arahan baru (misal: lebih bulat, lebih tipis, warna lain, dll). Setelah Anda pilih, baru saya pasang di animasi thinking. 🎨</p></div></div><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2"><div class="flex items-center gap-1"><div class="hover:bg-accent group flex items-center justify-center rounded-md p-1.5 transition-all" data-state="closed" data-slot="tooltip-trigger"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-interactive-positive transition-colors"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M12 1.25C6.06294 1.25 1.25 6.06294 1.25 12C1.25 17.9371 6.06294 22.75 12 22.75C17.9371 22.75 22.75 17.9371 22.75 12C22.75 6.06294 17.9371 1.25 12 1.25ZM7.53044 11.9697C7.23755 11.6768 6.76268 11.6768 6.46978 11.9697C6.17689 12.2626 6.17689 12.7374 6.46978 13.0303L9.46978 16.0303C9.76268 16.3232 10.2376 16.3232 10.5304 16.0303L17.5304 9.03033C17.8233 8.73744 17.8233 8.26256 17.5304 7.96967C17.2375 7.67678 16.7627 7.67678 16.4698 7.96967L10.0001 14.4393L7.53044 11.9697Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div><button type="button" aria-label="Copy" class="hover:bg-accent flex items-center justify-center rounded-md p-1.5 transition-all" data-state="closed" data-slot="tooltip-trigger"><svg width="14" height="14" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor"><path d="M19.4 20H9.6C9.26863 20 9 19.7314 9 19.4V9.6C9 9.26863 9.26863 9 9.6 9H19.4C19.7314 9 20 9.26863 20 9.6V19.4C20 19.7314 19.7314 20 19.4 20Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M15 9V4.6C15 4.26863 14.7314 4 14.4 4H4.6C4.26863 4 4 4.26863 4 4.6V14.4C4 14.7314 4.26863 15 4.6 15H9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></div></div><div><div class="group flex min-w-0 flex-col items-end gap-1"><div class="relative overflow-hidden bg-surface-raised rounded-lg w-fit max-w-[min(70%,768px)] border-transparent ml-0"><div class="px-3 text-text-primary body-base py-2"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><div class="prose prose-pre:bg-transparent prose-pre:p-0 text-wrap break-words prose-base body-base"><p><strong>Bintang kompas + trisula aja, dan di transparant dulu, lalu jangan buat kode dulu berikan rekomendasi animasi yang coco</strong></p></div></div></div></div><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-surface-primary disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 text-sm hover:bg-surface-tertiary focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:border-none font-normal relative text-text-secondary hover:text-text-primary size-3.5 flex-shrink-0 rounded-md p-1.5 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100" type="button"><svg width="14" height="14" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-interactive-positive absolute inset-0 m-auto rotate-90 opacity-0 transition-all duration-300"><path d="M5 13L9 17L19 7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><svg width="14" height="14" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="absolute inset-0 m-auto opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300"><path d="M19.4 20H9.6C9.26863 20 9 19.7314 9 19.4V9.6C9 9.26863 9.26863 9 9.6 9H19.4C19.7314 9 20 9.26863 20 9.6V19.4C20 19.7314 19.7314 20 19.4 20Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M15 9V4.6C15 4.26863 14.7314 4 14.4 4H4.6C4.26863 4 4 4.26863 4 4.6V14.4C4 14.7314 4.26863 15 4.6 15H9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button></div></div><div><div class="relative overflow-hidden bg-surface-primary rounded-xl border w-full border-transparent"><div class="px-3 pb-3"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><div class="prose prose-pre:bg-transparent prose-pre:p-0 text-wrap break-words prose-base body-base"><p>Siap! Opsi 3 (bintang kompas + trisula) dipilih. Saya proses dulu jadi transparan (ini cuma pemrosesan gambar, bukan kode aplikasi):</p></div><div><button type="button" aria-label="Collapse" class="flex w-full select-none items-center gap-1.5 cursor-pointer" aria-expanded="true"><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-text-tertiary size-4 shrink-0"><path d="M13 16H18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M6 8L10 12L6 16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M2 18V6C2 4.89543 2.89543 4 4 4H20C21.1046 4 22 4.89543 22 6V18C22 19.1046 21.1046 20 20 20H4C2.89543 20 2 19.1046 2 18Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span class="flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1"><span class="text-text-tertiary body-sm leading-4">used</span><span class="text-text-secondary body-sm leading-4">Bash</span><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-interactive-positive size-4 shrink-0"><path d="M5 13L9 17L19 7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span class="text-text-tertiary shrink-0 font-mono text-[10px] leading-[1.2]">398ms</span></span><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-text-tertiary size-3 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200 rotate-180"><path d="M6 9L12 15L18 9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button><div style="overflow: clip; height: auto; opacity: 1;"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2 pl-5 pt-2"><div class="bg-surface-secondary border-border-medium overflow-hidden rounded border"><div class="border-border-medium flex items-center justify-between border-b py-1 pl-2 pr-1"><span class="text-text-muted font-mono text-[10px] uppercase leading-[1.2]">command</span><button type="button" class="text-text-muted hover:text-text-tertiary shrink-0 p-1" aria-label="Copy"><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="size-3"><path d="M19.4 20H9.6C9.26863 20 9 19.7314 9 19.4V9.6C9 9.26863 9.26863 9 9.6 9H19.4C19.7314 9 20 9.26863 20 9.6V19.4C20 19.7314 19.7314 20 19.4 20Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M15 9V4.6C15 4.26863 14.7314 4 14.4 4H4.6C4.26863 4 4 4.26863 4 4.6V14.4C4 14.7314 4.26863 15 4.6 15H9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button></div><div class="overflow-auto p-2"><pre class="text-interactive-normal whitespace-pre-wrap font-mono text-xs leading-[1.2]">$ python3 - &lt;&lt;'EOF' from PIL import Image src = Image.open('ampera-trinity-ai/assets/logo_option_3.png').convert('RGBA') # Crop ke area logo (gambar 1408x768, logo di tengah) w, h = src.size # cari bounding box piksel non-krem import numpy as np arr = np.array(src) r, g, b = arr[:,:,0].astype(int), arr[:,:,1].astype(int), arr[:,:,2].astype(int) # latar krem ~ (240,238,230). Piksel logo = terracotta (jauh dari krem) dist = abs(r-240) + abs(g-238) + abs(b-230) mask = dist &gt; 60 # logo pixels ys, xs = np.where(mask) x0, x1, y0, y1 = xs.min(), xs.max(), ys.min(), ys.max() pad = 30 x0, y0 = max(0, x0-pad), max(0, y0-pad) x1, y1 = min(w, x1+pad), min(h, y1+pad) crop = arr[y0:y1, x0:x1].copy() # Alpha berdasarkan jarak dari warna latar → tepi halus (anti-alias) cr, cg, cb = crop[:,:,0].astype(int), crop[:,:,1].astype(int), crop[:,:,2].astype(int) cdist = abs(cr-240) + abs(cg-238) + abs(cb-230) alpha = np.clip((cdist - 15) * 4, 0, 255).astype('uint8') crop[:,:,3] = alpha out = Image.fromarray(crop, 'RGBA') # jadikan persegi dengan padding transparan side = max(out.size) sq = Image.new('RGBA', (side, side), (0,0,0,0)) sq.paste(out, ((side-out.size[0])//2, (side-out.size[1])//2), out) sq = sq.resize((512, 512), Image.LANCZOS) sq.save('ampera-trinity-ai/assets/logo_thinking.png') print("OK - transparan, 512x512:", 'ampera-trinity-ai/assets/logo_thinking.png') EOF</pre></div></div><div class="bg-surface-secondary border-border-medium overflow-hidden rounded border"><div class="border-border-medium flex items-center justify-between border-b py-1 pl-2 pr-1"><span class="text-text-muted font-mono text-[10px] uppercase leading-[1.2]">stdout</span><button type="button" class="text-text-muted hover:text-text-tertiary shrink-0 p-1" aria-label="Copy"><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="size-3"><path d="M19.4 20H9.6C9.26863 20 9 19.7314 9 19.4V9.6C9 9.26863 9.26863 9 9.6 9H19.4C19.7314 9 20 9.26863 20 9.6V19.4C20 19.7314 19.7314 20 19.4 20Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M15 9V4.6C15 4.26863 14.7314 4 14.4 4H4.6C4.26863 4 4 4.26863 4 4.6V14.4C4 14.7314 4.26863 15 4.6 15H9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button></div><div class="overflow-auto p-2 max-h-[340px]"><pre class="text-interactive-normal whitespace-pre-wrap font-mono text-xs leading-[1.2]">OK - transparan, 512x512: ampera-trinity-ai/assets/logo_thinking.png
</pre></div></div></div></div></div><div><button type="button" aria-expanded="true" aria-label="Collapse" class="body-sm group flex w-full cursor-pointer items-center gap-1.5 leading-[1]"><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-text-tertiary size-3 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200 rotate-90"><path d="M9 6L15 12L9 18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span class="text-text-secondary shrink-0">Explored</span><span class="text-text-tertiary">1 read</span></button><div style="overflow: clip; height: auto; opacity: 1;"><div class="flex flex-col py-0.5 pl-[18px]"><div class="body-xs flex items-center gap-1" style="height: 22px;"><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-text-tertiary size-3 shrink-0"><path d="M3 13C6.6 5 17.4 5 21 13" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M12 17C10.3431 17 9 15.6569 9 14C9 12.3431 10.3431 11 12 11C13.6569 11 15 12.3431 15 14C15 15.6569 13.6569 17 12 17Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span class="text-text-primary shrink-0">Read</span><span class="text-text-tertiary truncate">logo_thinking.png</span></div></div></div></div><div class="prose prose-pre:bg-transparent prose-pre:p-0 text-wrap break-words prose-base body-base"><p>✅ <strong>Logo transparan sudah jadi!</strong> — <code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">assets/logo_thinking.png</code> (512×512, latar transparan, tepi halus). Bentuk bintang kompas + trisulanya bersih dan siap dipakai.</p><p>Sekarang <strong>rekomendasi animasi</strong> yang cocok untuk logo ini di proses thinking (belum saya buat kodenya):</p><h2>🎬 Rekomendasi Animasi</h2><div class="overflow-x-auto"><table node="[object Object]" class="min-w-full"><thead><tr><th node="[object Object]" class="whitespace-nowrap px-3 py-2">#</th><th node="[object Object]" class="whitespace-nowrap px-3 py-2">Animasi</th><th node="[object Object]" class="whitespace-nowrap px-3 py-2">Deskripsi</th><th node="[object Object]" class="whitespace-nowrap px-3 py-2">Cocok karena</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2"><strong>1</strong></td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2"><strong>Denyut + putar pelan</strong> ⭐ <em>(rekomendasi utama)</em></td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">Logo berputar sangat lambat (1 putaran ~8 detik) sambil membesar-mengecil halus (scale 1.0 ↔ 1.15)</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">Bentuk kompas 8-arah terlihat hidup saat berputar; persis nuansa bintang Claude yang berdenyut, tapi lebih unik</td></tr><tr><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2"><strong>2</strong></td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2"><strong>Putar bolak-balik (pendulum)</strong></td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">Berputar 30° ke kanan → balik 30° ke kiri, berulang dengan easing halus</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">Kesannya seperti kompas yang "mencari arah" = AI sedang mencari jawaban; halus &amp; elegan</td></tr><tr><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2"><strong>3</strong></td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2"><strong>Breathing + glow</strong></td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">Diam di tempat, hanya membesar-mengecil pelan + bayangan oranye lembut yang ikut menguat-melemah (drop-shadow)</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">Paling kalem &amp; premium, tidak mengganggu mata saat menunggu 12 detik</td></tr><tr><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2"><strong>4</strong></td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2"><strong>Spin cepat lalu tenang</strong></td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">Saat pertama muncul: berputar cepat 1 putaran (0.8 detik) → lalu lanjut denyut pelan</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">Ada momen "aktif" yang memberi kesan responsif, lalu tenang selama sisa berpikir</td></tr><tr><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2"><strong>5</strong></td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2"><strong>Kelap-kelip kelopak (opacity wave)</strong></td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">Logo utuh diam, tapi opasitasnya bergelombang 100% → 60% → 100% dengan ritme lambat</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">Paling sederhana &amp; ringan, mirip kedipan bintang</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p><strong>Rekomendasi saya: #1 (denyut + putar pelan)</strong> — alasannya:</p><ul>
<li>Bentuk logo ini <strong>simetris 8-arah</strong>, jadi rotasi terlihat sangat cantik dan mulus</li>
<li>Kombinasi denyut mempertahankan "rasa Claude" yang sudah kita bangun</li>
<li>Murni CSS → tetap berjalan halus walau server sedang sibuk menunggu API</li>
<li>Ukuran kecil (~22px) tetap terbaca jelas</li>
</ul><p>Alternatif kedua terbaik: <strong>#2 (pendulum)</strong> kalau mau kesan yang lebih tenang dan filosofis ("kompas mencari arah").</p><p><strong>Pilih nomor berapa?</strong> (atau mau kombinasi, misal #1 + glow dari #3?) Setelah Anda pilih, baru saya pasang di animasi thinking. 🎨</p></div></div><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2"><div class="flex items-center gap-1"><div class="hover:bg-accent group flex items-center justify-center rounded-md p-1.5 transition-all" data-state="closed" data-slot="tooltip-trigger"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-interactive-positive transition-colors"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M12 1.25C6.06294 1.25 1.25 6.06294 1.25 12C1.25 17.9371 6.06294 22.75 12 22.75C17.9371 22.75 22.75 17.9371 22.75 12C22.75 6.06294 17.9371 1.25 12 1.25ZM7.53044 11.9697C7.23755 11.6768 6.76268 11.6768 6.46978 11.9697C6.17689 12.2626 6.17689 12.7374 6.46978 13.0303L9.46978 16.0303C9.76268 16.3232 10.2376 16.3232 10.5304 16.0303L17.5304 9.03033C17.8233 8.73744 17.8233 8.26256 17.5304 7.96967C17.2375 7.67678 16.7627 7.67678 16.4698 7.96967L10.0001 14.4393L7.53044 11.9697Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div><button type="button" aria-label="Copy" class="hover:bg-accent flex items-center justify-center rounded-md p-1.5 transition-all" data-state="closed" data-slot="tooltip-trigger"><svg width="14" height="14" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor"><path d="M19.4 20H9.6C9.26863 20 9 19.7314 9 19.4V9.6C9 9.26863 9.26863 9 9.6 9H19.4C19.7314 9 20 9.26863 20 9.6V19.4C20 19.7314 19.7314 20 19.4 20Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M15 9V4.6C15 4.26863 14.7314 4 14.4 4H4.6C4.26863 4 4 4.26863 4 4.6V14.4C4 14.7314 4.26863 15 4.6 15H9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></div></div><div><div class="group flex min-w-0 flex-col items-end gap-1"><div class="relative overflow-hidden bg-surface-raised rounded-lg w-fit max-w-[min(70%,768px)] border-transparent ml-0"><div class="px-3 text-text-primary body-base py-2"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><div class="prose prose-pre:bg-transparent prose-pre:p-0 text-wrap break-words prose-base body-base"><p>gabungkan opsi 2, 3, 4, dan 5</p></div></div></div></div><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-surface-primary disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 text-sm hover:bg-surface-tertiary focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:border-none font-normal relative text-text-secondary hover:text-text-primary size-3.5 flex-shrink-0 rounded-md p-1.5 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100" type="button"><svg width="14" height="14" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-interactive-positive absolute inset-0 m-auto rotate-90 opacity-0 transition-all duration-300"><path d="M5 13L9 17L19 7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><svg width="14" height="14" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="absolute inset-0 m-auto opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300"><path d="M19.4 20H9.6C9.26863 20 9 19.7314 9 19.4V9.6C9 9.26863 9.26863 9 9.6 9H19.4C19.7314 9 20 9.26863 20 9.6V19.4C20 19.7314 19.7314 20 19.4 20Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M15 9V4.6C15 4.26863 14.7314 4 14.4 4H4.6C4.26863 4 4 4.26863 4 4.6V14.4C4 14.7314 4.26863 15 4.6 15H9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button></div></div><div><div class="relative overflow-hidden bg-surface-primary rounded-xl border w-full border-transparent"><div class="px-3 pb-3"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><div class="prose prose-pre:bg-transparent prose-pre:p-0 text-wrap break-words prose-base body-base"><p>Siap! 🎨 Gabungan 4 animasi jadi satu koreografi:</p><p><strong>Muncul → spin cepat 1 putaran (opsi 4) → lalu tenang: ayunan pendulum kompas (opsi 2) + napas &amp; glow oranye (opsi 3) + gelombang opasitas kelap-kelip (opsi 5)</strong> — berjalan bersamaan.</p><p>Triknya biar tidak bentrok: rotasi di lapisan luar, napas+glow+kedip di lapisan dalam. Saya pasang:</p></div><div><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Expand" class="flex w-full select-none items-center gap-1.5 cursor-pointer"><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-text-tertiary size-4 shrink-0"><path d="M13 16H18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M6 8L10 12L6 16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M2 18V6C2 4.89543 2.89543 4 4 4H20C21.1046 4 22 4.89543 22 6V18C22 19.1046 21.1046 20 20 20H4C2.89543 20 2 19.1046 2 18Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span class="flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1"><span class="text-text-tertiary body-sm leading-4">used</span><span class="text-text-secondary body-sm leading-4">Bash</span><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-interactive-positive size-4 shrink-0"><path d="M5 13L9 17L19 7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span class="text-text-tertiary shrink-0 font-mono text-[10px] leading-[1.2]">149ms</span></span><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-text-tertiary size-3 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="M6 9L12 15L18 9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button></div><div class="prose prose-pre:bg-transparent prose-pre:p-0 text-wrap break-words prose-base body-base"><p>9KB — aman untuk di-embed sebagai base64. Sekarang ubah kode thinking:</p></div><div><div class="body-sm flex items-center gap-1.5"><button type="button" class="text-text-tertiary hover:text-text-secondary shrink-0 p-0.5" aria-label="Expand" aria-expanded="false"><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="size-3 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="M9 6L15 12L9 18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button><span class="shrink-0 text-text-secondary">Edit</span><button type="button" class="bg-surface-tertiary text-text-tertiary hover:text-text-secondary truncate rounded-sm px-1 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] leading-tight">ampera-trinity-ai/app.py</button></div></div><div><button type="button" aria-label="Expand" class="flex w-full select-none items-center gap-1.5 cursor-pointer" aria-expanded="false"><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-text-tertiary size-4 shrink-0"><path d="M13 16H18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M6 8L10 12L6 16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M2 18V6C2 4.89543 2.89543 4 4 4H20C21.1046 4 22 4.89543 22 6V18C22 19.1046 21.1046 20 20 20H4C2.89543 20 2 19.1046 2 18Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span class="flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1"><span class="text-text-tertiary body-sm leading-4">used</span><span class="text-text-secondary body-sm leading-4">Bash</span><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-interactive-positive size-4 shrink-0"><path d="M5 13L9 17L19 7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span class="text-text-tertiary shrink-0 font-mono text-[10px] leading-[1.2]">136ms</span></span><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-text-tertiary size-3 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="M6 9L12 15L18 9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button></div><div><div class="body-sm flex items-center gap-1.5"><button type="button" class="text-text-tertiary hover:text-text-secondary shrink-0 p-0.5" aria-label="Expand" aria-expanded="false"><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="size-3 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="M9 6L15 12L9 18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button><span class="shrink-0 text-text-secondary">Edit</span><button type="button" class="bg-surface-tertiary text-text-tertiary hover:text-text-secondary truncate rounded-sm px-1 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] leading-tight">ampera-trinity-ai/app.py</button></div></div><div class="prose prose-pre:bg-transparent prose-pre:p-0 text-wrap break-words prose-base body-base"><p>Sekarang tambahkan CSS koreografi animasinya (setelah blok <code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">.claude-think .star</code>):</p></div><div><div class="body-sm flex items-center gap-1.5"><button type="button" class="text-text-tertiary hover:text-text-secondary shrink-0 p-0.5" aria-label="Expand" aria-expanded="false"><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="size-3 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="M9 6L15 12L9 18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button><span class="shrink-0 text-text-secondary">Edit</span><button type="button" class="bg-surface-tertiary text-text-tertiary hover:text-text-secondary truncate rounded-sm px-1 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] leading-tight">ampera-trinity-ai/app.py</button></div></div><div role="button" tabindex="0" aria-pressed="false" class="group/artifact relative block w-full overflow-hidden rounded-lg border text-left transition duration-150 bg-surface-secondary border-border-faint shadow-[0px_0px_8px_0_rgba(0,0,0,0.04)] hover:border-border-medium hover:bg-surface-tertiary hover:shadow-none focus-visible:ring-interactive-active focus-visible:ring-offset-surface-primary cursor-pointer focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-2"><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-2"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="shrink-0 text-text-secondary" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 21.4V2.6C4 2.26863 4.26863 2 4.6 2H16.2515C16.4106 2 16.5632 2.06321 16.6757 2.17574L19.8243 5.32426C19.9368 5.43679 20 5.5894 20 5.74853V21.4C20 21.7314 19.7314 22 19.4 22H4.6C4.26863 22 4 21.7314 4 21.4Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M8 10L16 10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M8 18L16 18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M8 14L12 14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M16 2V5.4C16 5.73137 16.2686 6 16.6 6H20" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span class="min-w-0 flex-1 truncate text-sm font-normal text-text-primary">app.py</span><span class="bg-surface-secondary text-text-tertiary shrink-0 rounded-[4px] border px-1.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium uppercase leading-none border-border-medium">PYTHON</span></div></div><div><button type="button" aria-label="Expand" class="flex w-full select-none items-center gap-1.5 cursor-pointer" aria-expanded="false"><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-text-tertiary size-4 shrink-0"><path d="M13 16H18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M6 8L10 12L6 16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M2 18V6C2 4.89543 2.89543 4 4 4H20C21.1046 4 22 4.89543 22 6V18C22 19.1046 21.1046 20 20 20H4C2.89543 20 2 19.1046 2 18Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span class="flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1"><span class="text-text-tertiary body-sm leading-4">used</span><span class="text-text-secondary body-sm leading-4">Bash</span><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-interactive-positive size-4 shrink-0"><path d="M5 13L9 17L19 7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span class="text-text-tertiary shrink-0 font-mono text-[10px] leading-[1.2]">835ms</span></span><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-text-tertiary size-3 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="M6 9L12 15L18 9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button></div><div class="text-text-primary rounded-md border border-border-faint bg-surface-secondary/50 shadow-none my-0"><button type="button" class="flex w-full items-center gap-2 bg-transparent px-2.5 py-2 text-left" aria-expanded="false"><span class="text-text-tertiary flex shrink-0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-play size-3.5"><polygon points="6 3 20 12 6 21 6 3"></polygon></svg></span><span class="body-sm text-text-secondary min-w-0 flex-1 truncate"><span class="flex min-w-0 items-center gap-2"><span class="truncate">Start Ampera Trinity AI</span><span class="body-xs text-text-muted shrink-0">· exited (code 1)</span></span></span><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-text-tertiary size-3 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="M9 6L15 12L9 18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-interactive-negative size-3"><path d="M6.75827 17.2426L12.0009 12M17.2435 6.75736L12.0009 12M12.0009 12L6.75827 6.75736M12.0009 12L17.2435 17.2426" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button></div><div class="prose prose-pre:bg-transparent prose-pre:p-0 text-wrap break-words prose-base body-base"><p>Port 8501 sudah dipakai — artinya server lama masih hidup dan akan auto-reload perubahan. Saya verifikasi:</p></div><div><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Expand" class="flex w-full select-none items-center gap-1.5 cursor-pointer"><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-text-tertiary size-4 shrink-0"><path d="M13 16H18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M6 8L10 12L6 16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M2 18V6C2 4.89543 2.89543 4 4 4H20C21.1046 4 22 4.89543 22 6V18C22 19.1046 21.1046 20 20 20H4C2.89543 20 2 19.1046 2 18Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span class="flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1"><span class="text-text-tertiary body-sm leading-4">used</span><span class="text-text-secondary body-sm leading-4">Bash</span><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-interactive-positive size-4 shrink-0"><path d="M5 13L9 17L19 7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span class="text-text-tertiary shrink-0 font-mono text-[10px] leading-[1.2]">140ms</span></span><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-text-tertiary size-3 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="M6 9L12 15L18 9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button></div><div class="prose prose-pre:bg-transparent prose-pre:p-0 text-wrap break-words prose-base body-base"><p>✅ <strong>Selesai! Logo custom + koreografi 4 animasi sudah terpasang</strong> — app live, refresh preview lalu kirim pesan untuk melihat animasinya (klik "Rerun" jika muncul notifikasi file berubah).</p><h2>🎬 Koreografi animasi thinking yang baru:</h2><p>Logo <strong>bintang kompas + trisula</strong> (transparan, 24px) menggantikan bintang ✳, dengan 4 animasi berjalan sekaligus dalam 2 lapisan:</p><div class="overflow-x-auto"><table node="[object Object]" class="min-w-full"><thead><tr><th node="[object Object]" class="whitespace-nowrap px-3 py-2">Fase</th><th node="[object Object]" class="whitespace-nowrap px-3 py-2">Animasi</th><th node="[object Object]" class="whitespace-nowrap px-3 py-2">Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2"><strong>0 – 0.8 dtk</strong></td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">🌀 <strong>Intro spin</strong> (opsi 4)</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">Muncul mengecil → berputar cepat <strong>1 putaran penuh</strong> sambil membesar ke ukuran normal (easing halus)</td></tr><tr><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2"><strong>0.8 dtk – selesai</strong></td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">🧭 <strong>Pendulum kompas</strong> (opsi 2)</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">Berayun +30° → 0° → −30° → kembali, siklus 5 detik — seperti kompas "mencari arah jawaban"</td></tr><tr><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2"><strong>bersamaan</strong></td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">🫁 <strong>Napas + glow</strong> (opsi 3)</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">Membesar-mengecil (1.0 ↔ 1.14) + bayangan oranye terracotta yang menguat-melemah, siklus 3.2 detik</td></tr><tr><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2"><strong>bersamaan</strong></td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">✨ <strong>Gelombang opasitas</strong> (opsi 5)</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">Kelap-kelip lembut 100% → 55% → 90% → 65%, siklus 4.6 detik</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p><strong>Detail teknis:</strong></p><ul>
<li>Ritme tiap animasi sengaja <strong>beda durasi</strong> (5s / 3.2s / 4.6s) → kombinasinya tidak pernah terlihat berulang persis, terasa organik</li>
<li>2 lapisan terpisah: rotasi di elemen luar, napas+glow+kedip di gambar dalam — tidak saling menimpa <code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">transform</code></li>
<li>Logo di-embed <strong>base64 inline</strong> (9KB) → tidak perlu request file terpisah, muncul instan</li>
<li>Ada <strong>fallback otomatis</strong> ke bintang ✳ lama kalau file logo terhapus</li>
<li>Murni CSS → tetap mulus selama 12 detik menunggu API</li>
</ul><p>Coba kirim pesan dan nikmati animasinya! Kalau ada yang mau disetel (ayunan lebih lebar/sempit, glow lebih kuat, kedip lebih pelan), tinggal sebut. 🖌️</p></div></div><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2"><div class="flex items-center gap-1"><div class="hover:bg-accent group flex items-center justify-center rounded-md p-1.5 transition-all" data-state="closed" data-slot="tooltip-trigger"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-interactive-positive transition-colors"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M12 1.25C6.06294 1.25 1.25 6.06294 1.25 12C1.25 17.9371 6.06294 22.75 12 22.75C17.9371 22.75 22.75 17.9371 22.75 12C22.75 6.06294 17.9371 1.25 12 1.25ZM7.53044 11.9697C7.23755 11.6768 6.76268 11.6768 6.46978 11.9697C6.17689 12.2626 6.17689 12.7374 6.46978 13.0303L9.46978 16.0303C9.76268 16.3232 10.2376 16.3232 10.5304 16.0303L17.5304 9.03033C17.8233 8.73744 17.8233 8.26256 17.5304 7.96967C17.2375 7.67678 16.7627 7.67678 16.4698 7.96967L10.0001 14.4393L7.53044 11.9697Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div><button type="button" aria-label="Copy" class="hover:bg-accent flex items-center justify-center rounded-md p-1.5 transition-all" data-state="closed" data-slot="tooltip-trigger"><svg width="14" height="14" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor"><path d="M19.4 20H9.6C9.26863 20 9 19.7314 9 19.4V9.6C9 9.26863 9.26863 9 9.6 9H19.4C19.7314 9 20 9.26863 20 9.6V19.4C20 19.7314 19.7314 20 19.4 20Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M15 9V4.6C15 4.26863 14.7314 4 14.4 4H4.6C4.26863 4 4 4.26863 4 4.6V14.4C4 14.7314 4.26863 15 4.6 15H9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></div></div><div><div class="group flex min-w-0 flex-col items-end gap-1"><div class="relative overflow-hidden bg-surface-raised rounded-lg w-fit max-w-[min(70%,768px)] border-transparent ml-0"><div class="px-3 text-text-primary body-base py-2"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><div class="prose prose-pre:bg-transparent prose-pre:p-0 text-wrap break-words prose-base body-base"><p>tapi kok logonya belum ganti</p></div></div></div></div><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-surface-primary disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 text-sm hover:bg-surface-tertiary focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:border-none font-normal relative text-text-secondary hover:text-text-primary size-3.5 flex-shrink-0 rounded-md p-1.5 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100" type="button"><svg width="14" height="14" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-interactive-positive absolute inset-0 m-auto rotate-90 opacity-0 transition-all duration-300"><path d="M5 13L9 17L19 7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><svg width="14" height="14" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="absolute inset-0 m-auto opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300"><path d="M19.4 20H9.6C9.26863 20 9 19.7314 9 19.4V9.6C9 9.26863 9.26863 9 9.6 9H19.4C19.7314 9 20 9.26863 20 9.6V19.4C20 19.7314 19.7314 20 19.4 20Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M15 9V4.6C15 4.26863 14.7314 4 14.4 4H4.6C4.26863 4 4 4.26863 4 4.6V14.4C4 14.7314 4.26863 15 4.6 15H9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button></div></div><div><div class="relative overflow-hidden bg-surface-primary rounded-xl border w-full border-transparent"><div class="px-3 pb-3"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><div><button type="button" aria-label="Expand" class="flex w-full select-none items-center gap-1.5 cursor-pointer" aria-expanded="false"><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-text-tertiary size-4 shrink-0"><path d="M13 16H18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M6 8L10 12L6 16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M2 18V6C2 4.89543 2.89543 4 4 4H20C21.1046 4 22 4.89543 22 6V18C22 19.1046 21.1046 20 20 20H4C2.89543 20 2 19.1046 2 18Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span class="flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1"><span class="text-text-tertiary body-sm leading-4">used</span><span class="text-text-secondary body-sm leading-4">Bash</span><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-interactive-positive size-4 shrink-0"><path d="M5 13L9 17L19 7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span class="text-text-tertiary shrink-0 font-mono text-[10px] leading-[1.2]">73ms</span></span><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-text-tertiary size-3 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="M6 9L12 15L18 9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button></div><div class="prose prose-pre:bg-transparent prose-pre:p-0 text-wrap break-words prose-base body-base"><p>File logo dan kodenya sudah benar. Kemungkinan masalahnya server lama belum memuat kode baru (auto-reload kadang butuh klik "Rerun"). Saya restart server dengan bersih supaya pasti:</p></div><div class="body-sm flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-text-tertiary size-3 shrink-0"><path d="M10.0503 10.6066L2.97923 17.6777C2.19818 18.4587 2.19818 19.7251 2.97923 20.5061V20.5061C3.76027 21.2872 5.0266 21.2872 5.80765 20.5061L12.8787 13.4351" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M17.1927 13.7994L21.071 17.6777C21.8521 18.4587 21.8521 19.7251 21.071 20.5061V20.5061C20.29 21.2872 19.0236 21.2872 18.2426 20.5061L12.0341 14.2977" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M6.73267 5.90381L4.61135 6.61092L2.49003 3.07539L3.90424 1.66117L7.43978 3.78249L6.73267 5.90381ZM6.73267 5.90381L9.5629 8.73404" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M10.0503 10.6066C9.2065 8.45359 9.37147 5.62861 11.111 3.8891C12.8505 2.14958 16.0607 1.76778 17.8285 2.82844L14.7878 5.86911L14.5052 8.98015L17.6162 8.69754L20.6569 5.65686C21.7176 7.42463 21.3358 10.6349 19.5963 12.3744C17.8567 14.1139 15.0318 14.2789 12.8788 13.435" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span class="text-text-secondary">stop_process</span></div><div class="text-text-primary rounded-md border border-border-faint bg-surface-secondary/50 shadow-none my-0"><button type="button" class="flex w-full items-center gap-2 bg-transparent px-2.5 py-2 text-left" aria-expanded="false"><span class="text-text-tertiary flex shrink-0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-play size-3.5"><polygon points="6 3 20 12 6 21 6 3"></polygon></svg></span><span class="body-sm text-text-secondary min-w-0 flex-1 truncate"><span class="flex min-w-0 items-center gap-2"><span class="truncate">Start Ampera Trinity AI</span><span class="text-text-muted shrink-0 font-mono text-xs tabular-nums">:8501</span></span></span><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-text-tertiary size-3 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="M9 6L15 12L9 18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-interactive-positive size-3"><path d="M5 13L9 17L19 7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button></div><div><button type="button" aria-label="Expand" class="flex w-full select-none items-center gap-1.5 cursor-pointer" aria-expanded="false"><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-text-tertiary size-4 shrink-0"><path d="M13 16H18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M6 8L10 12L6 16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M2 18V6C2 4.89543 2.89543 4 4 4H20C21.1046 4 22 4.89543 22 6V18C22 19.1046 21.1046 20 20 20H4C2.89543 20 2 19.1046 2 18Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span class="flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1"><span class="text-text-tertiary body-sm leading-4">used</span><span class="text-text-secondary body-sm leading-4">Bash</span><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-interactive-positive size-4 shrink-0"><path d="M5 13L9 17L19 7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span class="text-text-tertiary shrink-0 font-mono text-[10px] leading-[1.2]">3.1s</span></span><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-text-tertiary size-3 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="M6 9L12 15L18 9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button></div><div class="prose prose-pre:bg-transparent prose-pre:p-0 text-wrap break-words prose-base body-base"><p>✅ <strong>Sudah di-restart dengan bersih!</strong> Penyebabnya: server lama masih menjalankan kode versi sebelumnya (auto-reload Streamlit menunggu klik "Rerun" yang belum dilakukan). Sekarang server sudah fresh dengan kode terbaru yang memuat logo custom.</p><p><strong>Sekarang lakukan ini:</strong></p><ol>
<li><strong>Refresh penuh</strong> halaman preview (F5 / tarik ke bawah di HP)</li>
<li>Kirim pesan apa saja</li>
<li>Perhatikan indikator thinking — sekarang harusnya muncul <strong>logo bintang kompas + trisula</strong> yang:
<ul>
<li>berputar cepat 1 putaran saat muncul,</li>
<li>lalu berayun seperti pendulum,</li>
<li>sambil bernapas dengan glow oranye dan kelap-kelip lembut</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol><p>⚠️ <strong>Catatan penting kalau Anda mengetes di Streamlit Cloud</strong> (bukan preview sini): logo tidak akan muncul di sana sampai Anda <strong>upload folder <code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">assets/</code> ke repo GitHub</strong> juga — file yang dibutuhkan: <button type="button" class="not-prose border-border-medium bg-surface-secondary hover:bg-surface-tertiary hover:border-border-strong group my-0.5 inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded border px-1 py-0 text-left align-middle transition-colors"><img alt="" class="size-3.5 shrink-0 rounded-[2px] object-cover" loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="./logo_thinking_small_files/IQIK3YsctG69szqAAOtNNl4ao1-9KFZpJODg01u66Sk"><span class="text-text-secondary group-hover:text-text-primary truncate font-mono text-[12px] transition-colors">logo_thinking_small.png</span></button>. Tanpa file itu, app otomatis fallback ke bintang ✳ lama (tidak error).</p><p>Kalau setelah refresh masih bintang ✳ lama yang muncul, beri tahu saya Anda mengetes di mana (preview sini atau Streamlit Cloud) supaya saya arahkan solusinya. 🔍</p></div></div><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2"><div class="flex items-center gap-1"><div class="hover:bg-accent group flex items-center justify-center rounded-md p-1.5 transition-all" data-state="closed" data-slot="tooltip-trigger"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-interactive-positive transition-colors"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M12 1.25C6.06294 1.25 1.25 6.06294 1.25 12C1.25 17.9371 6.06294 22.75 12 22.75C17.9371 22.75 22.75 17.9371 22.75 12C22.75 6.06294 17.9371 1.25 12 1.25ZM7.53044 11.9697C7.23755 11.6768 6.76268 11.6768 6.46978 11.9697C6.17689 12.2626 6.17689 12.7374 6.46978 13.0303L9.46978 16.0303C9.76268 16.3232 10.2376 16.3232 10.5304 16.0303L17.5304 9.03033C17.8233 8.73744 17.8233 8.26256 17.5304 7.96967C17.2375 7.67678 16.7627 7.67678 16.4698 7.96967L10.0001 14.4393L7.53044 11.9697Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div><button type="button" aria-label="Copy" class="hover:bg-accent flex items-center justify-center rounded-md p-1.5 transition-all" data-state="closed" data-slot="tooltip-trigger"><svg width="14" height="14" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor"><path d="M19.4 20H9.6C9.26863 20 9 19.7314 9 19.4V9.6C9 9.26863 9.26863 9 9.6 9H19.4C19.7314 9 20 9.26863 20 9.6V19.4C20 19.7314 19.7314 20 19.4 20Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M15 9V4.6C15 4.26863 14.7314 4 14.4 4H4.6C4.26863 4 4 4.26863 4 4.6V14.4C4 14.7314 4.26863 15 4.6 15H9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></div></div><div><div class="group flex min-w-0 flex-col items-end gap-1"><div class="relative overflow-hidden bg-surface-raised rounded-lg w-fit max-w-[min(70%,768px)] border-transparent ml-0"><div class="px-3 text-text-primary body-base py-2"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><div class="prose prose-pre:bg-transparent prose-pre:p-0 text-wrap break-words prose-base body-base"><p>kalau gitu logonya dipasang ke semua nggak hanya di proses thinking, terus animasi logo thinkingnya untuk opsi 2 diganti pakai opsi 1 dan agak diperbesar</p></div></div></div></div><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-surface-primary disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 text-sm hover:bg-surface-tertiary focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:border-none font-normal relative text-text-secondary hover:text-text-primary size-3.5 flex-shrink-0 rounded-md p-1.5 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100" type="button"><svg width="14" height="14" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-interactive-positive absolute inset-0 m-auto rotate-90 opacity-0 transition-all duration-300"><path d="M5 13L9 17L19 7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><svg width="14" height="14" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="absolute inset-0 m-auto opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300"><path d="M19.4 20H9.6C9.26863 20 9 19.7314 9 19.4V9.6C9 9.26863 9.26863 9 9.6 9H19.4C19.7314 9 20 9.26863 20 9.6V19.4C20 19.7314 19.7314 20 19.4 20Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M15 9V4.6C15 4.26863 14.7314 4 14.4 4H4.6C4.26863 4 4 4.26863 4 4.6V14.4C4 14.7314 4.26863 15 4.6 15H9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button></div></div><div><div class="relative overflow-hidden bg-surface-primary rounded-xl border w-full border-transparent"><div class="px-3 pb-3"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><div class="prose prose-pre:bg-transparent prose-pre:p-0 text-wrap break-words prose-base body-base"><p>Siap! 3 perubahan: logo dipasang di semua tempat (sapaan awal, label Yuki, progress gambar), animasi pendulum diganti <strong>putaran pelan kontinu</strong> (opsi 1), dan ukurannya diperbesar.</p></div><div><div class="body-sm flex items-center gap-1.5"><button type="button" class="text-text-tertiary hover:text-text-secondary shrink-0 p-0.5" aria-label="Expand" aria-expanded="false"><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="size-3 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="M9 6L15 12L9 18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button><span class="shrink-0 text-text-secondary">Edit</span><button type="button" class="bg-surface-tertiary text-text-tertiary hover:text-text-secondary truncate rounded-sm px-1 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] leading-tight">ampera-trinity-ai/app.py</button></div></div><div class="prose prose-pre:bg-transparent prose-pre:p-0 text-wrap break-words prose-base body-base"><p>Sekarang buat helper logo dan pasang di semua tempat. Pertama, helper umum:</p></div><div><div class="body-sm flex items-center gap-1.5"><button type="button" class="text-text-tertiary hover:text-text-secondary shrink-0 p-0.5" aria-label="Expand" aria-expanded="false"><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="size-3 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="M9 6L15 12L9 18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button><span class="shrink-0 text-text-secondary">Edit</span><button type="button" class="bg-surface-tertiary text-text-tertiary hover:text-text-secondary truncate rounded-sm px-1 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] leading-tight">ampera-trinity-ai/app.py</button></div></div><div class="prose prose-pre:bg-transparent prose-pre:p-0 text-wrap break-words prose-base body-base"><p>Sekarang pasang logo di sapaan awal (menggantikan ✳):</p></div><div><div class="body-sm flex items-center gap-1.5"><button type="button" class="text-text-tertiary hover:text-text-secondary shrink-0 p-0.5" aria-label="Expand" aria-expanded="false"><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="size-3 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="M9 6L15 12L9 18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button><span class="shrink-0 text-text-secondary">Edit</span><button type="button" class="bg-surface-tertiary text-text-tertiary hover:text-