class="text-interactive-positive size-3"><path d="M5 13L9 17L19 7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button></div><div><button type="button" aria-label="Expand" class="flex w-full select-none items-center gap-1.5 cursor-pointer" aria-expanded="false"><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-text-tertiary size-4 shrink-0"><path d="M13 16H18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M6 8L10 12L6 16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M2 18V6C2 4.89543 2.89543 4 4 4H20C21.1046 4 22 4.89543 22 6V18C22 19.1046 21.1046 20 20 20H4C2.89543 20 2 19.1046 2 18Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span class="flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1"><span class="text-text-tertiary body-sm leading-4">used</span><span class="text-text-secondary body-sm leading-4">Bash</span><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-interactive-positive size-4 shrink-0"><path d="M5 13L9 17L19 7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span class="text-text-tertiary shrink-0 font-mono text-[10px] leading-[1.2]">3.3s</span></span><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-text-tertiary size-3 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="M6 9L12 15L18 9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button></div><div class="prose prose-pre:bg-transparent prose-pre:p-0 text-wrap break-words prose-base body-base"><p>✅ <strong>Selesai! Semua sudah terpasang</strong> — server sudah di-restart bersih, refresh penuh halaman preview.</p><h2>🔱 Logo custom sekarang dipakai di 4 tempat:</h2><div class="overflow-x-auto"><table node="[object Object]" class="min-w-full"><thead><tr><th node="[object Object]" class="whitespace-nowrap px-3 py-2">Tempat</th><th node="[object Object]" class="whitespace-nowrap px-3 py-2">Ukuran</th><th node="[object Object]" class="whitespace-nowrap px-3 py-2">Animasi</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2"><strong>Sapaan awal</strong> ("Semangat lagi!")</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">44px (besar)</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">Putaran pelan kontinu 8 detik</td></tr><tr><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2"><strong>Thinking indicator</strong></td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2"><strong>34px</strong> (diperbesar dari 24px)</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">Koreografi penuh: intro spin cepat → putar pelan + napas + glow + kelap-kelip</td></tr><tr><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2"><strong>Label "Yuki"</strong> di atas tiap jawaban</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">16px (kecil)</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">Diam (statis, biar tidak ramai saat membaca)</td></tr><tr><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2"><strong>Progress bar gambar</strong></td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">22px</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">Putar pelan + napas &amp; glow</td></tr></tbody></table></div><h2>🎬 Animasi thinking (revisi sesuai permintaan):</h2><div class="overflow-x-auto"><table node="[object Object]" class="min-w-full"><thead><tr><th node="[object Object]" class="whitespace-nowrap px-3 py-2">Fase</th><th node="[object Object]" class="whitespace-nowrap px-3 py-2">Animasi</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">0 – 0.8 dtk</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">🌀 Intro spin cepat 1 putaran (opsi 4)</td></tr><tr><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">Setelahnya</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">🔄 <strong>Putaran pelan kontinu</strong> — 1 putaran / 8 detik (<strong>opsi 1</strong>, menggantikan pendulum)</td></tr><tr><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">Bersamaan</td><td node="[object Object]" class="px-3 py-2">🫁 Napas + glow terracotta (opsi 3) + ✨ gelombang opasitas (opsi 5)</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Bentuk kompas 8-arah memang paling cantik saat berputar penuh — pilihan tepat! 👍</p><p><strong>Catatan untuk deploy ke Streamlit Cloud:</strong> jangan lupa upload folder <code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">assets/</code> (minimal file <code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">logo_thinking_small.png</code>) ke repo GitHub, karena semua tempat di atas memakainya (fallback tetap ✳ kalau file tidak ada, jadi tidak akan error).</p><p>Coba lihat: halaman awal (logo besar berputar pelan di samping "Semangat lagi!"), kirim pesan (logo 34px dengan koreografi penuh), dan mode gambar (logo di kartu progress). Ada yang mau disetel lagi? 🖌️</p></div></div><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2"><div class="flex items-center gap-1"><div class="hover:bg-accent group flex items-center justify-center rounded-md p-1.5 transition-all" data-state="closed" data-slot="tooltip-trigger"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-interactive-positive transition-colors"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M12 1.25C6.06294 1.25 1.25 6.06294 1.25 12C1.25 17.9371 6.06294 22.75 12 22.75C17.9371 22.75 22.75 17.9371 22.75 12C22.75 6.06294 17.9371 1.25 12 1.25ZM7.53044 11.9697C7.23755 11.6768 6.76268 11.6768 6.46978 11.9697C6.17689 12.2626 6.17689 12.7374 6.46978 13.0303L9.46978 16.0303C9.76268 16.3232 10.2376 16.3232 