h d="M13 16H18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M6 8L10 12L6 16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M2 18V6C2 4.89543 2.89543 4 4 4H20C21.1046 4 22 4.89543 22 6V18C22 19.1046 21.1046 20 20 20H4C2.89543 20 2 19.1046 2 18Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span class="flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1"><span class="text-text-tertiary body-sm leading-4">used</span><span class="text-text-secondary body-sm leading-4">Bash</span><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-interactive-positive size-4 shrink-0"><path d="M5 13L9 17L19 7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span class="text-text-tertiary shrink-0 font-mono text-[10px] leading-[1.2]">86ms</span></span><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-text-tertiary size-3 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="M6 9L12 15L18 9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button></div><div class="prose prose-pre:bg-transparent prose-pre:p-0 text-wrap break-words prose-base body-base"><p>File dan fungsinya normal di sini. Saya tes langsung apakah HTML yang dihasilkan app benar-benar memuat logo:</p></div><div><button type="button" aria-label="Expand" class="flex w-full select-none items-center gap-1.5 cursor-pointer" aria-expanded="false"><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-text-tertiary size-4 shrink-0"><path d="M13 16H18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M6 8L10 12L6 16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M2 18V6C2 4.89543 2.89543 4 4 4H20C21.1046 4 22 4.89543 22 6V18C22 19.1046 21.1046 20 20 20H4C2.89543 20 2 19.1046 2 18Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span class="flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1"><span class="text-text-tertiary body-sm leading-4">used</span><span class="text-text-secondary body-sm leading-4">Bash</span><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-interactive-positive size-4 shrink-0"><path d="M5 13L9 17L19 7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span class="text-text-tertiary shrink-0 font-mono text-[10px] leading-[1.2]">2.2s</span></span><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-text-tertiary size-3 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="M6 9L12 15L18 9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button></div><div class="prose prose-pre:bg-transparent prose-pre:p-0 text-wrap break-words prose-base body-base"><p>✅ <strong>Hasil pengecekan: kode di sini sudah benar</strong> — saya baru saja menguji app secara langsung dan HTML halaman <strong>sudah memuat logo custom</strong> (base64 PNG ada di sapaan &amp; thinking). Berarti masalahnya bukan di kode, tapi di <strong>tempat Anda mengetes</strong>.</p><p>Bintang ✳ yang Anda lihat itu adalah <strong>fallback otomatis</strong> — muncul hanya kalau file <code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">assets/logo_thinking_small.png</code> <strong>tidak ditemukan</strong>. Jadi ada 2 kemungkinan:</p><p><strong>Kemungkinan 1 — Anda mengetes di Streamlit Cloud (deploy publik)</strong> ☁️ <em>(paling mungkin)</em><br>
Repo GitHub Anda <strong>belum berisi folder <code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">assets/</code></strong>, jadi app di cloud tidak menemukan logonya dan memakai fallback ✳.</p><p><strong>Solusinya:</strong></p><ol>
<li>Download file logo dari workspace di sini: <button type="button" class="not-prose border-border-medium bg-surface-secondary hover:bg-surface-tertiary hover:border-border-strong group my-0.5 inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded border px-1 py-0 text-left align-middle transition-colors"><img alt="" class="size-3.5 shrink-0 rounded-[2px] object-cover" loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="./logo_thinking_small_files/IQIK3YsctG69szqAAOtNNl4ao1-9KFZpJODg01u66Sk"><span class="text-text-secondary group-hover:text-text-primary truncate font-mono text-[12px] transition-colors">logo_thinking_small.png</span></button> (buka di viewer file → download)</li>
<li>Upload ke repo GitHub Anda dengan struktur yang sama:
<pre><div class="not-prose my-0 flex w-full flex-col overflow-clip border border-border text-text-primary rounded-lg not-prose relative" data-code-block="true"><div class="border-border flex items-center justify-between border-b px-4 py-2"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg width="14" stroke-width="1.5" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-text-secondary"><path d="M9.00001 21L8.00001 21C6.89544 21 6.00001 20.1057 6.00001 19.0011C6.00001 17.4501 6.00001 15.3443 6 14C6 13 4.5 12 4.5 12C4.5 12 6.00001 11 6.00001 10C6.00001 8.827 6.00001 6.62207 6.00001 4.99914C6.00001 3.89457 6.89544 3 8.00001 3L9.00001 3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M15 21L16 21C17.1046 21 18 20.1057 18 19.0011C18 17.4501 18 15.3443 18 14C18 13 19.5 12 19.5 12C19.5 12 18 11 18 10C18 8.827 18 6.62207 18 4.99914C18 3.89457 17.1046 3 16 3L15 3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span class="text-text-secondary text-sm font-medium">text</span></div><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-surface-primary disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 text-sm text-interactive-active hover:text-interactive-normal active:text-text-tertiary font-normal relative rounded-lg p-[6px]" type="button" data-state="closed" data-slot="tooltip-trigger"><svg width="16" height="16" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-interactive-positive absolute inset-0 m-auto rotate-90 opacity-0 transition-all duration-300"><path d="M5 13L9 17L19 7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><svg width="16" height="16" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="absolute inset-0 m-auto opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300"><path d="M19.4 20H9.6C9.26863 20 9 19.7314 9 19.4V9.6C9 9.26863 9.26863 9 9.6 9H19.4C19.7314 9 20 9.26863 20 9.6V19.4C20 19.7314 19.7314 20 19.4 20Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M15 9V4.6C15 4.26863 14.7314 4 14.4 4H4.6C4.26863 4 4 4.26863 4 4.6V14.4C4 14.7314 4.26863 15 4.6 15H9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button></div><div class="code-block_container__lbMX4"><pre class="shiki github-dark shiki-code-block" style="background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8" tabindex="0"><code class="whitespace-pre-wrap break-words"><span class="line"><span>ampera-trinity-ai/</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>├── app.py</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>└── assets/</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>    └── logo_thinking_small.png   ← wajib ada</span></span></code></pre></div></div></pre>
</li>
<li>Pastikan <code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">app.py</code> di repo juga <strong>versi terbaru</strong> (yang ada fungsi <code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">logo_img_html</code>)</li>
<li>Tunggu Streamlit Cloud redeploy</li>
</ol><p><strong>Kemungkinan 2 — Preview di sini tapi cache lama</strong> 🔄<br>
Kalau Anda mengetes di preview sini: lakukan <strong>hard refresh</strong> (Ctrl+Shift+R di desktop, atau tutup-buka tab preview). Kadang browser menyimpan render lama.</p><p><strong>Cara memastikan di mana masalahnya:</strong> lihat alamat URL halaman yang Anda screenshot — kalau ada <code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">streamlit.app</code> berarti itu deploy cloud Anda (→ ikuti solusi 1), kalau <code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">e2b.app</code> berarti preview sini (→ hard refresh).</p><p>Anda mengetesnya di mana? Kalau di cloud dan butuh, saya bisa siapkan juga file <code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">app.py</code> + <code class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-surface-tertiary font-mono text-[0.9em] text-text-primary font-medium" node="[object Object]">assets/</code> dalam struktur folder siap-upload. 📦</p></div></div><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2"><div class="flex items-center gap-1"><button type="button" aria-label="Copy" class="hover:bg-accent flex items-center justify-center rounded-md p-1.5 transition-all" data-state="closed" data-slot="tooltip-trigger"><svg width="14" height="14" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor"><path d="M19.4 20H9.6C9.26863 20 9 19.7314 9 19.4V9.6C9 9.26863 9.26863 9 9.6 9H19.4C19.7314 9 20 9.26863 20 9.6V19.4C20 19.7314 19.7314 20 19.4 20Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M15 9V4.6C15 4.26863 14.7314 4 14.4 4H4.6C4.26863 4 4 4.26863 4 4.6V14.4C4 14.7314 4.26863 15 4.6 15H9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></div><div class="h-px w-full" data-